in the editor with fast, footprint-free blocks. Everything you build translates with Tranzly.'=>'Zana shafuka kai tsaye a cikin edita tare da manyan gine-gine masu sauri da marasa alamar bincike. Komai da kuka gina yana fassara tare da Tranzly.','%s is made by the same team and works alongside this plugin.'=>'%s kungiyar ta yi kuma tana aiki tare da wannan plugin din.','Agree to connecting this site first.'=>'Yi yarda da haɗa wannan shafin da farko.','Enter a valid e-mail address.'=>'Shigar da ingantacciyar adireshin imel.','Agree to sending support information first.'=>'Yi amincewa da aiko da bayanan tallafi tukuna.','Write a subject and a message.'=>'Rubuta jigo da sako.','Enter an e-mail address support can reply to.'=>'Shigar da adireshin imel da sashen goyon baya zai iya ba da amsa.','AI providers'=>'Masu ba da sabis na AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Masu aikata ChatGPT. Kwararren mai yin komai sosai.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Masu ƙirƙirar Claude. Suna da ƙarfi wajen rubutawa kuma suna da hankali wajen yin la\'akari.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Samfurin Gemini na Google. Masu sauri da rahusa.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Wani kamfanin AI na Turai mai sauri da arha samfura.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Samfuran mai sauƙi waɗanda ke da kyau wajen rubutu da lissafi.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Maɓalli guda ɗaya don samfuran daga masu samarwa daban-daban.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Duk wani sabis da ke aiki kamar API na OpenAI, gami da samfurin da ke aiki akan kwamfutarka ko uwar garken ka.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Gabaɗaya (ana amfani da shi lokacin da babu takamaiman abin da aka saita)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Rubuta da sake rubutawa','Translation'=>'Fassara','Code and CSS'=>'Lamba da CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba a ba ka izinin shiga wannan shafin ba.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Wadannan saitunan suna da alaƙa da kowane plugin da ke amfani da su: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'An ɓoye Maɓallanka a cikin bayanan wannan shafin kuma ana aika su ne kawai zuwa ga mai ba da sabis da kuka zaɓa - ba za a taba aika su gare mu ba.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Mataki na 1 na 2: zabi mai ba da sabis na AI','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Kuna kawo naku key, don haka kuna biyan mai ba da sabis ɗin kai tsaye don abin da kuka yi amfani da shi. Ba ku da tabbas? Ko wanne daga cikin waɗannan yana aiki sosai; za ku iya ƙara ƙarin daga baya.','Next'=>'Na gaba','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Mataki na 2 na 2: haɗa %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Shigar da adireshin sabis ɗin da ke da jituwa da OpenAI, wanda ya ƙare da /v1. Ana buƙatar maɓalli ne kawai idan sabis ɗin ya nemi ɗaya.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Buɗe %s sannan ka shiga (ko ka ƙirƙiri sabon ajiya kyauta).','the %s API keys page'=>'shafin mabulsan API na %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Ƙirƙiri sabuwar maɓalli sannan ka kwafi ita.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Li manna shi a kasa sannan a danna "Ajiye a gwada". Muna tura karamin buƙatu guda ɗaya don bincika yana aiki.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Yawancin masu ba da sabis suna buƙatar ɗan kuɗi a cikin asusun kafin maɓalli ya yi aiki: %s.','add credit'=>'ƙara bashi','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Zabi wani mai ba da sabis daban','Address'=>'Adireshin','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Aɓuƙan da aka ajiye yana ƙarewa a …%s — liƙa sabo don maye gurbin sa','Key (optional)'=>'Maɓalli (zaɓi)','API key'=>'Maɓallin API','Save and test'=>'Ajiye kuma a gwada','Providers'=>'Masu bada sabis','Provider'=>'Mai ba da sabis','Status'=>'Matsayi','Key'=>'Maɓalli','Get a key'=>'Samu maɓalli','Test'=>'Gwaji','Remove'=>'Cire','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Wanda wani sabon sigar plugin ya adana: sabunta wannan plugin ɗin, ko kuma a sake shigar da mabudin.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ba za a iya buɗe maɓallin da aka ajiye ba kuma (an canza maɓallin tsaro na shafin). Shigar da shi sake.','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'An haɗa — gwajin ƙarshe ya yi nasara %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Gwajin da ya gabata ya gaza: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'An haɗa — ba a gwada ba tukuna','Which model to use'=>'Wane model za a yi amfani da shi','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ yana nuna shawararmu don wannan aikin. Jerin ya ƙunshi kowane samfurin da maɓallinku zai iya amfani da shi, wanda aka karanta kai tsaye daga mai bada sabis ɗin.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— An ba da shawarar ga mai bada sabis —','Save models'=>'Ajiye samfura','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sabunta jerin samfuran daga masu samarwa','Images'=>'Hotuna','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Haɗa OpenAI ko Google Gemini don yin hotuna.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Sabon samfurin hoto na farko na mai ba da sabis da aka haɗa —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Binciken shafin ( embeddings)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'Haɗa Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko OpenRouter don gina fihirisar bincike na shafin ku.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Sabon samfurin sakawa na farko wanda aka haɗa —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Canza wannan yana sake gina fihirisar bincike ta kowane plugin da ke amfani da ita.','best quality'=>'mafi kyau','lowest cost'=>'mafi ƙarancin farashi','fastest'=>'mafi sauri','Add a model yourself'=>'Ƙara samfuri da kanka','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'An fitar da sabon samfuri a yau? Manna daidai sunansa don amfani da shi nan take.','Model name'=>'Sunan samfurin','Add model'=>'Ƙara samfurin','Recommended models list'=>'Jerin samfuran da aka ba da shawarar','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Ba a iya tabbatar da jerin samfuran da aka ba da shawarar ba, don haka ba a nuna shawarwari ba. Sake shigar da plugin ɗin, ko kuma kunna sabuntawa na yau da kullum a ƙasa.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Jerin da ake amfani da shi an wallafa shi ne a ranar %s. Kowane sabuntawar kari (plugin) yana kawo sabon guda ɗaya.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Hakanan a bincika Zinn Digital® sau ɗaya a rana don samun sabon jerin sunaye.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ana aika da sauƙaƙe buƙatar saukarwa kawai: babu makulli, babu adireshin shafin, babu wani abu game da abun ciki naka. An sanya hannu kan jerin, kuma an yi watsi da jerin da ya kasa binciken sa hannu.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'An bincika karshe a %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Ajiye, sannan a duba yanzu idan an kunna','a newer list was installed'=>'an shigar da sabon jerin sunaye','already up to date'=>'rigakafi da sabuntawa','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'zazzakunan sun gaza wuce gwajin sa hannu kuma an yi watsi da su','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Ba za a iya isa ga Zinn Digital® ba; jerin na yanzu zai ci gaba da amfani','turned off'=>'an kashe','Open'=>'Buɗe','Check their status page'=>'Bincika shafin yanayin su','Open your billing page'=>'Buɗe shafin kuɗi naka','Open your API keys page'=>'Buɗe shafin maɓallan API naka','Open the AI settings'=>'Buɗe saitunan AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba a ba ka izinin yin hakan ba.','Unknown provider.'=>'Ba a san mai ba da sabis ba.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Shigar da adireshin sabis ɗinku, alal misali http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Wannan ba ya yi kama da maɓallin API ba. Sake kwafin sa, ba tare da guraben sarari ba.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Da farko a liƙa maɓallin API ɗinka.','Key removed.'=>'An cire maɓallin.','Models saved.'=>'An adana samfuran.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Shigar dainiyar sunan samfurin, misali yadda takardun bayanin mai ba da sabis suka rubuta shi.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'An ƙara %s. Zaɓi shi a ƙarƙashin "Wane samfuri za a yi amfani da shi".','Model removed.'=>'An cire samfurin.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'An kashe sabuntawa kullum. Ana amfani da jerin da ya zo tare da plugin din.','Checked: %s.'=>'An Duba: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'An sabunta jerin samfuran.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Wani sabon sigar na ɗaya daga cikin plugins ɗinka ya adana maɓallin AI ɗinka. Sabunta wannan plugin ɗin, ko kuma ka sake shigar da maɓallin a cikin saitunan AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Ba za a iya buɗe maɓallin AI ɗinka da aka ajiyage ba (maɓallan tsaron rukunin yanar gizon sun canza). Sake shigar da shi a cikin saitunan AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a saita AI ba tukuna. Ƙara maɓalli don mai ba da AI a cikin saitunan AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a zaɓi samfurin ba don wannan aikin. Zaɓi ɗaya a cikin saitunan AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Wannan mai ba da sabis na AI ba a goyi bayansa da wannan sigar ta plugin ba.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a haɗa wani mai samar da AI da zai iya ƙirƙirar hotuna ba. Ƙara maɓalli na OpenAI ko Google Gemini a cikin saitunan AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan mai ba da sabis na AI ba zai iya yin hotuna ba. Zaɓi OpenAI ko Google Gemini don hotuna a cikin saitunan AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Ba za a iya amfani da mabudin AI naka tare da wani samfurin hoto ba. Duba izinin mabudin tare da mai ba da sabis din, ko zaɓi wani mai ba da sabis din don hotuna.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Babu wani mai samar da AI da aka haɗa da zai iya gina fihirisar bincike. Ƙara maɓallin Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko OpenRouter a cikin saitunan AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Maɓallin AI ɗinka ba zai iya amfani da kowane samfurin sakawa ba. Bincika izinin maɓallin tare da mai bada sabis ɗin, ko zaɓi wani mai bada sabis daban don binciken shafin.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Wannan mai ba da sabis na AI ba zai iya gina fihirisar bincike ba. Haɗa Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko sabis ɗin da ya dace don binciken shafin.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Wannan shafin bai iya tuntuɓar sabis ɗin AI naka ba. Bincika cewa yana aiki kuma ana iya isa ga adireshinsa daga sabar gidan yanar gizon ku (sabis da ke kan kwamfutarka ba zai iya isa ba daga shafin da aka karɓa).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Wannan shafin bai iya isa ga %s ba. Duba shafin matsayinsu; idan suna aiki, mai masaukin ku na iya toshe haɗin da ke fita, ko kuma adireshin ba daidai bane.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s ya ce asusunka ba shi da kuɗi ko kuma adadin da ya rage. Ƙara kuɗi ko ɗaga iyakar a cikin asusunka tare da su, sannan a sake gwadawa.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s bai karɓi makullin ku ba. Wataƙila an rubuta shi ba daidai ba, an soke shi ko kuma ya ƙare. Ƙirƙiri sabon maɓalli sannan ka manna shi a nan.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s ya ki amincewa da wannan buƙatar don maɓallinka. Wataƙila maɓallin ba shi da damar shiga wannan samfurin ko fasalin, ko kuma asusunka yana buƙatar tabbatarwa.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Samfurin "%1$s" ba ya samuwa daga %2$s don maɓallin ku. Zaɓi wani samfuri a cikin saitunan AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Tsarin ku na %2$s bai haɗa da samfurin "%1$s" ba. Zaɓi wani samfurin a cikin saitunan AI, ko haɓaka tsarin ku tare da su.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s tana iyakance saurin da makullin ku ke iya aika buƙatu. Jira minti ɗaya kuma sake gwadawa, ko ku ɗaga iyakacin ƙimar ku tare da su.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s yana fuskantar matsaloli a halin yanzu (akwai katsewa ko kuma cunkoso a gefensu). Babu wani abu da ba daidai ba tare da saitunanka. Gwada sake nan ba da dadewa ba.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Om karakteristik AI ta gaza saboda dalilin da ba za mu iya gane shi ba. Sake gwadawa; idan hakan ta ci gaba da faruwa, tuntuɓi sashen goyon baya tare da cikakkun bayanan da ke ƙasa.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Mai ba da sabis na AI ya ba da amsa a wata sifa da wannan plugin ɗin bai iya karantawa ba. Sake gwadawa; idan hakan ya ci gaba da faruwa, zaɓi wani samfurin ko tuntuɓi goyon baya.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Keɓaɓɓe (Mai jituwa da OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Farko a adana maɓalli don wannan mai ba da sabis.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Maɓallin ku yana aiki, amma mai ba da sabis ɗin bai lissafa wani samfurin rubutu don shi ba. Ƙara wani samfurin da kanka a ƙasa.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'An haɗa. %1$s ya/ta amsa ta amfani da %2$s. Siffofin AI ɗinka suna shirye don amfani.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Ba a ba matsayin mai amfani da ku izinin amfani da AI a wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba. Tambayi mai gudanarwa.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan shafin ya kai iyakar kasafin kuɗinsa na AI na wata-wata. Mai gudanarwa zai iya ƙara shi a cikin saitunan AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan shafin ya kai iyakar buƙatunsa na AI na wata-wata. Mai gudanarwa zai iya ƙara ta a cikin saitunan AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Amfani da kuma tsada','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Rubutun shiga, iyakoki da izinin matsayi suna aiki kan AI da ake amfani da ita ta: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Kudin sun kusa zama daidai, an lissafa su ne daga farashin da aka buga; samfurin da babu wani sanannen farashi yana da darajar sifili.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Wannan wata: buƙatun %1$s, kimanin %2$s.','When'=>'Lokacin da','Who'=>'Waye','Used for'=>'A yi amfani da shi don','Model'=>'Samfurin','Tokens in / out'=>'Alamar shiga / fita','About'=>'Game da Mu','Result'=>'Sakamako','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Ba a yi roƙon AI ko ɗaya ba tuƙuna.','Done'=>'An gama','Limits and permissions'=>'Iyakoki da izini','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Iyakar kashe kuɗi ta wata-wata (US dollars)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Bar shi babu komai don babu iyaka. AI zai tsaya na sauran watan da zarar kudin da aka kiyasta sun kai wurin.','Monthly request limit'=>'Iyakokin buƙatu na kowane wata','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Bar shi a ba komai don babu iyaka.','Who may use AI'=>'Wane ne zai iya amfani da AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Cirewa ba tare da zabi ba don barin kowa wanda zai iya amfani da fasalullukan plugin ɗin ya yi amfani da AI. Masu gudanarwa za su iya amfani da shi kowane lokaci.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Ajiye iyakoki da izini','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'An adadin da izini an adana.','Security error, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Kuskuren tsaro, don Allah sake loda shafin kuma a sake gwadawa.','Missing newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Saitunan wasiƙar labarai sun ɓace. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi mai gudanarwa.','Invalid newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Saitunan jaridar labarai ba su da inganci. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi mai kula da tsarin.','Invalid email address.'=>'Anwani ta imel ba daidai ba ce.','Please tick the box to agree before subscribing.'=>'Da fat za a yi alamar akwatin domin amincewa kafin a yi rajista.','Too many attempts. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Kokarin da yawa. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa bayan \'yan mintoci kaɗan.','Something went wrong. Please contact the admin.'=>'Wani abu ya lalace. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi mai gudanarwa.','Map'=>'Taswira','Background video'=>'Bidiyon bango','%1$s: %2$d font files stored, stylesheet %3$s'=>'%1$s: Fayilolin rubutu %2$d da aka adana, takardar salo %3$s','That family is not stored.'=>'Ba a adana wannan iyalin ba.','Removed.'=>'An cire.','That is not a valid font family name.'=>'Wannan ba ingantaccen sunan iyalin rubutu ba ne.','Google Fonts did not return that family. Check the name and try again.'=>'Google Fonts bai dawo da wannan iyalin ba. Duba sunan sannan a sake gwadawa.','The font files could not be downloaded or saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Ba a iya sauke ko adana fayilolin rubutun ba. Tabbatar cewa foldar loda tana da ikon rubutawa.','The font stylesheet could not be saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Ba a iya adana takardar salon haruffa (font stylesheet) ba. Duba ko babban fayil din loda abubuwa (uploads folder) yana da ikon karɓar rubutu.','Dismiss this notice'=>'Kora da wannan sanarwa','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yana buɗe a sabon shafin)','Done:'=>'An gama:','To do:'=>'Abin yi:','Glossary index'=>'Manunin ƙamus','Rated %1$s out of %2$s'=>'An kiyasta %1$s cikin %2$s','Progress'=>'Ci gaba','%s%%'=>'%s%%','Copy code'=>'Kwafi lambar','Copied'=>'An kwafi','That widget is not available on this site.'=>'Wancan widget din ba ya samuwa a wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','Email'=>'Imel','Phone'=>'Waya','RSS feed'=>'Tashar RSS','Website'=>'Shafin yanar gizo','Link'=>'Haɗi','%s (opens in a new tab)'=>'%s (yana buɗe a sabon shafin)','Rated %d out of 5'=>'An kima da %d daga cikin 5','(recommended)'=>'(an ba da shawarar)','Included'=>'An haɗa','Not included'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Comparison table'=>'Tabbatar kwatanta','Call %s'=>'Kira %s','Email %s'=>'Imel %s','Text %s'=>'Rubutu %s','Chat on WhatsApp'=>'Yi hira a WhatsApp','Contact us'=>'Tuntuɓe mu','Chat with us on WhatsApp'=>'Yi hira da mu a WhatsApp','This form is not available right now.'=>'Ba a samun wannan fom a yanzu.','This form cannot be shown because %s is not active.'=>'Ba za a iya nuna wannan fom ba domin %s ba ya aiki.','Map: %s'=>'Taswira: %s','Showing the map loads it from OpenStreetMap.'=>'Nuna taswirar na loda ta ne daga OpenStreetMap.','Show the map'=>'Nuna taswirar','Open the map on OpenStreetMap'=>'Bude taswirar a kan OpenStreetMap','Booking calendar from %s'=>'Kalandar ajiyar wuri daga %s','Showing the booking calendar loads it from %s.'=>'Nunna kalandar ajiyar wuri yana lodi daga %s.','Show the booking calendar'=>'Nuna kalandar ajiyar wuri','Book on %s'=>'Yi Littafi a kan %s','QR code for %s'=>'Lambar QR don %s','Design'=>'Tsara Design','Content'=>'Abun ciki','Media'=>'Watsa labarai','Marketing'=>'Tallace-tallace','Site'=>'Shafi\'i','Data'=>'Bayanan','Affiliate & iGaming'=>'Affiliate da iGaming','Related posts'=>'Rubututtuka masu alaƙa','Post details'=>'Bayanan sako','By'=>'Ta hanyar','Published'=>'An buga','Updated'=>'An sabunta','In'=>'Ciki','Tagged'=>'An saka alama','%d minute read'=>'minti %d karatu' . "\0" . 'Mintuna %d na karatu','No comments yet'=>'Babu Sharhi tukuna','%d comment'=>'Sharhi %d' . "\0" . 'ra\'ayoyi %d','Sitemap'=>'Taswirar rukunin yanar gizo','(no title)'=>'(babu lakabi)','All posts by %s'=>'Duk rubutun da %s ya yi','This content is protected. Enter the password to see it.'=>'Wannan abun ciki yana da kariya. Shigar da kalmar sirri don ganin shi.','That password is not right. Try again.'=>'Waccan kalmar sirri ba daidai ba ce. Sake gwadawa.','Password'=>'Kalmar sirri','Show the content'=>'Nuna abinda ke ciki','That page cannot be unlocked.'=>'Ba za a iya buɗe wannan shafin ba.','Too many tries. Wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Ƙoƙari da yawa. Jira ƴan mintuna kaɗan sannan ka sake gwadawa.','The password must be 4 to 200 characters long.'=>'Dole ne kalmar sirrin ta kasance tsakanin haruffa 4 zuwa 200.','More'=>'Ƙari','Close'=>'Rufe','Tab %d'=>'Shafi %d','Contents'=>'Abubuwan da ke ciki','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Babu rubutun allo na mai gudanarwa a cikin wannan kwafin na plugin ɗin. Sake shigar da shi daga fakitin da aka fitar.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Wannan allon yana buƙatar JavaScript.','Languages'=>'Harsuna','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Kai abokin huldar hosting ne? Samu rangwamen %1$d%% a kan %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'A matsayinka na abokin ciniki mai karɓar baƙi na Zinn Digital®, kana samun lambar sirri don samun rangwamen %d%% a kan biyan kuɗinka na farko. Sabuntawa suna kan farashin al\'ada.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Sami lambar %d%% ta kuma je wurin biya','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Wannan rangwamen na abokan ciniki ne masu tsarin daukar shafukan yanar gizo da suka biya kuma ba su da wata matsala. Gwaje-gwaje kyauta ba sa cancanta.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Kun riga kun yi amfani da rangwamen abokin ciniki na masaukin yanar gizo don wannan plugin.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba mu iya samun lambar ku ba a yanzu. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa bayan \'yan mintoci kaɗan.','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Dole ne prefix ya zama haruffa ƙanana 1 zuwa 8 ko lambobi, ya kafa da harshe, kuma kada ya sanya wa plugin suna.','The kit could not be read. Try again later.'=>'Ba a iya karanta kit din ba. Sake gwadawa nan gaba.','This kit comes with Page Builder Sandwich Pro.'=>'Wannan kayan aiki yana zuwa tare da Page Builder Sandwich Pro.','The kit library could not be reached. Check this site can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Ba a iya samun damar ɗakin karatu na kit ɗin ba. Duba cewa wannan rukunin yanar gizon zai iya yin haɗin waje, sannan a sake gwadawa.','The kit library refused the request.'=>'Laburaren kayan aiki ya ki amincewa da buƙatar.','Page Builder Sandwich sections'=>'Sashen Page Builder Sandwich','Ready-made sections from Page Builder Sandwich.'=>'Sassan da aka riga aka hada daga Page Builder Sandwich.','%1$s (%2$s)'=>'%1$s (%2$s)','Casino Guide'=>'Jagorar Gidan Caca','This month\'s top-rated casinos'=>'Casinos da akafi rating a wannan watan','Scores come from our own tests. Bonuses change often, so always read the terms on the casino\'s site.'=>'Maki zuwa daga gwaje-gwajen da muka yi. Lada na canzawa akai-akai, don haka a ko da yaushe a karanta sharuɗɗan da ke kan shafin gidan caca.','Top-rated casinos compared'=>'An gwada mafi kyawun gidajen caca','Royal Harbour'=>'Royal Harbour','Lucky Meadow'=>'Lucky Meadow','Star Lantern'=>'Tar Lantern','Our score'=>'Makinmu','9.4 / 10'=>'9.4 / 10','9.1 / 10'=>'9.1 / 10','8.8 / 10'=>'8.8 / 10','Welcome offer'=>'Kyautar maraba','100% up to 200'=>'100% har zuwa 200','50 free spins'=>'kyauta 50 na juyawa','150% up to 100'=>'150% har zuwa 100','Fast withdrawals'=>'Cirewa cikin sauri','Live dealer games'=>'Wasan dillali kai tsaye','Deposit limits'=>'Iyakokin ajiya','18+ only. Offers are subject to the operator\'s terms and your country\'s rules.'=>'Masu shekaru 18 da sama kawai. Tallace-tallacen suna ƙarƙashin sharuddan mai gudanarwa da dokokin ƙasarku.','Questions and answers'=>'Tambayoyi da amsoshi','Common questions'=>'Tambayoyi gama-gari','Are online casinos legal where I live?'=>'Shin gidan caca na kan giyar gizo yana da halasci a inda nake rayuwa?','It depends on your country and sometimes your region. Only play at casinos licensed for your location, and check the local rules first.'=>'Ya dogara da kasarka kuma wani lokacin yankinka. Yi wasa kawai a gidajen caca da aka ba su izini a yankinka, kuma ka fara duba dokokin yankin.','How do you make money?'=>'Ta yaya kake samun kuɗi?','Through affiliate commissions when readers sign up through our links. Rankings are decided by our tests before any commercial discussion.'=>'Ta hanyar kwamishinan abokan hulɗa lokacin da masu karatu suka yi rajista ta hanyar hanyoyin haɗin yanar gizon mu. Ana yanke shawarar matsayi ta hanyar gwaje-gwajenmu kafin duk wata tattaunawa ta kasuwanci.','What is a wagering requirement?'=>'Menene sharadin fare?','The number of times you must bet a bonus before you can withdraw winnings from it. Lower is better.'=>'Adadin lokutan da dole ne ka yi fare kan kari kafin ka iya cire kyaututtuka daga ciki. Ƙarami ya fi kyau.','Features'=>'Abubuwan da ke ciki','How we review a casino'=>'Yadda muke bitar gidan caca','Every review follows the same checklist, so scores can be compared fairly.'=>'Kowane bita yana bin jerin abubuwan dubawa guda ɗaya, ta yadda za a iya kwatanta maki cikin adalci.','Licence and safety'=>'Lasisi da tsaro','We confirm the licence with the regulator and check how player funds are protected.'=>'Muna tabbatar da lasisi tare da mai tsauwa tare da bincika yadda ake kare kudaden \'yan wasa.','Payouts'=>'Biyaɗa','We deposit and withdraw with real money and time how long each payout takes.'=>'Muna ajiye da cire kuɗi na gaske tare da lokacin da kowane biya yake ɗauka.','Bonus terms'=>'Sharuɗɗan kari','We read the wagering rules, caps and time limits so you do not have to.'=>'Mun karanta dokokin yin caca, iyakoki da lokaci don haka ba lallai ne ku yi hakan ba.','Games'=>'Wasan zaɓe','We look at the game studios, live tables and published return-to-player figures.'=>'Muna duba ɗakunan wasanni, teburran kai tsaye da kuma alkaluman da aka buga na dawowar kuɗi ga ɗan wasa.','Support'=>'Goyo baya','We contact support by chat and email and rate the speed and the answers.'=>'Mun tuntuɓi goyon baya ta hanyar tattaunawa da imel kuma muna kimanta saurin da amsoshin.','Responsible play'=>'Wasan da ya dace','We check for deposit limits, reality checks, cool-off periods and self-exclusion.'=>'Muna bincika iyakokin ajiya, binciken gaskiya, lokutan hutawa da kuma ware kansa.','Call to action'=>'Kirki ga aiki','Charity'=>'Cigari','Help a child go to school'=>'Taimaka wa yaro ya tafi makaranta','Give once or give monthly.'=>'Ba da gudummawa sau ɗaya ko a riƙa bayarwa kowane wata.','Donate now'=>'Ba da gudummawa yanzu','Hero'=>'Jarumi','Registered charity'=>'Ƙungiyar agaji mai rijista','Every child deserves a safe place to learn'=>'Kowane yaro ya cancanci wuri mai aminci don koyo','We build classrooms, train teachers and provide school meals in communities that need them most.'=>'Muna gina ajujuwa, muna horar da malamai kuma muna ba da abincin rana a makarantu a cikin al\'ummomin da suka fi bukatarsu.','Our impact'=>'Tasirinmu','Steps'=>'Matakai','How it works'=>'Yadda yake aiki','You give'=>'Ka bayar','Online, by phone or by post.'=>'A kan layi, ta wayar tarho ko ta pos.','We fund projects'=>'Muna tallafawa ayyuka','Chosen with our local partners.'=>'An zaɓa tare da abokan aikinmu na gida.','You see the impact'=>'Kuna ganin tasirin','Updates and stories from the field.'=>'Sabuntawa da labarai daga filin.','Dental Clinic'=>'Asibitin Haƙora','Frequently asked questions'=>'Tambayoyi da aka fi yawan yi','Are you taking new patients?'=>'Kuna karɓar sababbin majiyyata?','Yes. You can book your first visit online.'=>'Eh. Za ka iya yin ajiyar ziyararka ta farko ta yanar gizo.','Do you offer payment plans?'=>'Kuna ba da shirin biyan kuɗi?','Yes, interest-free plans are available for larger treatments.'=>'Eh, akwai tsare-tsaren da ba ruwansu da riba don manyan jiyya.','What if I am nervous?'=>'Yaya idan ina da fargaba?','Tell us when you book. We will take things at your pace.'=>'Ka gaya mana lokacin da kuka yi ajiyar wuri. Za mu tafi a daidai saurin da kuka zaba.','Accepting new patients'=>'Karɓan sabbin marasa lafiya','Gentle dental care for the whole family'=>'Kula da hakori mai sauƙi ga dukkan iyali','Check-ups, hygiene, whitening and implants in a calm, modern clinic. Nervous patients are always welcome.'=>'Bincike, tsafta, whitening da dashen hakora a cikin nutsuwa, zamani asibiti. Marasa lafiya masu tsoro ana maraba da su koyaushe.','Book an appointment'=>'Yi ajiyar alƙawari','Our treatments'=>'Maganunmu','Visiting us'=>'Ziyarce mu','Evening and Saturday appointments'=>'Alƙawaran yamma da ranar Asabar','Clear prices before treatment'=>'Bayyanannun farashin kafin magani','Payment plans available'=>'Tsarin biyan kuɗi da ke akwai','Emergency slots every day'=>'Guraben gaggawa a kowace rana','Book online'=>'Yi ajiyar wuri ta intanet','Choose a time that suits you.'=>'Zaɓi lokacin da ya dace da ku.','Meet your dentist'=>'Haɗu da likitan haƙoranka','A full check-up and a chat about your goals.'=>'Cikakken bincike da tattaunawa game da burinku.','Your plan'=>'Tsarin ku','A written plan with clear prices and options.'=>'Shiriritaccen tsari tare da tabbatattun farashoni da zaɓuɓɓuka.','Digital Agency'=>'Hukumar Dijital','Have a project in mind?'=>'Kuna da wani shiri a zuciya?','Tell us about it and we will reply within a day.'=>'Ka gaya mana game da shi kuma za mu ba da amsa a cikin rana guda.','Start a project'=>'Fara aiki','Services'=>'Ayyuka','What we do'=>'Abin da muke yi','Brand identity'=>'Alamar kasuwanci','Names, logos and visual systems that stand out.'=>'Sunaye, tambura da tsarin gani da suka fice.','Web design and build'=>'Tsara da gina yanar gizo','Fast, accessible websites built to convert.'=>'Shafukan yanar gizo masu sauri, masu sauƙin amfani waɗanda aka gina don su jawo hankalin masu amfani.','E-commerce'=>'Cinikin kan layi','Online stores that are easy to run and easy to buy from.'=>'Kantunan yanar gizo waɗanda ke da sauƙin sarrafawa kuma da sauƙin siyayya daga ciki.','SEO and content'=>'SEO da abun ciki','Search strategy and content that earns traffic.'=>'Dabarun bincike da abubuwan da ke jawo masu ziyara.','Paid media'=>'Kudaden kafofin watsa labarai','Search and social campaigns measured by results.'=>'Kamfen din bincike da na shafukan sada zumunta wadanda aka auna su ta hanyar sakamako.','Care plans'=>'Shirye-shiryen kulawa','Updates, security and improvements every month.'=>'Sabuntawa, tsaro da haɓakawa kowane wata.','Testimonials'=>'Shaidun Abokan Ciniki','What our clients say'=>'Abin da abokan cinikinmu ke cewa','They understood our business better than we did. Sales doubled in six months.'=>'Sun fahimci kasuwancinmu fiye da yadda muka fahimce shi. Tallace-tallace sun ninka sau biyu cikin watanni shida.','Chloe'=>'Chloe','Founder'=>'Wanda ya kafa kamfani','Brilliant to work with: fast, honest and very talented.'=>'Incredible wajen aiki: mai sauri, mai gaskiya kuma ƙwararre sosai.','Omar'=>'Omar','Marketing director'=>'Daraktan tallace-tallace','Fitness Gym'=>'Wurin motsa jiki na Fitness Gym','Open 5am to 11pm'=>'Bude daga karfe 5 na safe zuwa 11 na dare','Stronger every week'=>'Kara karfi kowane mako','Coached classes, open gym and personal training for every level. Your first week is on us.'=>'Azuzuwan da aka horar da su, bude dakin motsa jiki da horar da kanka ga kowane mataki. Makon farko na ku kyauta ne a gare mu.','Claim a free week'=>'Yi ikirarin wani mako kyauta','See classes'=>'Dubi ajujuwa','Lost 12kg and gained a lot of confidence. The coaches are brilliant.'=>'Na rasa kg 12 kuma na sami amincewa sosai. Kocin sun yi kyau sosai.','Rachel'=>'Rachel','Member'=>'Mamba','First gym I have stuck with for more than a month.'=>'Waccon farko da na tsaya da shi fiye da wata guda.','Sam'=>'Sam','Law Firm'=>'Kamfanin Lauyoyi','Experienced, approachable lawyers'=>'Laurobobin ƙwarewa, masu sauƙin tuntuɓa','We are an independent firm built on long-term relationships. Many of our clients have been with us for decades.'=>'Mu kamfanin mai cin gashin kansa ne da aka kafa bisa dogon lokaci na dangantaka. Yawancin abokan cinikinmu sun yi shekaru da dama tare da mu.','You will always know who is handling your case, what happens next and what it will cost.'=>'Za ka san wanda ke kula da shari\'arka koyaushe, abin da zai biyo baya da kuma abin da zai biya.','How we work'=>'Yadda muke aiki','Plain-language advice'=>'Shawarwari masu sauƙin fahimta','Fixed fees where possible'=>'Kudin da ba sa canzawa idan zai yiwu','A named solicitor for your case'=>'Lauyanci mai suna don shari\'ar ku','Replies within one working day'=>'Amsoshi a cikin rana daya ta aiki','Talk to a solicitor'=>'Tuntuɓi lauya','Book a free 30-minute consultation.'=>'Yi ajiyar tattaunawar mintuna 30 kyauta.','Request a consultation'=>'Nemi shawarwari','Practice areas'=>'Fannon horo','Business law'=>'Dokokin kasuwanci','Contracts, disputes, shareholder agreements and company formation.'=>'Kwange, takaddama, yarjejeniyar masu hannun jari da kuma kafa kamfani.','Property'=>'Kayaki','Buying, selling, leases and commercial property transactions.'=>'Sayayya, tallace-tallace, kwangilolin haya, da kuma cinikin kadarorin kasuwanci.','Family law'=>'Dokokin iyali','Divorce, children arrangements and financial settlements.'=>'Kisan aure, tsarin yara da kuma sasanta kuɗi.','Employment'=>'Aiki','Advice for employers and employees, from contracts to tribunals.'=>'Shawarwari ga masu aiki da ma\'aikata, daga kwangiloli zuwa kotuna.','Wills and probate'=>'Wasiyyu da raba gado','Wills, lasting powers of attorney and estate administration.'=>'Kudade da nufin karshe, ikon lauyoyi masu dorewa, da sarrafa dukiya.','Dispute resolution'=>'Warware takaddama','Negotiation, mediation and litigation when it is needed.'=>'Tattaunawa, sasanta-wa da kuma shari\'a lokacin da ake bukata.','Local Plumber'=>'Mai famfo na gida','Need a plumber today?'=>'Kuna buƙatar famfo a yau?','Call now or book online. Emergency slots available around the clock.'=>'Kira yanzu ko ka yi ajiyar wuri ta intanet. Akwai guraren gaggawa a kowane lokaci.','Book a visit'=>'Yi ajiyar ziyara','Do you charge a call-out fee?'=>'Kuna cajin kuɗin zuwa wuri?','Our fixed price includes the visit. You will know the cost before we start.'=>'Kudinken tabbatacce ya haɗa da ziyarar. Za ku san kuɗin kafin mu fara.','Which areas do you cover?'=>'Wane yankuna kuke rufewa?','The whole town and every village within 20 miles.'=>'Dukan garin da kowane kauye da ke cikin nisan mil 20.','Are you insured?'=>'Kuna da inshora?','Yes, fully insured, and every job has a 12-month guarantee.'=>'Eh, an biya wa komai inshora, kuma kowane aiki yana da garantin wata 12.','24/7 emergency service'=>'Sabis na gaggawa na 24/7','Fast, friendly plumbing. Fixed right the first time.'=>'Aikin famfo mai sauri da abokantaka. An gyara shi daidai a karo na farko.','Leaks, blocked drains, boilers and bathrooms. Local, insured engineers with upfront prices and a 12-month guarantee on our work.'=>'Leaky da shingen magudanar ruwa, na\'urorin dumama ruwa da dakunan wanka. Injiniyoyi na gida masu inshora tare da bayyanannun farashi da garantin watanni 12 akan aikinmu.','Emergency call-out'=>'Kiran gaggawa na gaggawa','Why homeowners choose us'=>'Me yasa masu gida suka zabe mu','Arrival slots you can plan around'=>'Lokutan isowa waɗanda za ku iya tsarawa','Price agreed before we start'=>'An yardi da farashin kafin mu fara','Clean, tidy and insured'=>'Mai tsabta, gyararre kuma mai inshora','12-month workmanship guarantee'=>'garantiyar aikin wata 12','What we fix'=>'Abubuwan da muke gyarawa','From a dripping tap to a full bathroom, one call covers it.'=>'Daga famfo mai ɗiga zuwa cikakken banɗaki, waya ɗaya tana wadatarwa.','Emergency repairs'=>'Gyaran gaggawa','Burst pipes, leaks and no water, day or night.'=>'Fashewar butututsa, leaks da rashin ruwa, rana ko dare.','Boilers and heating'=>'Tukunyar zafi da dumama','Servicing, repairs and new boiler installs.'=>'Kula da na\'urori, gyarawa da shigar da sabon biler.','Blocked drains'=>'An toshe magudanar ruwa','Sinks, toilets and outside drains cleared fast.'=>'An cire matsalolin sinkuna, bayan gida da magudanan ruwa na waje cikin sauri.','Bathrooms'=>'Baɗɗaki','Design, fitting and tiling, managed start to finish.'=>'Zane, kafawa da shimfiɗa tayil, an sarrafa su tun daga farko har ƙarshe.','Leak detection'=>'Gano yoyo','Hidden leaks found without tearing up the house.'=>'An gano ɓoyayyun leaks ba tare da rushe gida ba.','Landlord checks'=>'Binciken mai gida','Safety certificates and planned maintenance.'=>'Takardun shaida na tsaro da kuma gyare-gyaren da aka tsara.','Came within the hour on a Sunday and fixed the leak. Brilliant.'=>'Sun zo cikin sa\'a guda a ranar Lahadi kuma sun gyara leken. Abin ban mamaki.','Helen M.'=>'Helen M.','Homeowner'=>'Mai gida','Fair price, explained everything, left the bathroom spotless.'=>'Farashin ya yi adalci, ya bayyana komai, ya bar bandakin yana sheki.','Tom R.'=>'Tom R.','We use them for all our rental properties. Always reliable.'=>'Muna amfani da su ga duk kadarorinmu na haya. Kullum suna da aminci.','Aisha K.'=>'Aisha K.','Landlord'=>'Mai gida','Online Academy'=>'Cibiyar Koyo ta Intanet','Enrolment open'=>'An Ajiyewa a Buɗe','Learn new skills at your own pace'=>'Koyi sabbin fasahohi a lokacinka','Practical online courses taught by working professionals. Learn in short lessons, practise with real projects and earn a certificate.'=>'Tattalin kwas-kwas na intanet masu sauƙin fahimta waɗanda ƙwararrun ma\'aikata ke koyarwa. Koyi ta hanyar gajeren darussa, gudanar da aiki da ingantattun ayyukan gaske, kuma ka sami takardar shaida.','Browse courses'=>'Binciko kwasa-kwasai','Every course includes'=>'Kowane kwas ya ƙunshi','Short video lessons'=>'Gajerun darussan bidiyo','Real-world projects'=>'Ayyukan gaske na duniya','Mentor feedback'=>'Ra\'ayin mai ba da shawara','Certificate on completion'=>'Takardar shaida kan kammalaWA','Popular courses'=>'Darussan da suka fi shahara','Web development'=>'Ci gaban yanar gizo','HTML, CSS and JavaScript from first principles to projects.'=>'HTML, CSS, da JavaScript daga tushe na farko har zuwa ayyuka.','Digital marketing'=>'Kasuwancin dijital','SEO, content, email and social campaigns that work.'=>'Hantsarin SEO, abun ciki, imel da kuma kafofin sada zumunta da ke aiki.','Data analysis'=>'Nazarin bayanai','Spreadsheets, SQL and dashboards for better decisions.'=>'Shafukan lissafi, SQL da allo don yanke shawara mafi kyau.','UX design'=>'Zane-zanen UX','Research, wireframes and prototypes users love.'=>'Bincike, tsarin zane da samfuran gwaji da masu amfani ke so.','Project management'=>'Gudanar da aikin','Plan, deliver and lead projects with confidence.'=>'Shirya, aiwatar da kuma jagoranci ayyuka tare da tabbaci.','Business writing'=>'Rubutun kasuwanci','Clear emails, reports and proposals.'=>'Share ɓangarorin imel, rahotanni da kuma shawarwari.','Niche Authority Site'=>'Shafin Ikon Niche','Start here'=>'Fara anan','The topics readers ask about most.'=>'Batutuwan da masu karatu ke fiye da tambaya akai.','Growing vegetables'=>'Noma kayan lambu','Raised beds, soil, sowing calendars and harvests.'=>'Gadoji da aka ɗaga, ƙasa, kalandar shuki da kuma girbi.','Lawn care'=>'Kulawar ciyawa','Feeding, mowing and fixing patchy grass.'=>'Ciyarwa, yankan ciyawa da gyara gurbin ciyawa da suka lalace.','Garden tools'=>'Kayan aikin lambu','What is worth buying and how to look after it.'=>'Abin da ya cancanta a saya da kuma yadda za a kula da shi.','Small gardens'=>'Ƙananan lambu','Balconies, patios and containers.'=>'Filayen shakatawa, bokalai da wuraren ajiye kaya.','Practical guides to home gardening'=>'Jagororin aikace-aikace don aikin lambu na gida','Straightforward advice on growing vegetables, caring for lawns and choosing the right tools, written by people who garden every weekend.'=>'Shawara kai tsaye kan noman kayan lambu, kula da ciyawa da zabar kayan aiki masu dacewa, wanda mutanen da ke aikin lambu kowace karshen mako suka rubuta.','Read the latest guides'=>'Karanta sabbin jagorori','About the author'=>'Game marubuci','Estate Agency'=>'Hukumar Kula da Gidaje','What is your home worth?'=>'Menene darajar gidanku?','Book a free, no-obligation valuation.'=>'Yi rajistar ƙimar kyauta, ba tare da wani sharadi ba.','Book a valuation'=>'Yi ajiyar kima','Free valuation'=>'Kyauta ta ƙima','An agent visits and prices your home.'=>'Wani wakili ya ziyarci gidanka kuma ya sanya masa farashi.','Launch'=>'Kaddamarwa','Photos, floor plan and listing live within days.'=>'Hotuna, tsarin bene da lissafin sun fito cikin kwanaki.','Sold'=>'An sayar','We negotiate and manage the sale to completion.'=>'Muna tattaunawa kuma muna kula da sayarwar har zuwa karshe.','Bistro'=>'Bistro','Open Tuesday to Sunday'=>'Bude daga Talata zuwa Lahadi','Seasonal cooking, made for sharing'=>'Girkin yanayi, wanda aka yi don rabawa','Local produce, a wood-fired oven and a wine list chosen by people who love it. Lunch and dinner, six days a week.'=>'Abincin gida, tanderun itace da kuma jerin giya da mutanen da suke son ta suka zaba. Abincin rana da na dare, kwanaki shida a mako.','Book a table'=>'Yi ajiyar tebur','See the menu'=>'Duba menu','From our kitchen'=>'Daga kicin ɗinmu','A short menu that changes with the seasons. Ask us about allergies: we are happy to adapt.'=>'Gajeren tsarin abinci wanda ke sauyawa tare da yanayi. Tambaye mu game da alurar cututtuka: muna farin cikin daitawa.','Small plates'=>'Ƙananan faranti','Charred flatbreads, cured meats and garden vegetables to start.'=>'Gurasa mai siffa ta lebur da aka gasa sosai, da naman da aka warke, da kayan lambu don farawa.','From the fire'=>'Daga wuta','Whole fish, aged steaks and roasted vegetables from the wood oven.'=>'Cikakken kifi, tsabtaccen naman da aka tsufa da kuma gasassun kayan lambu daga tanderun itace.','Fresh pasta'=>'Sabon taliya','Made by hand every morning, served with seasonal sauces.'=>'Ana yin su da hannu kowace safiya, kuma ana ba da su tare da miya na kowane lokaci.','Desserts'=>'Wuraren zaki','Tarts, ices and a cheese board from local makers.'=>'Tart da ices da kuma allon cuku daga masu sana\'a na gida.','Set lunch'=>'Saita abincin rana','Two or three courses at a fixed price, Tuesday to Friday.'=>'Kwas ɗaya ko biyu a kan farashin da aka kayyade, daga Talata zuwa Juma\'a.','Private dining'=>'Keɓaɓɓen cin abinci','A private room for up to 18 guests with a tailored menu.'=>'Wani babban ɗaki mai zaman kansa wanda zai iya daukar baƙi har 18 tare da kebantacciyar menu.','SaaS Product'=>'Samfurin SaaS','Is there a free plan?'=>'Shin akwai shirin kyauta?','Yes, free for small teams, and every paid plan starts with a 14-day trial.'=>'Eh, kyauta ga ƙananan ƙungiyoyi, kuma kowane tsari na biya yana farawa da gwaji na kwanaki 14.','Can I cancel any time?'=>'Zan iya sokewa a kowane lokaci?','Yes. Monthly plans can be cancelled at any time.'=>'Ee. Za a iya soke tsare-tsaren wata-wata a kowane lokaci.','Where is my data stored?'=>'A ina ake adana bayanai na?','In secure, encrypted data centres, with daily backups.'=>'A cikin amintattun cibiyoyin bayanai da aka ɓoye, tare da madadin bayanai na kullum.','Everything your team needs'=>'Komai da ƙungiyar ku ke buƙata','Boards and timelines'=>'Allunan tallafi da jadawalin lokaci','Switch between kanban boards and timelines in one click.'=>'Canja tsakanin allon kanban da jadawalin lokaci a danna ɗaya.','Automations'=>'Sarrafa ta atomatik','Move tasks, assign owners and send reminders automatically.'=>'Matsar da ayyuka, sanya masu kula da su, kuma a tura tunatarwa ta atomatik.','Shared files'=>'Fayilolin da aka raba','Keep documents next to the work they belong to.'=>'Ajiye takardu kusa da aikin da suke da alaka da shi.','Reports'=>'Rahotanni','Live dashboards for workload, progress and deadlines.'=>'Broughton allo na kai tsaye don aikin, ci gaba, da lokutan ƙarshe.','Integrations'=>'Haɗin gwiwa','Connect the email, chat and storage tools you already use.'=>'Haɗa imel, taɗi da kayan aikin ajiya da kake amfani da su yanzu.','Security'=>'Tsaro','Single sign-on, audit logs and encrypted data.'=>'Shiga ta lokaci daya, rajistar bincike da kuma bayanan da aka boye.','14-day free trial, no card needed'=>'Kwanaki 14 na gwaji kyauta, ba bu buƙatar katin banki','Plan projects, not spreadsheets'=>'Tsara ayyuka, ba takardun lissafi ba','One workspace for tasks, deadlines and files. Your team sees what matters today, and you see progress without asking for updates.'=>'Wuri guda ɗaya don ayyuka, lokutan ƙarshe da fayiloli. Ƙungiyar ku tana ganin abin da ke da muhimmanci a yau, kuma kuna ganin ci gaba ba tare da neman sabuntawa ba.','Start free trial'=>'Fara gwaji kyauta','See features'=>'Dubi abubuwan da ke ciki','Up and running in minutes'=>'An fara aiki kuma an gama a cikin \'yan mintoci kaɗan','Create a workspace'=>'Ƙirƙiri wurin aiki','Sign up and invite your team in minutes.'=>'Yi rijista kuma ka gayyaci tawagarka cikin mintuna kaɗan.','Import your work'=>'Shigo da aikinka','Bring tasks in from a spreadsheet or another tool.'=>'Kawo ayyuka daga cikin takardar lissafi ko wani kayan aiki.','Get moving'=>'Fara tafiya','Templates and automations do the busywork.'=>'Samfura da sarrafa ta atomatik suna yin ayyukan yau da kullum.','You are not allowed to edit this item.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin gyara wannan abu ba.','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Ba a ba ka izinin yin wannan ba.','Safe mode was turned off because it no longer matches your login. Reload the page.'=>'An kashe yanayin tsaro domin baya dace da shigarka ta gaba. Sake loda shafin.','Only an administrator can use safe mode.'=>'Mai gudanarwa ne kawai zai iya amfani da yanayin aminci.','Safe mode needs a normal browser login.'=>'Yanayin aminci yana buƙatar shiga ta na\'urar bincike ta al\'ada.','Safe mode could not be set up.'=>'Ba a iya saita yanayin aminci ba.','Safe mode needs write access to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Yanayin tsaro yana buƙatar damar rubutawa zuwa ga babban fayil na wp-content/mu-plugins.','Safe mode could not write to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Ba a iya rubuta wa zuwa cikin kundin adireshi na wp-content/mu-plugins ba a yanayin kariya (Safe mode).','Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio','That page does not exist, or it has been deleted.'=>'Wannan shafin babu shi, ko kuma an goge shi.','Sandwich Studio works with the block editor, and the block editor is switched off for this item. A plugin such as Classic Editor does that: allow the block editor for this item in its settings (Settings → Writing), then open Sandwich Studio again.'=>'Sandwich Studio yana aiki tare da editan buloka, kuma an kashe editan buloka don wannan abin. Wani plugin kamar Classic Editor ne ke yin hakan: ba da damar editan buloka don wannan abin a cikin saitunansa (Saituna → Rubutu), sannan a buɗe Sandwich Studio kuma.','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit this item in Sandwich Studio.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba a ba ka izinin gyara wannan abu a cikin Sandwich Studio ba.','Sandwich Studio is not built. Reinstall the plugin.'=>'Ba a gina Sandwich Studio ba. Sake shigar da plugin ɗin.','Add title'=>'Ƙara take','Type / to choose a block'=>'Rubuta / don zaɓar wani b da ke rufe','Loading Sandwich Studio…'=>'Ana loda Sandwich Studio...','Sandwich Studio needs JavaScript. Use the normal editor instead.'=>'Sandwich Studio na buƙatar JavaScript. Yi amfani da madadin edita na al\'ada maimakon haka.','Edit “%s” with Sandwich Studio'=>'Gyara “%s” tare da Sandwich Studio','Edit with Sandwich Studio'=>'Gyara tare da Sandwich Studio','Blank canvas'=>'Fanko mara komai','Skip to content'=>'Tsallake zuwa abun ciki','The tablet width must be a whole number of pixels from 480 to 2560.'=>'Dole fadin kwamfutar hannu ya zama lambar pixel duka daga 480 zuwa 2560.','The mobile width must be a whole number of pixels, at least 240 and smaller than the tablet width.'=>'Faɗin wayar hannu dole ne ya zama lambar pixel ta duka, aƙalla 240 kuma ta fi faɗin kwamfutar tafi-da-gidanka ƙankanta.','Each custom breakpoint needs its own id: 2 to 12 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kowane ɓangaren hutu na musamman yana buƙatar nasa ID: haruffa ƙanana 2 zuwa 12 ko lambobi, waɗanda suka fara da harafi.','A custom breakpoint applies either up to a width (200 to 4000 pixels) or from a width (200 to 6000 pixels), not both.'=>'Wani kebantaccen ma\'aunin karyewa yana aiki ne ko dai har zuwa faɗi (daga pixels 200 zuwa 4000) ko kuma daga faɗi (daga pixels 200 zuwa 6000), ba duka biyun ba.','Tablet'=>'Kwanon kwamfuta','Mobile'=>'Wayar hannു','Site design'=>'Tsarin shafin','Colours, fonts and styles shared by every page of the site and by your theme.'=>'Launi, haruffa da salo waɗanda kowane shafi na shafin da jigon ku suke raba.','The site\'s global styles could not be opened.'=>'Ba a iya buɗe salon gama gari na shafin ba.','That font is not one of the site\'s fonts.'=>'Waccan font ba ɗaya ba ne daga cikin font ɗin da ke kan rukunin yanar gizon.','Each colour needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Duk launi yana buƙatar suna na musamman da aka yi da ƙananan haruffa, lambobi, da kuma alamar raba kalma.','The colour "%s" is not a valid CSS colour.'=>'Launin "%s" ba ingantaccen launin CSS ba ne.','Each font needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Duk wani font yana buƙatar suna na musamman da aka yi da ƙananan baƙaƙe, lambobi, da kuma alamar raba kalma (hyphen).','The font stack for "%s" may contain only font names, quotes, commas and spaces.'=>'Jerin font na "%s" na iya ƙunsar sunayen font kawai, alamomin ambato, waƙafi da gurabaru.','Uploaded icons'=>'Hotunan da aka loda','Icon'=>'Alama','This file is not an SVG icon we can use. It may be damaged, or it only held content that is removed for safety (scripts, links, embedded images or fonts).'=>'Wannan fayil din ba alamar SVG ba ce da za mu iya amfani da ita. Wataƙila ya lalace, ko kuma ya ƙunshi abubuwan da aka cire don dalilan tsaro (rubutun shirin kwamfuta, hanyoyin haɗi, hotunan da aka saka ko rubutu).','The icon could not be deleted.'=>'Ba a iya goge alamar ba.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'wani mabudin lasisi','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Har yanzu ba a haɗa mai amfani da lasisin ba, wanda hakan ke da muhimmanci don hana kunna shi ta hanyar da ba a ba da izini ba. Don sanya lasisin ga mai amfani da ku, kun yarda ku raba cikakken suna da adireshin imel na mai amfani da ku na WordPress.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'shafukan da aka ambata a sama','Account'=>'Asusun ajiya','Account Details'=>'Bayanin Asusun','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Ana jiran a kunna asusun. Da fatan za a duba imel ɗinku sannan a danna mahadar don kunna asusunku sannan a sake gabatar da fom ɗin abokin tarayya.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Kuna son haɗa %1$s cikin %2$s?','Actions'=>'Ayyuka','Activate'=>'Kunna','Activate Free Version'=>'Kunna Kyauta Na Kyauta','Activate License'=>'Kunna Lasisi','activate a license here'=>'kun kunna lasisi anan','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Da fat za a shigar da maɓallin lasisin da ka karɓa a imel ɗin da aka tura nan da nan bayan siyan:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Kunna lasisi a duk shafukan da ke cikin hanyar sadarwa.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Kunna lasisi a duk shafukan da ke jiran aiki.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'An riga an shigar da sigar biyan kuɗi ta %1$s. Da fatan za a kunna shi don fara amfani da fasalulluka na %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>'An riga an shigar da sigar biyan kuɗi ta %1$s. Da fatan za a je zuwa %2$s domin kunna ta kuma fara amfana daga fasalulluka na %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Kunna wannan ƙari','Activate %s'=>'Kunna %s','Activate %s features'=>'Kunna fasalolin %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Kammala Kunna "%s" Yanzu','Activate %s Plan'=>'Kunna Tsarin %s','Activated'=>'An kunna','Activating'=>'Ana kunnawa','Activating license'=>'Ana kunna lasisi','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'An kunna asusun ku cikin nasara tare da tsarin %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Mai aiki','Add another domain'=>'Ƙara wani yanki daban','Add-Ons'=>'Karinan Kaya','Add Ons for %s'=>'Karinan Aiki na %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Mun kasa lodi jerin abubuwan da za a iya ƙarawa. Wataƙila matsala ce daga ɓangarenmu, da fatan za a gwada dawowa bayan ƴan mi