 point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Na gode da neman shiga cikin shirinmu na abokan hulɗa, abin takaici, mun yanke shawarar kin amince da roƙonku a wannan lokacin. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa bayan kwanaki 30.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Na gode da neman shiga cikin shirinmu na abokan hulɗa, za mu duba bayanan ku a cikin kwanaki 14 masu zuwa kuma za mu tuntube ku da ƙarin bayani.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'%s binciken cookie bayan ziyarar farko don haɓaka damar samun kuɗi.','Affiliation'=>'Hadin gwiwa','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Da zarar lasisinku ya ƙare, zaku iya ci gaba da amfani da sigar Kyauta amma BA za ku sami damar amfani da abubuwan %s ba.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Da zarar lasisinku ya ƙare, ba za ku ƙara iya amfani da %s ba, sai dai idan kun sake kunna shi da ingantaccen lasisin farko.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Kuna iya ci gaba da jin daɗin duk abubuwan da ke cikin %1$s amma ba za ku sami damar samun sabunta tsaro da abubuwa na %2$s ba, ko tallafi.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Na gode da haɓakawa.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Bayan kyautarka ta %1$s, biya kaɗan kamar %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Yardewa & Kunna Lasisi','I Agree - Change User'=>'Na Yarda - Canza Mai Amfani','All Requests'=>'Dukkan Buƙatun','All Types'=>'Duk Nau\'uka','allow'=>'bada dama','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Kun riga kun yarda da bin diddigin amfani da mu, wanda ke taimaka mana mu ci gaba da inganta %s.','You\