ry duplicate of %2$s.'=>'Ka sanya alama a kan wannan gidan yanar gizo, %1$s, a matsayin wanda aka maimaita na ɗan lokaci na %2$s.','You marked this website, %s, as a temporary duplicate of these sites'=>'Ka yi wa wannan gidan yanar gizon, %s, alama a matsayin wanda aka maimaita na wucin gadi na waɗannan shafuka','Thank you!'=>'Na gode!','Thank you so much for using %s!'=>'Muna godiya sosai da amfani da %s!','Thank you so much for using %s and its add-ons!'=>'Na gode sosai da amfani da %s da kuma ƙarin abubuwan da ke cikinta!','Thank you so much for using our products!'=>'Nagari sosai da amfani da samfuranmu!','Thanks!'=>'Na gode!','Welcome to %s! To get started, please enter your license key:'=>'Barka da zuwa %s! Don fara amfani, don Allah shigar da lambar lasisin ku:','Thanks, please wait'=>'Na gode, don Allah a jira','Thanks %s!'=>'Na gode %s!','The following products\''=>'Products masu zuwa','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.the installation instructions'=>'umarnin shigarwa','"The <product_label>", e.g.: "The plugin"The %s\'s'=>'Na %s','Theme'=>'Jigo','Theme Switch'=>'Canjin Jigo','Themes'=>'Jigogin Tsari','Themes page'=>'Shafin jigo','This will allow %s to'=>'Wannan zai ba %s damar','Timestamp'=>'Lokacin fitowa','Title'=>'Taken taken','Terms of Service'=>'Sharuɗɗan Sabis','Total'=>'Jimla','Town'=>'Gari','Seems like we are having some temporary issue with your trial cancellation. Please try again in few minutes.'=>'Da alama muna fuskantar ɗan lokaci matsala wajen soke gwajinka. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa bayan \'yan mintoci kaɗan.','Your %s free trial was successfully cancelled.'=>'An soke gwajin ku na kyauta na %s cikin nasara.','It looks like you are not in trial mode anymore so there\'s nothing to cancel :)'=>'Da alama ba ka cikin yanayin gwaji kuma don haka babu abin da za a soke :)','Your free trial has expired. You can still continue using all our free features.'=>'Gwajin ku na kyauta ya ƙare. Kuna iya ci gaba da amfani da duk abubuwan da muke bayarwa kyauta.','Your free trial has expired. %1$sUpgrade now%2$s to continue using the %3$s without interruptions.'=>'Lokacin gwaji na kyauta ya ƙare. %1$sInganta yanzu%2$s don ci gaba da amfani da %3$s ba tare da katsewa ba.','Plan %s do not exist, therefore, can\'t start a trial.'=>'Shirin %s bai wanzu ba, saboda haka, ba a iya fara gwaji ba.','Your trial has been successfully started.'=>'An fara gwajinka cikin nasara.','You already utilized a trial before.'=>'Kun riga kun yi amfani da gwaji a baya.','How do you like %1$s so far? Test all our %2$s premium features with a %3$d-day free trial.'=>'Yaya kake son %1$s zuwa yanzu? Gwada duk abubuwan alatu na %2$s tare da gwaji kyauta na kwanaki %3$d.','Type'=>'Nau\'i','Unable to connect to the filesystem. Please confirm your credentials.'=>'Ba a iya haɗawa da tsarin fayil ba. Da fatan za a tabbatar da bayanan shiga ku.','There was an unexpected API error while processing your request. Please try again in a few minutes and if it still doesn\'t work, contact the %s\'s author with the following:'=>'An samu kuskuren API da ba a yi tsammani ba yayin sarrafa buƙatar ku. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa bayan ‘yan mintoci kaɗan kuma idan har yanzu bai yi aiki ba, tuntuɓi marubucin %s tare da waɗannan:','Unexpected error, try again in 5 minutes. If the error persists, please contact support.'=>'Kuskuren da ba a tsammani ba, a sake gwadawa bayan mintuna 5. Idan kuskuren ya ci gaba, da fatan za a tuntuɓi sashen tallafi.','Uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Cire %s zai kashe lasisin ta atomatik, wanda za ka iya amfani da shi a wani shafin yanar gizon.','An unknown error has occurred.'=>'An faru wani sabon kuskure da ba a sani ba.','Unlimited commissions.'=>'Karatun kwamishoni mara iyaka.','Unlimited Updates'=>'Sabuntawa mara iyaka','verbUpdate'=>'Sabunta','Would you like to proceed with the update?'=>'Kuna son ci gaba da sabuntawar?'