ill no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'Ta danna "Opt Out", %s ba zai ƙara iya ganin sunanka da imel ɗinka ba.','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'Ta hanyar danna "Opt Out", ba za a sake aika da bayanan bincike zuwa ga %s ba.','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'Ta hanyar cire haɗin gidan yanar gizon, an goge bayanan bincike da aka raba a baya game da %1$s kuma ba za su ƙara zama a bayyane ga %2$s ba.','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Ta hanyar zaɓin fitowa daga raba wannan bayanin tare da uwar garken ɗaukakawa, dole ne ka bincika sabbin saki na %1$s kuma ka zazzage & shigar da su da hannu. Ba kawai matsala ba ce, amma rasa ɗaukakawa na iya sanya shafinka cikin haɗari kuma ya haifar da matsalolin dacewa marasa amfani, don haka muna matukar ba da shawarar kiyaye waɗannan mahimman izini.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Soke %1$s - Ban buƙatar ƙarin sabuntawar tsaro & fasali, ko goyon baya ga %2$s domin ba na shirin amfani da %3$s a kan wannan, ko wani rarshen intanet ba.','Cancel %s?'=>'Soke %s?','Cancelling %s'=>'Ana soke %s','Cancelling %s...'=>'Ana soke %s...','Click here'=>'Danna nan','Deactivating'=>'Ana kashewa','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Cire haɗin gidan yanar gizon zai cire %s na har abada daga asusun Dashboard na Mai Amfani.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Domin isar da sabuntawar tsaro da fasali ta atomatik, da kuma gudanar da lasisi da kariya, %s na buƙatar:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Don iskar da sabunta tsaro da abubuwa, da kuma sarrafa lasisi, %s yana buƙatar','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius injiniya ce ta lasisi da sabunta software','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Idan wannan kwafi ne na dogon lokaci, don kiyaye sabuntawa ta atomatik da fasali na biya bayan %1$s, da fatan za a %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'Shin %2$s kwafi ne na %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Shiga Shirin Beta','Join the Beta program'=>'Shiga shirin Beta','License'=>'Lasisi','License Key'=>'Mukullin Lasisi','License key'=>'Maɓullin lasisi','Monthly'=>'Kowane wata','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Sunaye, alamomi, juzu\'i, da ko a kunna ko a\'a','New Version Available'=>'Sabon Sigar Akwai','Optional'=>'Na Zabi','Plan'=>'Tsari','Products'=>'Kayayyaki','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Raba bayanai masu nuna matsala yana taimakawa wajen samar da ƙarin aiki wanda ya dace da gidan yanar gizon ku, guje wa rashin jituwar sigar WordPress ko PHP wanda zai iya lalata gidan yanar gizon, da gane waɗanne harsuna & yankuna ya kamata a fassara %s zuwa gare su kuma a daidaita su.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Don haka za ka iya sake amfani da lasisin lokacin da %s bai kuma zama mai aiki ba.','Subscription'=>'Biyan kuɗi','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'The %1$s za ta riƙa aika mahimman bayanai na lasisi lokaci-lokaci zuwa %2$s don bincika sabuntawar tsaro da fasali, da kuma tabbatar da ingancin lasisin ku.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'Akwai %1$s na %2$s da ake da shi.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Don tabbatar da jituwa da kuma guje wa rikici tare da shigar da plugins da jigogi naka.','Trial'=>'Gwaji','View %s State'=>'Duba Matsayin %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Duba Babban Bayanin %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Ee, %2$s kwafi ne na %4$s don dalilin gwaji, staging, ko haɓakawa.','You have a %s license.'=>'Kuna da lasisi %s.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Kun sayi lasisin %s.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Za ka karɓi imel ɗin tabbatarwa na %1$s a cikin akwatin saƙonka a %2$s. Da fatan za a tabbatar ka danna maɓallin da ke cikin wannan imel ɗin don %3$s.','days'=>'kwanaki','deactivating'=>'ana kashewa','hour'=>'awa','hours'=>'awaƙi','license'=>'lasisi','optional'=>'na zaɓi ba','products'=>'kayayyaki','skip'=>'tsallake','subscription'=>'biyan kuɗi','trial'=>'gwaji','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Kayayyaki','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Ana kunnawa','as software licenseLicense'=>'Lasisi','close a windowDismiss'=>'Washe','close windowDismiss'=>'Kora da shi','like websitesSites'=>'Shafyuka','nounPricing'=>'Farashi','trial periodTrial'=>'Gwaji','verbOpt In'=>'Shiga Ciki','verbOpt Out'=>'Fice Daga','verbSkip'=>'Tsallake','verbUpgrade'=>'Haɓaka','x-ago%s ago'=>'tun %s da suka wuce','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Ba a iya kammala wannan aikin ba. Gwada sake, kuma idan ya ci gaba da gazawa, tuntuɓi mai kula da shafin.','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Ana buƙatar wani abu da babu shi ko kuma yana da kuskuren tsari. Duba tsarin shigar da ikon.','The site refused the request.'=>'Shafin ya ki amincewa da buƙatar.','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Wakilan AI (MCP)','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user with an application password and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Bar mataimakan AI kamar su Claude, Cursor ko VS Code suyi aiki a kan wannan shafin a gare ku ta hanyar MCP (Model Context Protocol). Suna shiga azaman mai amfani da WordPress tare da kalmar sirri ta aikace-aikace kuma za su iya yin abin da kawai aka yarda wancan mai amfani ya yi.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Injin AI na buƙatar WordPress 6.9 ko kuma wanda ya fi haka sabuntawa. Sabunta WordPress don amfani da su.','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Ba da damar wakilan AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Kashe: kayan aiki na kasa da kuma hanyoyin REST nasu ba a yi musu rajista ko kadan ba.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Adireshin haɗi (maƙasudin MCP)','Create an application password for your user'=>'Ƙirƙiri kalmar sirri ta aikace-aikace don mai amfani da ku','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Ƙara wannan zuwa cikin saitunan MCP na aikace-aikacenka na AI, tare da sunan mai amfani da wancan kalmar sirri:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: a sanya shigarwa iri ɗaya a ƙarƙashin "servers" a cikin .vscode/mcp.json, ba a ƙarƙashin "mcpServers" ba.','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Kayan aikin da wakilin AI zai iya amfani da su anan (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Jagorar mai amfani: Wakilan AI da MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Takardun masu haɓakawa: iyawa, REST da MCP','Build and edit this site\'s pages from Page Builder Sandwich sections and website kits.'=>'Gina kuma ka gyara shafukan wannan rukunin yanar gizon daga sassan Page Builder Sandwich da kayan aikin gidan yanar gizo.','Pages, sections and website kits.'=>'Shafuka, sassan da kuma kayan aikin gidan yanar gizo.','List pages'=>'Jeri shafuka','Lists the pages you can edit, newest first, with an optional search.'=>'Yana lissafin shafukan da za ku iya gyarawa, mafi sabuntawa da farko, tare da zaɓin bincike.','Words to search for in the title and content.'=>'Kalmomi da za a nema a cikin taken da abun ciki.','Read a page'=>'Karanta shafi','Returns a page\'s title, status, links and block content, and the sections (top-level blocks) it is made of.'=>'Yana dawo da sunan shafi, matsayi, mahaɗa da abubuwan da ke cikin tubali, da sassan (tubalan matakin sama) da aka gina shi da su.','Create a page'=>'Ƙirƙiri shafi','Creates a page from sections (see pbs/list-sections) and/or block content. A new page is a draft unless another status is asked for.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar shafi daga sassa (duba pbs/list-sections) da/ko abubuwan toshewa. Sabon shafi daftari ne sai dai idan an nemi wani matsayi daban.','Update a page'=>'Sabunta shafi','Changes a page\'s title, status or block content. Content you send replaces the page\'s content.'=>'Canza taken shafi, matsayi ko abubuwan da ke cikin tubali. Abubuwan da ka aika suna maye gurbin abubuwan da ke cikin shafin.','List sections'=>'Jer ga sassan','Lists the ready-made sections (hero, features, FAQ, testimonials, call to action and more) that can be added to a page.'=>'Yana lissafin sassan da aka riga aka tsara (fuskar gaba, fasali, tambayoyi da amsoshi, shaidun abokan ciniki, kiran aiki da sauransu) waɗanda za a iya ƙarawa zuwa shafi.','Words to match in a section\'s name or keywords.'=>'Kalmomi don a daidaita a cikin sunan wani sashe ko maɓallan kalmomi.','Add a section to a page'=>'Ƙara wani sashe a shafi','Adds a ready-made section to a page: at the start, at the end, or after the section at a given position.'=>'Yana ƙara sashin da aka riga aka shirya a shafi: a farko, a ƙarshe, ko bayan sashin a wani matsayi da aka bayar.','A section name from pbs/list-sections.'=>'Sunan wani yanki daga pbs/list-sections.','With position "after": the 0-based position of the section to insert after.'=>'Tare da matsayi na "after": matsayin da ya dogara ga 0 na sashen da za a saka bayan shi.','List website kits'=>'Jirwayen shafukan yanar gizo','Lists the website kits (a set of ready-made pages for one kind of business) this site can import.'=>'Yana lissafin kayan aikin yanar gizo (tarin shafuka masu shirye-shiryen amfani don nau\'in kasuwanci guda ɗaya) waɗanda wannan rukunin yanar gizon zai iya shigowa da su.','Import a website kit'=>'Shigo da kayan aikin gidan yanar gizo','Imports a website kit\'s pages (all of them, or the ones named), optionally publishing them, setting the home page and adding them to a menu. Importing again updates the same pages.'=>'Yana shigo da shafukan kayan aikin gidan yanar gizo (dukansu, ko wadanda aka sanya musu suna), yana buga su idan an so, saita shafin gida da kuma kara su cikin menu. Sake shigowa yana sabunta guda shafukan.','List the builder blocks'=>'Jera ginin bulok','Lists every Page Builder Sandwich block this site can use (Pro blocks too when Pro is active): name, title, category and description. Use pbs/get-block for a block\'s settings, then put the block in a page\'s content.'=>'Ana lissafa kowane bulokin Page Builder Sandwich da wannan shafin zai iya amfani da shi (har da bulokin Pro lokacin da Pro ke aiki): suna, take, rukuni da bayani. Yi amfani da pbs/get-block don saitunan buloki, sannan sanya bulokin a cikin abun cikin shafi.','Describe a builder block'=>'Bayyana wani bulokin mai ginawa','Returns one block\'s settings (attributes with their types, choices and defaults), what it supports, which blocks it may contain, and a ready-to-use example in block markup.'=>'Yana dawo da saitunan bulo guda ɗaya (siffofi tare da nau\'ikansu, zaɓuɓɓuka da tsoffin saituna), abin da yake tallafawa, wane bulo zai iya kunsa, da kuma misalin da ya shirya don amfani a cikin alamar bulo.','Where the block is: its position among the page\'s sections, then among that block\'s inner blocks, and so on (0-based), as pbs/get-page lists them.'=>'Inda block yake: matsayinsa tsakanin sassan shafin, sannan tsakanin abubuwan da ke cikin wannan block din, da sauransu (wanda ya fara daga 0), kamar yadda pbs/get-page suka lissafa su.','Change one block\'s settings'=>'Canza saitunan bulu ɗaya','Changes the settings (attributes) of one block inside a page, found by its path; attributes you send are merged over the current ones. Works on blocks the site renders from their settings; for a block whose HTML is saved in the page, send new markup with pbs/update-page.'=>'Yana canza saitunan (siffofi) na wani block guda ɗaya a cikin shafi, wanda aka samo ta hanyar hanyarsa; siffofin da ka aika ana haɗa su da na yanzu. Yana aiki ne akan block ɗin da shafin ke nunawa daga saitunansu; don block wanda aka adana HTML ɗinsa a cikin shafi, a aika da sabon markup tare da pbs/update-page.','Remove a block from a page'=>'Cire wani gini daga shafi','Removes one block (a whole section, or a block inside one) from a page, found by its path. The page\'s previous version stays in its revisions.'=>'Yana cire shafi daya (gaba daya sashe, ko kuma wani shafi a ciki) daga wani shafi, wanda aka samo ta hanyarsa. Tsohuwar sigar shafin tana nan a cikin gyare-gyarensa.','Move a section'=>'Matsar da wani sashe','Moves a section of a page from one position to another (0-based, as pbs/get-page lists them).'=>'Yana matsar da wani yanki na shafi daga wuri ɗaya zuwa wani (wanda aka fara lissafi daga 0, kamar yadda pbs/get-page ke lissafa su).','Duplicate a page'=>'Kwafi shafi','Copies a page (its title, content and template) into a new draft.'=>'Yana kwafin shafi (sunansa, abubuwan da ke ciki da samfurinsa) zuwa cikin sabon daftari.','Move a page to the trash'=>'Matsar da wani shafi zuwa ga shara','Moves a page to the trash. It can be restored from Pages, Trash for 30 days.'=>'Yana matsar da wani shafi zuwa kwandon shara. Ana iya dawo da shi daga Shafuka, Kwandon shara na tsawon kwanaki 30.','Build a landing page'=>'Gina shafin sauka','A guided workflow: the agent picks sections that fit your business, builds the page as a draft and writes its text.'=>'Tsarin da aka jagorantar: wakili yana zabar sassan da suka dace da kasuwancinka, yana gina shafin a matsayin daftari kuma yana rubuta rubutunsa.','The business, its offer and its audience.'=>'Kasuwancin, abin da yake bayarwa da kuma masu sauraron sa.','A page can be a draft, pending review, published or private.'=>'Wani shafi zai iya zama daftari, yana jiran dubawa, an buga shi ko kuma sirri ne.','Give the page a title.'=>'Ba shafi suna.','%s saves its HTML in the page, so its settings cannot be changed on their own. Send the page\'s new markup with pbs/update-page.'=>'%s yana adana HTML dinsa a cikin shafin, saboda haka ba za a iya canza saitunansa da kansu ba. A aika sabon tsarin shafin tare da pbs/update-page.','%s (copy)'=>'%s (kwafi)','The page could not be moved to the trash.'=>'Ba a iya matsar da shafin zuwa kwandon shara ba.','Build a landing page on this WordPress site for: %s. Steps: 1) call pbs-list-sections and choose 4 to 6 sections in a sensible order (hero first, a call to action last); 2) call pbs-create-page with a title and those sections, as a draft; 3) call pbs-get-page and rewrite every piece of placeholder text for this business with pbs-update-page (keep every block comment and tag as it is); 4) if pbs-generate-page is available, you may use it instead of steps 1 to 3; 5) report the page\'s edit link and do not publish it without asking.'=>'Gina shafin sauka a kan wannan rukunin yanar gizon WordPress na: %s. Matakai: 1) kira pbs-list-sections kuma zaɓi sassa 4 zuwa 6 a cikin oda mai ma\'ana (jarumi na farko, kiran aiki na ƙarshe); 2) kira pbs-create-page tare da take da waɗannan sassan, azaman daftarin; 3) kira pbs-get-page kuma sake rubuta kowane yanki na rubutun wuri don wannan kasuwancin tare da pbs-update-page (kula da kowane sharhin toshe da alamar kamar yadda yake); 4) idan pbs-generate-page yana samuwa, zaka iya amfani da shi maimakon matakai 1 zuwa 3; 5) bayar da rahoton hanyar haɗin gyara shafin kuma kada ku buga shi ba tare da tambaya ba.','There is no block at that position. Read the page with pbs/get-page first.'=>'Babu wani buloko a wannan wuri. Karanta shafin tare da pbs/get-page tukuna.','There is no block called "%s". See pbs/list-blocks.'=>'Babu wani bulo da ake kira "%s". Duba pbs/list-blocks.','The page has no section at that position.'=>'Shafin ba shi da sashin a wancan wurin.','That is not a kit name. See pbs/list-kits.'=>'Wannan ba sunan kit ba ne. Duba pbs/list-kits.','There is no section called "%s". See pbs/list-sections.'=>'Babu wani sashe da ake kira "%s". Duba pbs/list-sections.','Section names from pbs/list-sections, in page order. They come before any content given.'=>'Sunayen sassan daga pbs/list-sections, a cikin tsarin shafi. Suna zuwa kafin duk wani abun ciki da aka bayar.','Block markup (the format the block editor saves).'=>'Alamar izeda (tsarin da editan izeda ke adanawa).','There is no page with that ID.'=>'Babu shafi mai wannan ID.','You are not allowed to do that to this page.'=>'Ba a ba ka izinin yin hakan ga wannan shafin ba.','Connect Adobe Fonts (Pro)'=>'Haɗa Adobe Fonts (Pro)','Connects an Adobe Fonts (Typekit) web project by its kit id, so its fonts appear in the font pickers.'=>'Yana haɗa aikin gidan yanar gizo na Adobe Fonts (Typekit) ta ID ɗin sa na kit, ta yadda rubutunsa zai bayyana a cikin masu zaɓar rubutu.','Change the brand kit (Pro)'=>'Canza kayan aikin alama (Pro)','Saves the brand kit: name, logo, colours, heading and body fonts, and the brand voice AI writing uses.'=>'Yana adana kayan aiki na alama: suna, tambari, launuka, rubutun kai da na jiki, da muryar alama da rubutun AI ke amfani da su.','Apply the brand kit (Pro)'=>'Afa kayan aikin alama (Pro)','Applies the saved brand kit\'s colours and fonts to the site design.'=>'Yana amfani da launuka da rubutattun haruffa na kayan aikin alama da aka adana ga zanen shafin.','Read the responsive breakpoints'=>'Karanta wuraren da za su dace da girman allo','Returns the tablet and mobile widths (and custom breakpoints in Pro) the responsive controls use.'=>'Yana dawo da faɗin kwamfutar hannu da na wayar hannu (da tsayawar da aka keɓance a cikin Pro) waɗanda ikokin amsawa suke amfani da su.','Change the responsive breakpoints'=>'Canjin maki masu amsawa','Changes the tablet and mobile widths in pixels; with Pro, custom extra breakpoints.'=>'Yana canja fadin allon kwamfuta da na waya a cikin pixels; tare da Pro, ƙarin wuraren rabewa na musamman.','Create a global class (Pro)'=>'Ƙirƙiri ajin duniya (Pro)','Creates a reusable global style class: label, slug and its styles (s).'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar ajin salo na duniya wanda za a iya sake amfani da shi: alama, slug da salon sa (s).','Delete a global class (Pro)'=>'Goge aji na duniya (Pro)','Deletes a global class. Elements that used it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'Yana share ajin duniya. Abubuwan da suka yi amfani da shi suna riƙe abubuwan ciki kuma su rasa salon sa.','Change a global class (Pro)'=>'Canji ajin duniya (Pro)','Changes a global class\'s label, slug or styles; every element using it updates.'=>'Yana canza lakabi, gajeren suna (slug), ko salo na wani babban ajujuwa (global class); kowane abu dake amfani da shi zai sabunta.','Duplicate a global class (Pro)'=>'Kwafi aji na duniya (Pro)','Copies a global class under a new id.'=>'Yana kwafin aji na duniya a ƙarƙashin sabon id.','Turn on an uploaded font (Pro)'=>'Kunna wani da aka loda na harafi (Pro)','Makes an uploaded custom font (a font file in the media library, by id) available in the font pickers.'=>'Yana sanya al\'ada da aka loda (fayil na harafi a cikin laburare na kafofin watsa labarai, ta id) samuwa a cikin masu zabar harafi.','Turn off an uploaded font (Pro)'=>'Kashe wani font da aka loda (Pro)','Removes a custom font (by slug) from the font pickers.'=>'Yana cire wani keɓaɓɓen rubutu (ta hanyar slug) daga masu zaɓen rubutu.','Change dark mode (Pro)'=>'Canza yanayin duhu (Pro)','Sets dark mode (mode: off, auto or toggle) and its colours.'=>'Yana sa yanayin duhu (yanayin: a kashe, ta atomatik ko juyawa) da launukansa.','Read the site design'=>'Karanta tsarin gidan yanar gizon','Returns the site-wide colours and fonts (heading and body) every block uses, as the Site design screen shows them.'=>'Yana dawo da launuka da rubututtuka na shafin gaba ɗaɗiya (take da jiki) da kowane tubali ke amfani da su, kamar yadda allon zane na Shafin ke nuna su.','Change the site design'=>'Canza fasalin shafin','Changes the site-wide colours (colors), fonts (fonts, headingFont, bodyFont). Every page picks the change up; the theme\'s theme.json is kept in sync.'=>'Yana canza launi da kuma nau\'in rubutu (fonts, headingFont, bodyFont) na dukan gidan yanar gizon. Kowace shafi yana karɓar sauye-sauyen; ana kiyaye theme.json na jigo tare da jituwa.','Read the design system (Pro)'=>'Karanta tsarin zane (Pro)','Returns the Pro design system: global classes, variables, design tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts.'=>'Yana dawo da tsarin zane na Pro: azuzuwan duniya, masu canzawa, alamomin zane, yanayin duhu, kayan aikin alama da rubutun hannu na al\'ada.','Change the design tokens (Pro)'=>'Canza alamomin ƙira (Pro)','Changes the spacing, radius and shadow scales (space, radius, shadow), or resets them (reset).'=>'Canza tazara, radius da sikelin inuwa (space, radius, shadow), ko kuma a mayar da su yadda suke a da (reset).','Change the CSS variables (Pro)'=>'Canza masu canjin CSS (Pro)','Replaces the site\'s design variables (variables: a list of name and value).'=>'Yana maye gurbin abubuwan da ake canzawa na tsarin rukunin yanar gizo (canji-canji: jerin suna da ƙima).','List the dynamic content sources (Pro)'=>'Jer 목록 abubuwan da ke cikin shafi mai canzawa (Pro)','Returns what a block can be filled from (post, author, site, archive, custom field, product) with each source\'s fields, the field plugins on this site (ACF, Meta Box, Pods, JetEngine, Toolset, post meta) and a post type\'s fields (postType). Bind a block with pbs/update-block: attributes.metadata.bindings.<attribute> = {source, args}.'=>'Yana dawo da abin da za a iya cika buloka daga ciki (rubutu, marubuci, shafin yanar gizo, tarihin adana bayanan baya, filin musamman, samfur) tare da filayen kowane tushe, matosai na fili a kan wannan shafin (ACF, Meta Box, Pods, JetEngine, Toolset, post meta) da filayen nau\'in rubutu (postType). Haɗa buloka tare da pbs/update-block: attributes.metadata.bindings.<attribute> = {source, args}.','Preview a dynamic value (Pro)'=>'Yi samfurin ƙima mai motsi (Pro)','Returns what a binding shows on one post (post, source, and field or provider + key, as text|url), to check a binding before or after adding it.'=>'Yana dawo da abin da wani ɗauri ke nunawa a kan guda ɗaya (post, source, da field ko provider + key, azaman text|url), don bincika ɗauri kafin ko bayan ƙara shi.','Remove a self-hosted font'=>'Cire rubutun da kake dauka da kanka','Deletes a self-hosted font family\'s files.'=>'Yana goge fayilolin dangin rubutu na kansa.','List self-hosted fonts'=>'Jera font ɗin da aka yi hosting ɗin su a kanka','Lists the Google fonts this site hosts itself (downloaded once, served from the site, no request to Google).'=>'Ana lissafin Google fonts waɗannan shafuka da suke ɗaukar nauyin kansu (an sauke sau ɗaya, an bayar daga shafin, babu buƙata ga Google).','Self-host a font'=>'Sanya font a kan naku uwar garken','Downloads a Google font family (family, weights, italic) and serves it from this site.'=>'Yana sauke dangi na rubutun Google (dangi, nauyi, italic) kuma yana ba da shi daga wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','List forms'=>'Jeridodin fom','Lists the forms built with the Form block and the form plugins it can embed.'=>'Yana lissafin fom ɗin da aka gina tare da tubalin Form da kuma abubuwan toshe fom ɗin da zai iya sakawa.','List uploaded icons'=>'Jeri hotunan da aka ɗora','Lists the SVG icons uploaded to the icon library, newest first.'=>'Yana lissafin alamomin SVG da aka igo zuwa ɗakin karatu na alamomi, daga mafi sabuntawa zuwa na baya.','Upload an icon'=>'Loda gunkni','Adds an SVG icon (name, svg markup) to the icon library; the SVG is sanitised first.'=>'Yana ƙara alamar SVG (suna, alamar SVG) zuwa ɗakin karatu na alamomi; an fara tsabtace SVG ɗin tukuna.','Delete an uploaded icon'=>'Goge gunkin da aka loda','Removes an uploaded icon; blocks that used it keep their own copy.'=>'Yana cire hoton da aka loda; tubalan da suka yi amfani da shi suna riƙe da nasu kwafin.','Read the licence'=>'Karanta lasisi','Returns this site\'s Page Builder Sandwich plan, licence state, renewal date and what the plan includes.'=>'Yana dawo da tsarin shafin Page Builder Sandwich na wannan rukunin yanar gizo, yanayin lasisi, ranar sabuntawa da abin da tsarin ya ƙunsa.','Disconnect from support'=>'Cire daga tallafi','Disconnects this site from support.'=>'Yana cire haɗin wannan shafin daga tallafi.','Read the support connection'=>'Karanta hanyar haɗin tallafi','Says whether this site is connected to Zinn Digital® support, and as whom.'=>'Yana nuna ko an haɗa wannan rukunin yanar gizon da goyon bayan Zinn Digital®, kuma a matsayin wane ne.','Connect to support'=>'Haɗa zuwa ga goyon baya','Connects this site to Zinn Digital® support (name, email, consent).'=>'Ya haɗa wannan shafin da tallafin Zinn Digital® (suna, imel, izini).','Consent to support diagnostics'=>'Yardewa ga binciken tallafi','Records the administrator\'s consent to send diagnostics with support tickets.'=>'Yana rubuta amincewar mai gudanarwa don aika da bayanan bincike tare da tikitin goyon baya.','Read the site diagnostics'=>'Karanta bayanan binciken rukunin yanar gizo','Returns the diagnostics a support ticket would carry: versions, active plugins, limits and recent errors.'=>'Yana mayar da bayanan bincike da tikitin tallafi zai ɗauka: nau\'ikan software, abubuwan haɗin da ke aiki, iyakoki da kuskuren da suka faru kwanan nan.','Open a support ticket'=>'Buɗe tikitin tallafi','Files a support ticket (subject, message, kind, email), with this site\'s diagnostics when the administrator agreed. It never creates a login or sends one.'=>'Yana shigar da tikitin tallafi (jigo, sakon, nau\'i, imel), tare da bayanan binciken wannan shafin lokacin da mai kula da tsarin ya yarda. Ba ya taba ƙirƙirar shiga ko aika da ɗaya.','Start the free Pro trial'=>'Fara gwajin Pro kyauta','Starts the 14-day Page Builder Sandwich Pro trial for this site (no payment needed).'=>'Yana fara gwajin kwanaki 14 na Page Builder Sandwich Pro don wannan rukunin yanar gizon (ba a buƙatar biya ba).','Read the cloud library account (Pro)'=>'Karanta asusun laburare na girgije (Pro)','Returns the cloud library\'s storage use, plan quota and team facts.'=>'Yana dawo da amfani da ajiya na laburaren gajimare, rabon tsari da kuma bayanan tawaga.','List cloud library designs (Pro)'=>'Jeriƙo zane-zanen ɗakin karatu na gajimare (Pro)','Lists the designs saved to the cloud library (kind: section, page or pattern; team: a team\'s library).'=>'Ana lissafin zanen da aka adana a dakin karatu na gajere (irin: sashe, shafi ko tsari; tawaga: dakin karatu na tawaga).','Save a design to the cloud library (Pro)'=>'Ajiye wani zane a cikin laburare na gajimare (Pro)','Saves block markup (title, kind, markup, styles, tags) to your cloud library or a team\'s; images are packed with it.'=>'Yana adana alamar block (taken, nau\'i, alama, salon, tags) zuwa ga ajiyar ku ta gajere (cloud library) ko ta tawaga; ana tattara hotuna tare da ita.','Delete a cloud library design (Pro)'=>'Goge ƙirar ɗakin karatu na girgije (Pro)','Deletes a design from the cloud library.'=>'Yana goge wani zane daga ɗakin karatu na gajimare.','Get a cloud library design (Pro)'=>'Samu wani tsarin ɗakin karatu na gajimare (Pro)','Returns one saved design, ready to insert on this site (its images brought into the media library).'=>'Yana dawo da zanannen zane guda daya, a shirye domin sakawa a kan wannan rukunin yanar gizon (hotunansa sun shiga cikin littafin adana kafofin watsa labarai).','Leave a team (Pro)'=>'Bar ƙungiya (Pro)','Leaves the team library this site joined.'=>'Barin ɗakin karatu na ƙungiyar da wannan shafin ya shiga.','Join a team (Pro)'=>'Shiga kungiya (Pro)','Joins a team library with an invite code.'=>'Ana shiga ɗakin karatu na ƙungiya da lambar gayyata.','Stop using your own storage (Pro)'=>'Dacha amfani da nata ajiya (Pro)','Removes the bring-your-own storage settings; the plan storage is used again.'=>'Yana cire saitunan ajiya na ku na sirri; ana sake amfani da ajiyar tsarin.','Read the own-storage settings (Pro)'=>'Karanta saitunan ajiya na kanka (Pro)','Returns the bring-your-own R2/S3 storage settings (the secret is never returned).'=>'Ana dawo da saitunan ajiya na kawo-kawo-kai R2/S3 (ba a taba dawo da sirrin ba).','Use your own storage (Pro)'=>'Yi amfani da naka ma\'ajiya (Pro)','Saves bring-your-own storage: provider (r2 or s3), bucket, region, endpoint, prefix, key_id, secret, enabled.'=>'Adana ajiya ta kanka: mai bada sabis (r2 ko s3), kwano, yanki, wurin ƙarshe, prefix, key_id, secret, enabled.','Test your own storage (Pro)'=>'Gwada ajiyar ku (Pro)','Writes, reads and deletes a test object in your own storage and reports each step.'=>'Yana rubutawa, karantawa, da goge abin gwaji a cikin wurin ajiyar ku kuma yana ba da rahoto kan kowane mataki.','List library teams (Pro)'=>'Jerƙun ƙungiyoyin ɗakin karatu (Pro)','Lists the teams this site belongs to or owns.'=>'Wannan yana lissafin ƙungiyoyin da wannan shafin ya mallaka ko yake ciki.','Create a library team (Agency)'=>'Ƙirƙirar ƙungiyar ɗakin karatu (Hukuma)','Creates a team library (name) that other sites can join with an invite code.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar littafin tawaga (name) wanda wasu shafuka za su iya shiga da lambar gayyata.','Delete a library team (Agency)'=>'Shareƙar tawagar ɗakin karatu (Hukuma)','Deletes a team and every design in its library.'=>'Yana goge ƙungiyar da kowane zane a cikin ɗakin karatu nata.','Invite a site to a team (Agency)'=>'Gayyaci wani rukunin yanar gizo zuwa ga tawaga (Kamfani)','Creates a single-use invite code (role: read or write; label; days valid). The code is shown once.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar lambar gayyata ta amfani guda ɗaya (Matsayi: karatu ko rubutu; alama; kwanakin inganci). Ana nuna lambar sau ɗaya.','List team members (Pro)'=>'Jeristar mambobin kungiya (Pro)','Lists the sites in a team and their access.'=>'Yana lissafin shafuka a cikin ƙung దాని da samun dama gare su.','Remove a team member (Agency)'=>'Cire memba daga tawaga (Hukuma)','Removes a site from a team.'=>'Yana cire shafin yanar gizo daga ƙungiya.','Add a query loop (Pro)'=>'Ƙara madaukin bincike (Pro)','Adds a query loop with a ready-made card, on a new page (pageTitle, status) or at the end of a post (post): source posts|users|terms|field, postType (product for a shop grid), perPage, columns, orderBy, order, pagination, and live filters [{type: search|taxonomy|meta|sort|price|onsale|instock, taxonomy, key, label, ui}].'=>'Yana ƙara madauki na tambaya tare da katin da aka riga aka shirya, a kan sabon shafi (pageTitle, status) ko a ƙarshen post (post): source posts|users|terms|field, postType (samfurin don grid ɗin shago), perPage, columns, orderBy, order, pagination, da matattara masu aiki live [{type: search|taxonomy|meta|sort|price|onsale|instock, taxonomy, key, label, ui}].','List Lottie animations (Pro)'=>'Sanya jerin raye-rayen Lottie (Pro)','Lists the uploaded Lottie animations.'=>'Ana lissafin hotunan motsi na Lottie da aka ɗora.','Upload a Lottie animation (Pro)'=>'Sanya wani zane mai motsi na Lottie (Pro)','Validates a Lottie JSON document (json, name) and publishes it as a static file for the Lottie block.'=>'Yana tabbatar da takardar Lottie JSON (json, name) kuma yana buga ta a matsayin fayil mai tsauri don bulok din Lottie.','List the A/B tests and their results (Pro)'=>'Yi lissafin gwaje-gwajen A/B da sakamakonsu (Pro)','Lists the A/B tests with each version\'s visitors and conversions, and which one is winning.'=>'Yana lissafin gwaje-gwajen A/B tare da masu ziyara da juyawa na kowane nau\'i, da wacce ke nasara.','Create an A/B test (Pro)'=>'Ƙirƙiri gwajin A/B (Pro)','Adds a test of two versions of a section to the end of a post (post, name, a, b; split and goal optional).'=>'Yana ƙara gwajin nau\'ikan sassa biyu a ƙarshen bayani (post, name, a, b; raba da burin zaɓi ne).','Reset an A/B test\'s results (Pro)'=>'Sake saita sakamakon gwajin A/B (Pro)','Clears a test\'s counts and starts it again (test).'=>'Yana share lissafin gwaji kuma yana sake farawa (gwaji).','List the mailing-list connections (Pro)'=>'Jeriƙo haɗin gwiwar jerin imel (Pro)','Lists the mailing-list services (Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit, ActiveCampaign) and which are connected. Keys are never returned.'=>'Yana lissafin ayyukan jerin saƙon imel (Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit, ActiveCampaign) da waɗanda aka haɗa. Ba a taba dawo da mabullan ba.','Connect a mailing-list service (Pro)'=>'Haɗa sabis na jerin imel (Pro)','Connects a mailing-list service with its API key (service, key; account where the service needs one), or disconnects it with an empty key.'=>'Yana haɗa sabis na jerin imel da maɓallin API ɗinsa (sabis, maɓallin; asusun da sabis ɗin ke buƙatar ɗaya), ko kuma ya cire shi da maɓalli mara kyau.','List a service\'s mailing lists (Pro)'=>'Lissafin jerin sunayen masu karɓar saƙon sabis (Pro)','Lists the audiences or lists of a connected mailing-list service, for a form\'s subscribe action.'=>'Yana lissafin masu sauraro ko jerin sunayen wani sabis na jerin imel da aka haɗa, don aikin yin rajista na fom.','Read the cookie consent banner (Pro)'=>'Karanta tutar yardar kuki (Pro)','Returns the consent banner: whether it is on, its text and design, the categories, and where it applies.'=>'Yana dawo da tutar amincewa: ko tana kunne, rubutunta da tsarinta, nau\'ikan, da inda ta shafa.','Change the cookie consent banner (Pro)'=>'Canza taken yardardar cookie (Pro)','Changes the consent banner. While it is on, tracking scripts wait for the visitor\'s consent.'=>'Yana sauya tutar yarda. Yayin da take kunne, rubutun sa ido na jira har sai mai ziyara ya bada izini.','Create a starter cookie banner (Pro)'=>'Ƙirƙiri tutar kukis ɗin farawa (Pro)','Creates a ready-made consent banner design to start from.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar zane na tutar yarda da aka shirya wanda za a iya farawa da shi.','List the form-builder forms (Pro)'=>'Jeranta fom ɗin masu ginin fom (Pro)','Lists every form made with the form builder: the page it is on, its fields and what happens when it is sent.'=>'Yana lissafin kowace fom da aka yi da mai gina fom: shafin da take, filayenta da abin da ke faruwa lokacin da aka tura ta.','Create a form (Pro)'=>'Ƙirƙiri fom (Pro)','Creates a form (contact, quote, signup or multi-step: fields, steps, settings and actions such as email, save, webhook or a mailing list), on a new page or at the end of an existing post (post).'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar fom (na tuntuɓe, na faɗin farashi, na rajista ko mai matakai da yawa: filaye, matakai, saituna da ayyuka kamar imel, adanawa, webhook ko jerin imel), a kan sabon shafi ko a ƙarshen wani rubutu da ke akwai (rubutu).','Change a form (Pro)'=>'Canji a cikin fom (Pro)','Changes one form (post, form): settings and actions merge with what is there; fields (and steps) replace the fields.'=>'Canje-canje a siga ɗaya (lambar aikawa, sigar shigarwa): saituna da ayyuka sun haɗu da abin da ke wurin; filaye (da matakai) sun may gurbin filayen.','List the animation and interaction settings (Pro)'=>'Jeranta saitunan motsi da hulɗa (Pro)','Returns every motion setting (entrance animation, its length and delay, scroll effect, hover effect, stay in view, parallax, follow the pointer) with its choices or range, and the site\'s breakpoints.'=>'Yana dawo da kowane saitin motsi (rarrashin shiga, tsawonsa da jinkirinsa, tasirin gungurawa, tasirin shawagi, tsayawa a gani, parallax, bin mai nuni) tare da zaɓuɓɓuka ko kewayonsa, da wuraren karyewar shafin.','Animate a block (Pro)'=>'Mai da tubali mai motsi (Pro)','Sets or removes (null) motion settings on one block of a page, found by its path, at a breakpoint (base by default). Works on any block, including core blocks whose HTML is saved in the page. Visitors who ask for reduced motion never see the movement.'=>'Saita ko cire (null) saitunan motsi a kan wani bulu na shafin, wanda aka samo ta hanyarsa, a wani wurin karya (tushe ta tsohuwa). Yana aiki a kan kowane bulu, gami dainiyah bulu wanda aka adana HTML ɗinsu a cikin shafin. Baƙi waɗanda suka nemi raguwar motsi ba sa ganin motsin ko kaɗan.','List the popups (Pro)'=>'Jeristsa taga-taga (Pro)','Lists the popups, slide-ins and bars with their triggers, frequency rules and where they show.'=>'Yana lissafin popups, slide-ins da kuma sanduna tare da abubuwan da ke jawo su, dokokin mita da inda suke nunawa.','Create a popup (Pro)'=>'Ƙirƙiri taga mai fitowa (Pro)','Creates a popup, slide-in or bar: its content, trigger (exit intent, scroll, time, click), frequency and the pages it shows on.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar taga mai fitowa ta bazata, ta faɗo ko sandararriya: abubuwan da ke ciki, mai tayar da ita (niyyar fita, gungurawa, lokaci, danna), mita da shafukan da take nunawa.','Change a popup (Pro)'=>'Canza taga mai fitowa (Pro)','Changes a popup, slide-in or bar (id): content, trigger, frequency or where it shows.'=>'Canza taga-tashi, mai-suliyewa ko sandar (id): abubuwa ciki, abin da ke haddasa ta, yawan fitowa ko inda take nuna.','Read form submissions (Pro)'=>'Karanta aiko da fom (Pro)','Lists what visitors sent through the forms that save submissions (form narrows it), a page at a time.'=>'Yana lissafin abubuwan da baƙi suka aika ta hanyar fom ɗin da ke adana abubuwan da aka ƙaddamar (fom ɗin yana taƙaita shi), shafi ɗaya a lokaci ɗaya.','Read the conversion tracking (Pro)'=>'Karanta bin diddigin juyawa (Pro)','Returns the Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager and Meta Pixel settings and which clicks and form submissions are sent.'=>'Yana dawo da saitunan Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager da Meta Pixel da kuma wane latsawa da gabatar da fom aka aika.','Change the conversion tracking (Pro)'=>'Canza waƙar juyawa (Pro)','Changes the Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager and Meta Pixel settings and which events are sent.'=>'Canji saitunan Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager da Meta Pixel da kuma abubuwan da ake turawa.','Read the legacy migration'=>'Karanta tsohuwar ƙaura','Returns the 5.x content conversion\'s progress and report.'=>'Yana dawo da ci gaba da rahoton juyar da abun ciki na 5.x.','Convert legacy content'=>'Maida tsohon abun ciki sabon salo','Starts (or restarts) converting every 5.x page to blocks; each post is backed up first.'=>'Yana fara (ko kuma sake farawa) jujjuya kowane shafi na 5.x zuwa tubalan; ana adana kowane post kafin komai.','Undo the legacy migration'=>'Sake mayar da tsohuwar hijira zuwa asali','Restores every converted post from its backup.'=>'Yana mayar da kowane sakon da aka canza daga madadin ajiyarsa.','Read the newsletter connection (Pro)'=>'Karanta hanyar haɗin wasiƙar labarai (Pro)','Says whether a Mailchimp key is saved (the key itself is never returned).'=>'Yana nuna ko an adana maɓallin Mailchimp (ba a taba dawo da maɓallin da kansa ba).','Connect Mailchimp (Pro)'=>'Haɗa Mailchimp (Pro)','Saves (or, with an empty value, removes) the Mailchimp API key the newsletter block uses.'=>'Yana adanawa (ko, tare da babu komai, yana cirewa) maɓallin API na Mailchimp wanda tubalin jaridar ke amfani da shi.','Convert one legacy page'=>'Mayar da tsohon shafi guda ɗaya','Converts one 5.x page to blocks (backed up first).'=>'Yana sauya shafi daya na 5.x zuwa tubalan (an fara adana madadin).','Undo one conversion'=>'Sake mayar da juyawa ɗaya gaba','Restores one converted page from its backup.'=>'Mayar da shafi ɗaya da aka sauya daga madogaran ajiyarsa.','Read the reviews sources (Pro)'=>'Karanta tushen sharhi (Pro)','Returns the Google and Trustpilot sources the Reviews block shows.'=>'Yana dawo da majiyoyin Google da Trustpilot waɗanda tubalin Reviews ke nunawa.','Change the reviews sources (Pro)'=>'Canza tusoshin bita (Pro)','Sets the Google place and Trustpilot business the Reviews block reads.'=>'Yana sa wurin Google da kasuwancin Trustpilot da toshe Nazari yake karantawa.','Refresh reviews now (Pro)'=>'Sabunta bituttuka yanzu (Pro)','Fetches the latest Trustpilot reviews now instead of waiting for the daily refresh.'=>'Yana dauko sabbin bituttuka na Trustpilot yanzu maimakon jiran sabuntawa ta kullum.','Read the plugin settings'=>'Karanta saitunan plugin','Returns the front-end class prefix, the beta-updates state and whether AI agents (MCP) are allowed.'=>'Yana dawo da prefix din aji na gaba (front-end class prefix), yanayin sabuntawar beta da kuma ko an yarda da wakilan AI (MCP).','Change the plugin settings'=>'Canza saitunan plugin','Changes the front-end class prefix (1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter) and/or turns AI agents (MCP) on or off (mcp: false removes every ability and the MCP endpoint).'=>'Canza gabobin sahun gaba na aji (haruffa kanana ko lambobi 1 zuwa 8, daga harafi) da/ko kunna ko kashe wakilan AI (MCP) (mcp: false yana cire duk wata dama da kuma tashar MCP).','Add a product block or mini cart (Pro)'=>'Ƙara wani rukunin samfur ko ƙaramin kanti (Pro)','Adds a WooCommerce block at the end of a post: a product element (part: title, gallery, image, price, rating, excerpt, description, add_to_cart, meta, tabs, related, upsells, sale_badge, stock; productId, or 0 for the product being viewed) or a mini cart (label).'=>'Yana ƙara wani buloko na WooCommerce a ƙarshen rubutu: abin samfur (sashe: take, gidan hotuna, hoto, farashin, ƙima, bayani, bayanin martaba, add_to_cart, meta, shafuka, masu alaƙa, upsells, sale_badge, stock; productId, ko 0 don samfurin da ake kallo) ko kuma ƙaramin keken sayayya (lakabi).','Read the theme builder\'s choices (Pro)'=>'Karanta zaɓuɓɓukan mai gina jigo (Pro)','Returns the template types, the display-condition kinds (page, post type, term, archive, search, 404, logged in, role, device, date, time, URL parameter, referrer, language, cart) with their choices on this site (roles, languages, post types, taxonomies), and the block attribute (pbswConditions: {match, rules}) that shows or hides any block — set it with pbs/update-block.'=>'Yana dawo da nau\'ikan samfuri, nau\'ikan yanayin nunawa (shafi, nau\'in post, kalma, baje koli, bincike, 404, an shiga, matsayi, na\'ura, kwanan wata, lokaci, ma\'apin URL, mai aikawa, harshe, keken siyayya) tare da zaɓinsu a wannan rukunin yanar gizon (matsayi, harsuna, nau\'ikan post, taksonomies), da sifa ta toshe (pbswConditions: {match, rules}) wacce ke nunawa ko ɓoye kowane toshe — saita shi tare da pbs/update-block.','List the theme templates (Pro)'=>'Jeriya samfuran jigo (Pro)','Lists the theme builder\'s templates (header, footer, single, archive, search, 404 and, with WooCommerce, product, shop, cart, checkout, thank-you and My Account): each one\'s type, where it shows (include/exclude rules), priority, status and blocks.'=>'Yana lissafin samfuran mai Gina jigo (kai, ƙafa, guda ɗaya, wurin ajiyar tsoffin bayanai, bincike, 404 da, tare da WooCommerce, samfur, shago, keken siya, wurin biyan kuɗi, godiya da My Account): nau\'in kowanne, inda yake nunawa (haɗawa/cire dokoki), fifiko, matsayi da tubalan.','Create a theme template (Pro)'=>'Ƙirƙiri samfurin jigo (Pro)','Creates a template (title, type) that replaces that part of every matching page, on classic and block themes. Without content it starts from a ready-made design for its type. include/exclude are display-condition rules ({kind, values, key, value, from, to, days}; see pbs/get-theme-builder-options); priority breaks ties; status publish (live) or draft.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar samfuri (taken, nau\'i) wanda ke maye gurbin wani bangare na kowane shafi mai dacewa, akan jigo na gargajiya da na katako. Idan babu abun ciki, yana farawa daga ingantaccen tsari don nau\'insa. include/exclude dokoki ne na yanayin nunawa ({kind, values, key, value, from, to, days}; dubi pbs/get-theme-builder-options); fifiko yana warware matsaloli; matsayi publish (live) ko draft.','Delete a theme template (Pro)'=>'Sharewar jigo mai jigo (Pro)','Moves one template (id) to the trash; the theme\'s own design shows again where it applied. Restorable from the trash.'=>'Yana matsar da samfuri guda (id) zuwa ga shara; asalin zane na jigon yana sake bayyana inda aka yi amfani da shi. Ana iya dawo da shi daga cikin shara.','Change a theme template (Pro)'=>'Canza jigon jigo (Pro)','Changes one template (id): any of title, type, content (block markup), include, exclude, priority, status. Only what you send changes.'=>'Canje-canje ga samfuri ɗaya (id): kowanne daga cikin take, nau\'i, abun ciki (block markup), haɗawa, cirewa, fifiko, matsayi. Abin da ka aika kawai ne zai canza.','Export designs and settings'=>'Fitar da zane-zane da saituna','Exports the chosen templates and patterns (ids) and, optionally, settings as one package for another site.'=>'Yana fitar da zaɓaɓɓun samfura da tsaruka (IDs) da kuma, a matsayin zaɓi, saitunan a matsayin fakiti ɗaya don wani rukunin yanar gizo daban.','Import designs and settings'=>'Shigo da zane-zane da saituna','Imports a package made by pbs/export-designs (dryRun first to see what would change; mode: skip or replace; media; settings).'=>'Yana shigo da fakitin da pbs/export-designs ya ƙirƙira (dryRun da farko don ganin abin da zai canza; yanayi: tsallake ko maye gurbin; kafofin watsa labarai; saituna).','List what can be exported'=>'JermessageInfo abin da za a iya fitarwa waje','Lists the templates, patterns and settings that can be exported to another site.'=>'Yana lissafin samfuran, tsarare-tsarare, da saitunan da za a iya fitarwa zuwa wani shafin.','Read maintenance mode (Pro)'=>'Karanta yanayin kulawa (Pro)','Returns maintenance / coming-soon mode: mode, page, retry-after and which roles still see the site.'=>'Mayar da shafin zuwa na gyara / ana kan ginawa: yanayi, shafi, sake gwadawa-bayan da kuma wane matsayi ne har yanzu suke ganin shafin.','Change maintenance mode (Pro)'=>'Canza yanayin gyara (Pro)','Turns maintenance (503) or coming-soon mode on or off (mode), with the page to show (page_id), retry_after and the roles that bypass it.'=>'Yana kunna yanayin gyaran gida (503) ko zuwa nan gaba ba da jimawa ba ko kashe shi (mode), tare da shafin da za a nuna (page_id), retry_after da kuma matsayin da suke ketare shi.','List find-and-replace jobs (Pro)'=>'Jeranta ayyukan nema da maye gurbi (Pro)','Lists the site-wide find-and-replace jobs and their state.'=>'Ana lissafa ayyukan bincike-da-maye gurbi na rukunin yanar gizo da yanayin su.','Find and replace across the site (Pro)'=>'Nemo kuma a maye gurbinshi a fadin shafin (Pro)','Starts a block-safe find-and-replace (find, replace, kind: text, link or colour; match_case; types). Nothing changes until pbs/apply-replace.'=>'Yana ƙaddamar da bincike da maye gurbin da ke da tsaron tubali (find, replace, kind: text, link or colour; match_case; types). Babu wani abu da zai canza har sai an yi pbs/apply-replace.','Preview a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Yi samfurin bincike da maye gurbi (Pro)','Returns a job\'s matches, page by page, to review before applying.'=>'Yana dawo da abubuwan da suka dace da aiki, shafi bayan shafi, don dubawa kafin a nema.','Apply a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Afa nesa-da-maye (Pro)','Applies a previewed job. Every changed post keeps a backup for pbs/undo-replace.'=>'Yana amfani da aikin da aka yi masa preview. Duk wani sako da aka canza yana riƙe da ajiyar waje don pbs/undo-replace.','Undo a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Sake a nemo da maye gurbin (Pro)','Restores the posts a job changed (a post edited since keeps its edit).'=>'Mayar da wallafe-wallafen da aikin ya canza (wallafe-wallafen da aka gyara daga baya na riƙe gyaransu).','Read builder permissions (Pro)'=>'Karanta iznin mai gina shafi (Pro)','Returns which roles may use the builder, design, code and templates (client mode).'=>'Yana dawo da waɗancan matsayai da za su iya amfani da mai ginawa, zane, lambar tare da samfuran abubuwa (yanayin abokin ciniki).','Change builder permissions (Pro)'=>'Canza izinin mai gina shafi (Pro)','Sets per role what the builder allows (roles), e.g. a content-only client role.'=>'Saita ga kowane rawar abin da mai ginawa ke izni (rawofi), misali rawar abokin ciniki na abun ciki kawai.','Read white label (Agency)'=>'Karanta babban alama (Hukuma)','Returns the white-label settings: on or off, the name shown and which users still see the original.'=>'Yana dawo da saitunan alamar fari: a kunne ko a kashe, sunan da aka nuna da kuma masu amfani da ke ci gaba da ganin na asali.','Change white label (Agency)'=>'Canji farar lakabi (Kamfani)','Turns white label on or off and sets the name clients see (enabled, name, agency_users).'=>'Yana kunna ko kashe farar lakabi kuma yana saita sunan da abokan ciniki ke gani (an kunna, suna, agency_users).','Build several pages'=>'Gina shafuka da yawa','Creates up to 50 pages in one call, each from sections and/or block content. Each page is checked and created on its own; the answer lists every page made and every one refused, with the reason.'=>'Yana ƙirƙirar shafuka har 50 a kira ɗaya, kowanne daga sassa da/ko abubuwan toshewa. Ana bincika kowane shafi kuma a ƙirƙira shi shi kaɗai; amsar tana lissafa kowane shafi da aka yi da kowane wanda aka ƙi, tare da dalili.','Write a page with AI'=>'Rubuta shafi tare da AI','Builds a page from sections (given, or chosen by AI from the section library) and has AI rewrite all of its text for your brief, keeping the design. Uses the AI provider set up in the plugin\'s AI settings. The page is a draft unless another status is asked for.'=>'Yana gina shafi daga sassa (waɗanda aka bayar, ko AI ta zaɓa daga littafin karatu na sassa) kuma yana sa AI ta sake rubuta duk rubutunsa don taƙaitaccen bayanin ku, tare da kiyaye ƙirar. Yana amfani da mai samar da AI da aka saita a cikin saitunan AI na plugin ɗin. Shafin daftari ne sai dai idan an nemi wani matsayi daban.','What the page is for: the business, the offer, the audience and the tone.'=>'Abin da shafin ya ƙunsa: kasuwanci, tayin, masu sauraro da kuma salo.','Send between 1 and %d pages.'=>'Aika tsakanin shafi 1 da %d.','AI is not available in this build.'=>'Ba a samun AI a cikin wannan gini ba.','Describe the page in at least a sentence.'=>'Bayyana shafin aƙalla cikin jumla guda.','The AI did not choose any section from the library. Name the sections yourself, or try a more detailed brief.'=>'AI ɗin ba ta zaɓi wani sashe ba daga ɗakin karatu. Sanya sunayen sassan da kanka, ko kuma ka gwada cikakken bayani.','The AI rewrote %1$d of the page\'s %2$d pieces of text, so nothing was saved. Try again.'=>'AI ta sake rubuta %1$d daga cikin sassa %2$d na shafin, don haka ba a adana komai ba. Sake gwadawa.','The AI request failed. Try again.'=>'Ba a yi nasarar aiwatar da buƙatar AI ba. Sake gwadawa.','A migration step is running right now. Try again in a minute.'=>'Ana gudanar da wani matakin kaura a yanzu. Sake gwadawa bayan minti daya.','Rated %s out of 5'=>'An kimanta %s cikin 5','Adults only: %d and over'=>'Manyan mutane kawai: %d da sama da haka','Pros'=>'Abbuwa masu kyau','Cons'=>'Mara da marasa kyau','%1$s out of %2$s'=>'%1$s daga cikin %2$s','Claim offer'=>'Yi da\'awar tayin','New customers only. Terms and conditions apply.'=>'Sababbin abokan ciniki kawai. Sharudda da dokoki sun shafi.','Rank'=>'Matsa