ite; the next refresh tries again.'=>'Ba a iya samun sabis na bita ba. Bita na ƙarshe sun kasance a shafin; sabuntawa na gaba zai sake gwadawa.','The review service refused the request (HTTP %d). Check the API key and the ID.'=>'Sabis ɗin bitar ya ƙi amincewa da buƙatar (HTTP %d). Bincika maɓallin API da ID ɗin.','The review service says the API quota is used up. The last reviews stay on the site.'=>'Sabis na bita ya ce an gama kaso na API. Bituttukan da suka gabata za su ci gaba da kasancewa a shafin.','The review service answered with an error (HTTP %d). The last reviews stay on the site.'=>'Ayyukan bita sun dawo da kuskure (HTTP %d). Bituttukan da suka gabata suna nan a shafin.','That template type does not exist on this site.'=>'Wannan nau\'in samfurin baya wanzuwa a wannan shafin.','The template could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana samfurin ba.','The template could not be moved to the trash.'=>'Ba a iya matsar da samfurin zuwa cikin shara ba.','That post does not exist.'=>'Wannan wallafar ba ta wanzu.','List'=>'Jereni','Activate WooCommerce first.'=>'Fara kunna WooCommerce da farko.','You cannot create pages.'=>'Ba za ka iya ƙirƙirar shafuka ba.','Entire site'=>'Dukiyar shafin gaba daya','Front page'=>'Shafi na gaba','Specific posts or pages'=>'Takamaiman posts ko shafuka','In a category or tag'=>'A cikin rukunin ko alama','Search results'=>'Sakamakon bincike','Page not found (404)'=>'Ba a sami shafin ba (404)','Logged in or out'=>'An shiga ko an fita','User role'=>'Matsayin mai amfani','Device'=>'Na\'ura','Date range'=>'Wurin kwanan wata','Time of day'=>'Lokacin rana','URL parameter'=>'Ma\'aunin URL','Referrer'=>'Mai kawo ziyara','Language'=>'Harshe','Cart contents'=>'Abubuwan da ke cikin keken kaya','%1$s; except: %2$s'=>'%1$s; ban da: %2$s','The page you were looking for is not here. Try a search instead.'=>'Shafin da kake nema ba ya nan. Madadin haka, gwada bincike.','Thank you for your order'=>'Na gode da odarka','Design this template with any blocks.'=>'