'Kafin ka tuntuɓi tallafi','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'An tura buƙatarka daga wannan rukunin yanar gizon zuwa %s, waɗanda suka yi wannan plugin ɗin. Muna aika da:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'adireshin imel dinka da sunanka, domin mu iya ba da amsa;','the subject and message you write;'=>'taken da sakon da ka rubuta;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'ID din lasisin ku, ta yadda abokan ciniki masu biya ke samun fifiko;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'idan ka saka alama kawai: bayanan shafin (sigogin WordPress da PHP, jigo, plugins, da wani sashi na ragowar kuskure tare da cire kalmomin sirri da adiresoshin imel), wadanda za ka iya karantawa kafin turawa;','I agree, continue'=>'Na yarda, ci gaba','The connection could not be checked.'=>'Ba a iya bincika hanyar haɗin ba.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Hakan bai yi aiki ba. Sake gwadawa.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® support sun katse wannan shafin.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Taimakon Zinn Digital® ba ya sake amince da wannan shafin.','You disconnected this site.'=>'Kun cire haɗin wannan shafin.','Connect this site to support'=>'Haɗa wannan shafin da tallafi','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'An haɗa. Mayar da martani za su je %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Ba a haɗa ba. Har yanzu za ku iya aika da roƙo tare da adireshin imel ɗin ku a ƙasa; haɗawa yana ceton ku daga buga shi a kowane lokaci.','E-mail address'=>'Adireshin imel','Your name (optional)'=>'Sunanka (ba dole ba ne)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Na yarda a haɗa wannan shafin da sabis na goyon baya na Zinn Digital®. Yana aika adreshin wannan shafin, nau\'ikan WordPress da PHP da kuma nau\'ikan plugin, kuma ana iya cire haɗin a kowane lokaci daga nan ko ta Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'Haɗa','I need help'=>'Ina buƙatar taimako','Report a bug'=>'Bayar da rahoton matsala','Send feedback'=>'Aika ra\'ayi','Request a feature'=>'Nem ജi fasali','The site details could not be read.'=>'Ba a iya karanta bayanan shafin ba.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba a iya tura buƙatarka ba. Sake gwadawa bayan \'yan mintoci kaɗan.','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Ra\'ayoyi da buƙatun fasali','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'An tura. Abin tunawa naku shine %s, kuma amsar mu za ta zo ta imel.','What is it about?'=>'Me ye game da shi?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'Amsa zuwa (imel)','Subject'=>'Bayaani','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Me kuka yi, me kuka yi tsammanin zai faru, kuma me ya faru a maimakon haka?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Haɗa bayanan shafin (sigogi, jigo, plugins, sassan rahoton kuskure)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Ga abin da aka aika daidai','Loading…'=>'Ana lodawa...','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Mataki na %1$d na %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Rufe rangadin','Everything in one place'=>'Komai a wuri guda','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Wadannan shafuka suna kai ka zuwa kowane allo na plugin din: saiti, saituna, lasisin ka, taimako da sauransu.','Help on every screen'=>'Taimako a kowane allo','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Buɗe wannan menu don samun jagora zuwa allon da kake ciki, wannan yawon buɗe ido, ko kuma don neman taimako daga gare mu.','Light or dark'=>'Mai haske ko duhu','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Zaɓi mai haske, mai duhu, ko dai daidai da na kwamfutar taka. Zaɓinka na adane domin kai kaɗai.','Welcome'=>'Marhabin','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Wannan gajeren rangadin yana nuna inda abubuwa suke. Za ku iya barinsa a kowane lokaci tare da Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Shafinka a takaice','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Ana nuna ci gaban saiti da shirin ku a nan, tare da abu na gaba da ya kamata a yi.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Tsarin ku, shafuka nawa yake rufewa, da kuma ko wannan kwafin shafikayan yana ƙidaya zuwa ga wannan iyaka.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Gwada Pro ko haɓaka','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Fara gwaji kyauta ba tare da katin banki ba, haɓaka, ko sabuntawa, duk daga nan.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Kowane fasali da tsarin da ya ƙunshi shi. Bincika wani fasali ko nuna wuri ɗaya a lokaci ɗaya.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Ƙarin bayani daga Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Fina-finan da ke aiki tare da wannan, da kuma sabis daga ƙungiyar ɗaya. Katin da kuka ɓoye a wasu allon za a iya sake nuna su anan.','Connect for faster help'=>'Haɗa don samun taimako da sauri','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Haɗawa na zaɓi ne. Yana ba ku damar aikawa da buƙatu ba tare da shigar da imeel ɗinku ba a kowane lokaci, kuma kuna iya cire haɗin a duk lokacin da kuka dama.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Nemi taimako ko ka ba da rahoton matsala','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Bayyana abin da ya faru. Ka zaɓa ko za ka haɗa bayanai kan shafin, kuma za ka iya ganin abin da ke ciki daidai da farko.','Tell us what to build'=>'Ka gaya mana abin da za mu gina','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'Aiko da wani ra\'ayi, buƙatar wani abu, ko kowane irin ra\'ayi. Yana zuwa kai tsaye ga ƙungiyar.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Wannan yana ɗaukar ƴan mintoci kaɗan kuma yana saita %s domin ya yi aiki a kan wannan shafin nan take. Za ku iya sauya komai daga baya.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'Kun shirya. Idan wani abu bai yi aiki yadda ake tsammani ba, muna nan da nisa danna ɗaya kawai.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Mataki na %1$d na %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Gama','Skip setup'=>'Tsallake saiti','Import “%s”'=>'Shigo da "%s"','%d page imported.'=>'An shigo da shafi %d.' . "\0" . 'An shigo da shafuka %d.','edit'=>'gyara','Pages to import'=>'Shafukan da za a shigo da su','Publish the pages now (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Bugaji shafukan yanzu (idan ba haka ba an adana su a matsayin daftari)','Use the kit’s home page as the site’s front page'=>'Yi amfani da shafin gida na kayan aiki a matsayin babban shafin yanar gizon','Create a menu with the imported pages'=>'Ƙirƙiri menu tare da shafukan da aka shigo da su','Importing never changes your existing pages. Importing the same kit again updates the pages it created before.'=>'Shigo da bayanai baya canza shafukanka da suke akwai ba. Sake shigo da wannan kayan aiki zai sabunta shafukan da aka kirkira a baya.','Import'=>'Shigo da shi','Complete websites you can import in one click: pages, sections and a menu, ready for your own words and pictures. Kits come from Zinn Digital® and new ones are added every month.'=>'Cikakkun yanar gizo da za ku iya shigo da su a danna ɗaya: shafuka, sassa da menu, a shirye don naku kalmomi da hotuna. Kits ɗin sun fito ne daga Zinn Digital® kuma ana ƙara sababbi kowane wata.','Search kits'=>'Binciko kayan aiki','Category'=>'Rukuni','All categories'=>'Duk nau\'o\'i','Free and Pro'=>'Kyauta da Pro','Go Pro to import'=>'Yi Pro don shigo da kaya','No kit matches these filters.'=>'Babu kayan aikin da suka dace da waɗannan matatun.','My library'=>'Laburarena','Team'=>'Tawaga','Storage'=>'Ma\'ajiyar bayanai','Your library is kept in your own storage bucket, so no Zinn Digital® quota applies.'=>'Ana kiyaye ɗakin karamar ku a cikin kwandon ajiya na ku, saboda haka babu wani rabon Zinn Digital® da ya shafa.','%1$s of %2$s used (%3$d%%)'=>'An yi amfani da %1$s daga cikin %2$s (%3$d%%)','%1$d of %2$d designs · up to %3$s per design · images are resized to 2560 px and stored once'=>'%1$d na %2$d tsaruka · har zuwa %3$s a kowane zane · ana sake girman hotuna zuwa px 2560 kuma a adana su sau ɗaya','Deleted from your library.'=>'An cire daga littafin adana ku.','Save any section or page from the editor: open the block’s ⋮ menu and choose “Save to cloud library”. Insert saved designs from the Cloud library panel in the editor, on any of your sites.'=>'Adana kowane sashe ko shafi daga edita: buɗe menu na tubalin na ⋮ sannan ka zaɓi "Ajiye zuwa ɗakin karatu na gajimare". Saka zane-zane da aka ajiyee daga sashin ɗakin karatu na Gajimare a cikin edita, a kan kowane shafin yanar gizon ku.','Show'=>'Nuna','Everything'=>'Komai','Sections'=>'Sassa','Styles'=>'Salonki','Size'=>'Girma','Nothing saved yet.'=>'Ba a adana komai batukkan.','Delete'=>'Goge','Write a test file'=>'Rubuta fayil ɗin gwaji','Read it back'=>'Karanta shi baya','Delete it'=>'Goge shi','In your Cloudflare dashboard, open R2 Object Storage and create a bucket (for example “my-pbs-library”). Keep it private: do not connect a public domain.'=>'A cikin sashin kula da Cloudflare naka, ka bude R2 Object Storage sannan ka kirkiri wani baki (misali “my-pbs-library”). Ka bar shi a boye: kada ka haɗa da wani yanki na jama\'a (public domain).','Open “Manage API tokens” in R2 and create an API token with “Object Read & Write” permission, limited to that one bucket.'=>'Buɗe “Manage API tokens” a cikin R2 kuma ka ƙirƙiri alamar API tare da izinin “Object Read & Write”, mai iyaka ga wancan rumbu ɗaya.','Copy the Access Key ID and the Secret Access Key it shows (the secret is shown only once).'=>'Kwafi Samfurin Maɓallin Shiga da Maɓallin Shiga na Sirri da yake nuna wa (ana nuna sirrin sau ɗaya ne kacal).','Copy the S3 endpoint for your account. It looks like https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Region is “auto”.'=>'Kwafi ma\'ajiyar S3 don asusunka. Yana kama da https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Yankin shine "auto".','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”. Switch the library to your storage only when the test passes.'=>'Manna ƙimar da ke ƙasa, ajiye, sannan ka danna “Gwada haɗin gwiwa”. Canza ɗakin karatu zuwa wurin ajiyar ku kawai lokacin da gwajin ya wuce.','Create a private bucket with your provider (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO or any S3-compatible service).'=>'Ka ƙirƙiri wani bango mai zaman kansa tare da mai ba da sabis ɗinka (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO ko kowane sabis mai jituwa da S3).','Create an access key that can read, write and delete objects in that bucket only.'=>'Ƙirƙiri maɓallin samun dama wanda zai iya karanta, rubuta da goge abubuwa a cikin wannan ramin kawai.','Find the S3 endpoint (for Amazon S3: %s) and the bucket’s region.'=>'Nemo wurin S3 endpoint (don Amazon S3: %s) da kuma yankin bucket din.','Amazon S3 uses virtual-hosted addresses: switch off “Path-style addresses”. Most other services use path-style.'=>'Amazon S3 yana amfani da adiresoshin da aka karbi bakoninsu a zahiri: kashe “Adiresoshin salon hanya”. Yawancin sauran ayyuka suna amfani da salon hanya.','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”.'=>'Manna da ƙididdiga da ke ƙasa, ajiye, sannan ka latsa “Gwada haɗin gwiwa”.','Storage settings saved.'=>'An adana saitin ajiya.','Your cloud library is kept in Zinn Digital® storage with the space your plan includes. You can keep it in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket instead: then no Zinn Digital® quota applies, and every site you connect to the same bucket shares the library. Team libraries always use Zinn Digital® storage.'=>'Ana adana dakin karatu na gajimare naka a wurin ajiyar Zinn Digital® tare da sararin da tsarinka ya kunsa. Kuna iya adana shi a cikin naku Cloudflare R2 ko guga mai jituwa da S3 a maimakon haka: sannan babu kotas ɗin Zinn Digital® da ya shafi, kuma kowane rukunin yanar gizo da kuka haɗa da guga ɗaya yana raba ɗakin karatu. Laburaren tawagar koyaushe suna amfani da ajiyar Zinn Digital®.','Connect your own storage: step by step'=>'Haɗa ajiyar ku ta kanku: mataki-mataki','Another S3-compatible service'=>'Wani sabis mai jituwa da S3','Read the full guide'=>'Karanta cikakken jagorar','S3 endpoint'=>'Mahadar S3','Bucket'=>'Akwati','Region'=>'Yanki','Cloudflare R2: auto.'=>'Cloudflare R2: atomatik.','Access key ID'=>'ID na maɓallin shiga','Stored. Leave empty to keep it.'=>'An adana. Bar shi a bude don kiyaye shi.','Secret access key'=>'Maɓallin shiga na asiri','Stored encrypted on this site and never shown again. Leave empty to keep it.'=>'An adana shi a rufe a kan wannan shafin kuma ba za a sake nuna shi ba. Bar shi a bace domin ci gaba da amfani da shi.','Stored encrypted on this site. It is never sent to Zinn Digital®.'=>'An adana a rufe a kan wannan shafin. Ba a taba aika shi zuwa ga Zinn Digital® ba.','Path-style addresses'=>'Adireshin salon hanyar shiga','Folder in the bucket'=>'Babban Fayil a cikin akwati','Save'=>'Ajiye','Test connection'=>'Gwada haɗin yanar gizo','Remove these settings'=>'Cire waɗannan saitunan','Keep my library in this storage'=>'Ajiye litattafai na a wannan ma\'ajiyar','The connection test passed.'=>'Gwajin haɗin ya yi nasara.','Run “Test connection” first.'=>'Yi "Gwada haɗi" da farko.','Invite a site'=>'Gayyaci shafin','Who is it for? (optional)'=>'Na wa yake? (ba dole ba ne)','Access'=>'Shiga','Use designs (read only)'=>'Yi amfani da zane-zane (karatu kawai)','Use and save designs'=>'Yi amfani da kuma adana zane-zane','Create invite code'=>'Ƙirƙiri lambar gayyata','Give this code to the site owner. It works once, for 7 days, and is shown only now:'=>'Ka ba da wannan lambar ga mai shafin. Tana aiki sau ɗaya ne, na tsawon kwanaki 7, kuma ana nuna ta a yanzu kawai:','Copy'=>'Kwafi','Members'=>'Mambobi','No site has joined yet.'=>'Babu wani rukunin yanar gizo da ya shiga tukuna.','use and save'=>'yi amfani kuma a adana','read only'=>'mai karatu kawai','Delete team'=>'Goge ƙungiya','Delete this team and every design in its library?'=>'Cire wannan ƙungiyar da kowane zane a cikin littafinta na tsarinta?','This site joined the team library.'=>'Wannan shafin ya shiga ɗakin karatu na ƙungiyar.','This site uses the team library:'=>'Wannan shafin yana amfani da laburaren ƙungiyar:','Leave'=>'Fita','Join a team with an invite code'=>'Shiga cikin wata ƙungiya tare da lambar gayyata','Join'=>'Shiga','Your teams'=>'Kungiyoyinku','New team name'=>'Sabon sunan ƙungiya','Create team'=>'Ƙirƙiri ƙungiya','Creating team libraries comes with the Agency plan.'=>'Ana samun damar ƙirƙirar ɗakunan karatu na ƙungiya tare da tsarin Agency.','Save sections, pages and styles to your cloud library and reuse them on all your sites. Agencies can share a library with their team and clients. You can keep the library in Zinn Digital® storage or in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket.'=>'Ajiye sassa, shafuka da salon zuwa gajimaren ajiyar ku kuma ku sake amfani da su a duk shafukan ku. Hukumomi za su iya raba ɗakin karatu tare da tawagarsu da abokan ciniki. Kuna iya kiyaye ɗakin karatu a cikin ajiyar Zinn Digital® ko a cikin nata Cloudflare R2 ko guga mai jituwa da S3.','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro'=>'Sami Page Builder Sandwich Pro','Website kits'=>'Kayayyakin gidan yanar gizo','Cloud library'=>'Laburaren gajimare','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Wanda Neil Lock, Babban Jami\'in Gudanarwa na Zinn Digital® Ltd ya gina','Version %s'=>'Sigar %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Shafin Yanar Gizo na Page Builder Sandwich','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Shafin yanar gizo na Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'An adana saitunan.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Duba shirin Pro da farashinsa','Front-end output'=>'Fitowar gaban shafin','Class name prefix'=>'Ratabayon sunan Class','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kowane sunan aji da filogin ke bugawa akan shafukanku yana farawa da wannan gaba, ta yadda shafukan ba za su bayyana wane filogin ne ya gina su ba. Haruffa kanana ko lambobi 1 zuwa 8, wadanda suka fara da harafi.','Beta updates'=>'Sabuntawar Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Wannan shafin yana karɓar nau\'ikan beta azaman sabuntawa.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Wannan shafin yana karɓar ingantattun sassa kawai.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Canza wannan a shafin Asusu','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Ana bayar da nau\'ikan Beta ga shigarwar Pro da ke da lasisi waɗanda ke haɗa da asusun su. Da zarar an haɗa, zaku iya shiga daga shafin Asusun.','Breakpoints saved. Pages pick up the new widths on their next view.'=>'An adana wuraren tsayawa. Shafuka za su ɗauki sabbin faɗin a gaba na gaba da suka gani.','Breakpoints'=>'Abubuwan da aka tsara','Styles set for Tablet apply up to the tablet width, and styles set for Mobile up to the mobile width. Desktop styles apply everywhere else.'=>'Salon da aka saita don Tablet suna aiki har zuwa faɗin tablet, kuma salon da aka saita don Wayar hannu har zuwa faɗin wayar hannu. Salon kwamfuta yana aiki a duk sauran wurare.','Tablet: up to (px)'=>'Kantin kwamfuta: har zuwa (px)','Mobile: up to (px)'=>'Wayar hannju: har zuwa (px)','Save breakpoints'=>'Ajiye wuraren tsayawa','Use the default widths'=>'Yi amfani da faɗin tsoho-da-aka-sanya','Settings'=>'Saituna','Templates & kits'=>'Samfura da kayan aiki','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'An dakatar da juya wannan post din kafin a gama, don haka an tsallake post din. Buɗe shi don juya shi, ko kuma ka sake juya shi daga nan.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Babu wani ajiyar baya na wannan wallafe-wallafen da za a dawo da shi.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana abin da aka canza ba.','Unknown error.'=>'Kuskure wanda ba a sani ba.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Ba a bincika wani tsohon abun ciki ba tukuna.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Maido da tsohon abun ciki: %1$d na %2$d posts.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Canza tsohuwar abun ciki: %1$d na posts %2$d.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'An gama sauyawa: %1$d an dawo da su, %2$d sun gaza.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'Canjin ya kammala: %1$d an canza, %2$d ba su canza ba, %3$d sun gaza.','Legacy content'=>'Tsohon abun ciki','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'An canza shafukan da aka yi da tsofaffin sifofin Page Builder Sandwich zuwa blocks a bango. Ana yin madadin kowanne post a gaba, don haka ana iya mayar da kowanecanji zuwa yadda yake.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'Har yanzu post %d yana dauke da tsohon abun ciki.' . "\0" . 'Mawallafan %d har yanzu suna ɗauke da tsohon abun ciki.','%d post has a backup.'=>'Post %d yana da ajiyar baya.' . "\0" . '%d posts suna da madadin ajiyar bayanai.','%d post could not be handled'=>'Ba a iya sarrafa rubutu %d ba' . "\0" . 'Ba a iya sarrafa wallafe-wallafen %d ba','Post %d'=>'Rubutu na %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'An fara sauyawa. Yana ci gaba a bango; za ku iya barin wannan shafin.','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'Sake dawo da kowane gidan yanar gizon da aka maida zuwa tsohuwar sigarsa? Canje-canjen da aka yi wa waɗannan gidajen yanar gizon tun lokacin da aka maida su za su ɓace.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'An fara sauyawa. Yana ci gaba a bango; zaku iya barin wannan shafin.','Undo all conversions'=>'Soke duk juyawar','Item'=>'Abubuwa','Open when the page loads'=>'Buɗe lokacin da shafin ya loda','Title is a heading'=>'Takeken taken heading ne','Make the title a heading when the items are sections of the page, so visitors can jump between them.'=>'Sanya taken ya zama kanun labari idan abubuwan sassan shafin ne, ta yadda baƙi za su iya tsallaka tsakaninsu.','Heading %d'=>'Take %d','Question or section title'=>'Tambaya ko taken sashin','Accordion'=>'Fadakarwa','Only one item open at a time'=>'Abu ɗaya kawai a buɗe a lokaci ɗaya','Mark up as FAQ for search engines'=>'Yiwa alama a matsayin FAQ don injunan bincike','Adds FAQ structured data built from the titles (questions) and their text (answers).'=>'Yana ƙara bayanan tsarin FAQ da aka gina daga taken (tambayoyi) da rubutun su (amsoshi).','Alert'=>'Sanarwa','Information'=>'Bayani','Success'=>'Nasara','Warnings and errors are announced to screen reader users straight away; information and success notices are read when they finish what they are doing.'=>'Ana sanar da gargaɗi da kurakurai ga masu amfani da mai karanta allo nan take; ana karanta sanarwar bayani da nasara idan sun gama abin da suke yi.','Show icon'=>'Nuna alamar icon','Visitors can close it'=>'Masu ziyara za su iya rufe shi','Title (optional)'=>'Take (zaɓi)','Write the message…'=>'Rubuta sako...','Centre'=>'Tsakiya','Badge'=>'Lakabi','Colour'=>'Launi','Theme accent'=>'Launin jigo','Neutral'=>'Tsaka-tsaki','Position'=>'Matsayi','Label'=>'Alamar','Booking calendar'=>'Kalandar ajiyar wuri','Service'=>'Ayyuka','Booking page address'=>'Adireshin shafin ajiyar wuri','For example %s'=>'Misali kamar %s','What the calendar is for, read out by screen readers and shown under it.'=>'Abin da kalanda yake don, mai karanta allo yana karantawa kuma ana nuna shi a ƙarƙashinsa.','This is not a %s booking page address, so nothing will show on the page.'=>'Wannan ba adireshin shafin ajiyar %s ba ne, don haka babu abin da zai bayyana a shafin.','Preview the calendar'=>'Yi duban kalandar kafin bugawa','Link address'=>'Adireshin mahada','The button shows when it has both a label and an address.'=>'Maɓallin yana bayyana lokacin da yake da lakabi da adireshi duka biyu.','Open in a new tab'=>'Buɗe a cikin sabon shafin yanar gizo','Layout'=>'Tsari','Buttons below'=>'Maɓallai a ƙasa','Buttons beside the text'=>'Maɓallan da ke kusa da rubutun','Alignment'=>'Daidaita shafi','Main button'=>'Babban maballi','Second button'=>'Maɓallin na biyu','Heading…'=>'Taken...','One sentence on why…'=>'Sentensi guda daya kan dalilin da ya sa...','Second button (optional)'=>'Maɓall na biyu (ba dole ba ne)','Checklist'=>'Jerin abubuwan dubawa','Tick colour'=>'Launi na alamar dubawa','Lines'=>'Layi','Line %d'=>'Layi %d','Task…'=>'Aiki...','Add line'=>'Ƙara layin','Detect automatically'=>'Gano da kansa','No highlighting'=>'Babu haske','File name'=>'Sunan fayil','Shown above the code, for example functions.php.'=>'An nuna sama da lamba, misali functions.php.','Line numbers'=>'Lambar layi','Copy button'=>'Kwafin maɓalli','Wrap long lines'=>'Rufe dogayen layuka','Write or paste code…'=>'Rubuta ko liƙe lamba…','Text'=>'Rubutu','Columns'=>'Ginshiƙai','Highlight %s'=>'Haske %s','Add column'=>'Ƙara shafi','Rows'=>'Layuka','Row %d'=>'Layla %d','Add row'=>'Ƙara jere','Caption (what is being compared)'=>'Taken (abin da ake kwatantawa)','Cell type: %s. Change'=>'Nau\'in tantani: %s. Canza','Phone call'=>'Kiran waya','Text message'=>'Sakon rubutu','WhatsApp'=>'WhatsApp','Buttons'=>'Maɓallai','Phone number, with country code'=>'Lambar waya, tare da lambar ƙasa','Button text'=>'Rubutun maɓalli','Remove this button'=>'Cire wannan maballin','Add a button'=>'Ƙara maɓalli','WhatsApp message to start with (optional)'=>'Sako na WhatsApp don farawa (na zaɓi)','Contact buttons'=>'Maɓallان tuntuɓa','Add a phone number, an email address or a WhatsApp number in the sidebar.'=>'Ƙara lamba ta waya, adireshin imel ko lambar WhatsApp a gefen shafi.','Dual heading'=>'Biyu shugaba','Heading level'=>'Matakin taken rubutu','Use H1 once per page, for its main title.'=>'Yi amfani da H1 sau ɗaya a kowace shafi, don babban taken ta.','Second part look'=>'Kashi na biyu dubi','Accent colour'=>'Launin jaddadawa','Gradient'=>'Mai launi biyu','Outline'=>'Tsari','Underline'=>'Ƙara layin ƙasa','Second part on its own line'=>'Bangare na biyu a kan nasa layin','First part'=>'Sashe na farko','second part'=>'bangare na biyu','Marker pen'=>'Alamar alama','Thick underline'=>'Kewaye mai kauri','Background'=>'Bayan Fage','Highlight'=>'Hau da','Remove highlight'=>'Cire hasken','Drop cap'=>'Harafi mai girma','Large first letter'=>'Babban harafi na farko','For the first letter in a box, choose the "Drop cap in a box" style.'=>'Don harafi na farko a cikin akwati, zaɓi salon "Drop cap in a box".','Drop cap in a box'=>'Babban harafi a cikin akwati','Accent bar'=>'Sandar launi','Pull quote (accent bar)'=>'Sanarwa (mashigar launi)','A quote from the text, set large beside a coloured bar to draw the eye.'=>'Wani zance daga cikin rubutun, an sa shi da girma kusa da wani mashaya mai launi don jawo hankali.','quote'=>'magana','Feature list'=>'Jerin abubuwa masu muhimmanci','On phones the features always stack.'=>'A kan wayoyi, siffofin suna lodi a koda ya kasance.','Feature %d'=>'Siffa %d','Own icon'=>'Mallakar alama','Feature…'=>'Fasali...','Describe it…'=>'Bayyana shi...','Add feature'=>'Ƙara fasali','Install and activate Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms or Fluent Forms, then choose one of its forms here.'=>'Sanya kuma a kunna Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms ko kuma Fluent Forms, sannan ka zabi daya daga cikin fom din a nan.','Form plugin'=>'Fatar plugin','Choose a form…'=>'Zaɓi fom...','%s has no forms yet'=>'%s ba ta da fom ko daya yanzu','%s is not active on this site, so this form cannot be shown.'=>'%s ba ya aiki a wannan shafin, saboda haka ba za a iya nuna wannan fom ba.','The form list could not be loaded.'=>'Ba a iya loda jerin fom ɗin ba.','Form style'=>'Salon tsari','Fields'=>'Filaye','Outlined'=>'Wanda aka zana','Filled'=>'An cika','Underlined'=>'A ƙarƙashin layin','Button width'=>'Nisa mai maɓalli','Fit the text'=>'Daidaita rubutun','Full width'=>'Cikakken faɗi','Colours, fonts, spacing and corners come from your site design and this block’s design settings.'=>'Launi, da rubutu, da tazara, da kusurwoyi sun fito ne daga tsarin shafinka da kuma saitunan tsarin wannan bulon.','Show a form from your form plugin, styled to match your site.'=>'Nuna fom daga plugin ɗinka na fom, wanda aka tsara ya dace da shafinka.','Need a form plugin? Contact Form 7 is free.'=>'Kuna buƙatar plugin din fom? Contact Form 7 kyauta ne.','Glossary'=>'Glossari','Sort A to Z'=>'Tsara daga A zuwa Z','The page shows the terms in alphabetical order; here they stay in the order you wrote them.'=>'Shafin yana nuna sharuddan ne a jere bisa haruffan turanci; a nan suna kasancewa a jerin da kuka rubuta su.','Show an A–Z index'=>'Nuna fihirisa ta A–Z','Link terms used elsewhere on this page'=>'Haɗin sharuddan da aka yi amfani da su a wasu wurare a wannan shafin','The first time each term appears in the page text it links to its definition. Headings, buttons, code and existing links are left alone.'=>'Karon farko da kowace kalma ta bayyana a cikin shafin tana da alaƙa da ma\'anarta. Ana barin kan gaba, maballɓai, lambar lamba da hanyoyin haɗi da ke akwai yadda suke.','Terms'=>'Sharuɗɗa','Term %d'=>'Lokaci na %d','Term'=>'Lokaci','What it means…'=>'Abin da hakan ke nufī…','Add term'=>'Ƙara kalma','Icon list'=>'Jerin alamomi','One below the other'=>'Ɗaya a ƙasan ɗaya','Side by side'=>'A gefe da gefe','List item…'=>'Abun da ke cikin jerin…','Info box'=>'Akwatin bayani','Or choose any icon from the library:'=>'Ko zaɓi kowace alama daga ɗakin karatu:','Link text'=>'Rubutun haɗi','Say where the link goes ("See our prices"), not "Read more".'=>'Faɗi inda mahaɗin ke zuwa ("Dubi farashin mu"), ba "Karanta ƙari" ba.','A sentence or two…'=>'Jimla guda ko biyu…','section — a thematic section'=>'sashe — sashe mai jigo daya','div — no meaning'=>'div — babu ma\'ana','header — introductory content'=>'kan gaba — abubuwan gabatarwa','footer — closing content'=>'karshen shafi — abubuwan da ke rufe shafi','article — self-contained content'=>'labari — abubuwan da ke kunshe a ciki kawai','aside — related content'=>'gefe — abubuwan da suka shafi batun','main — the main content (once per page)'=>'main — babban abun ciki (sau ɗaya a kowane shafi)','nav — navigation links'=>'nav — hanyoyin zirga-zirga','Stack (flexbox, column)'=>'Tarin (flexbox, shafi)','Row (flexbox)'=>'Layuka (flexbox)','Grid'=>'Tarho','Editing: %s'=>'Gyara: %s','Lay out children as'=>'Yi tsara \'ya\'yan a matsayin','Inherited (%s)'=>'Wanda aka gado (%s)','Flexbox'=>'Flexbox','Stacked blocks'=>'Blolin da aka ɗora a kan juna','Drag in the canvas, or type'=>'Jawo a cikin zanen, ko buga','Content width'=>'Fadin abubuwa','Boxed (the theme’s content width)'=>'Boxed (nisa da faɗin abubuwan da ke cikin jigon)','Minimum height'=>'Mafi ƙarancin tsayi','HTML tag'=>'Alamar HTML','Make the whole block a link to'=>'Sanya gabaɗayan tubalin ya zama mahaɗi zuwa','Link text for screen readers'=>'Rubutun hanyar haɗi don masu karatun allo','What the link does, for visitors who cannot see the block.'=>'Abin da hanyar sadarwa ke yi, ga baƙi waɗanda ba za su iya ganin shingen ba.','Do not put links or buttons inside a linked block: a link inside a link does not work in browsers.'=>'Kada ku sanya hanyoyin yanar gizo ko maɓalli a cikin toshe mai alaƙa: hanyar yanar gizo a cikin hanyar yanar gizo ba ta aiki a cikin bincike.','Drag to resize these columns'=>'Jawo domin sake girman wadannan shika-shikai','Drag to resize this row'=>'Jawo domin sake girman wannan jere','Drag across cells to set how many columns and rows this block spans'=>'Ja over seluka don saita yawan shika-shika da jere da wannan bulakin yake rufewa','+ Column'=>'+ Shafuka','− Column'=>'− Shafi','+ Row'=>'+ Layla','− Row'=>'− Layla','Place'=>'Wuri','Paste coordinates or an OpenStreetMap link'=>'Liyaƙi ko kuma hanyar haɗi ta OpenStreetMap','On openstreetmap.org, find the place, then copy the address from the browser bar, or right-click the map and choose "Show address".'=>'A openstreetmap.org, nemo wuridin, sannan ka kwafi adireshin daga mashigar burusa, ko kuma danna-dama a kan taswirar sannan ka zaɓi "Nuna adireshin".','Latitude'=>'Latitude','Longitude'=>'Tsawon wuri','Zoom'=>'Girman Zaidewa','Name of the place'=>'Sunan wuri','Shown under the map and read out by screen readers.'=>'Ana nuna shi a ƙarƙashin taswira kuma masu karanta allo suna karanta shi.','Paste coordinates (for example 51.5074, -0.1278) or an OpenStreetMap link.'=>'Mana kawo ma\'ana (misali 51.5074, -0.1278) ko kuma hanyar haɗi ta OpenStreetMap.','Coordinates or link'=>'Hada-haɗa ko mahada','Preview the map'=>'Duba taswirar a gaba','Check %1$s, %2$s on OpenStreetMap'=>'Bincika %1$s, %2$s akan OpenStreetMap','Published date'=>'Ranar da aka wallafa','Updated date (when it differs)'=>'Ranar da aka sabunta (lokacin da ta bambanta)','Tags'=>'Alamomi','Reading time'=>'Lokacin karatu','Comment count'=>'Adadin sharhi','Details to show'=>'Bayanan da za a nuna','Choose at least one detail to show.'=>'Zaɓi aƙalla bayani ɗaya da za a nuna.','Progress bar'=>'Mashayar ci gaba','Maximum'=>'Mafi yawa','100 for a percentage; any other number for a count, such as 8 of 10.'=>'100 don kashi; kowane lamba don ƙidaya, kamar 8 daga cikin 10.','Show the percentage'=>'Nuna kashi dari','A password is set. Visitors see a password form instead of this content until they enter it.'=>'An sa kalmar sirri. Masu ziyara za su ga fam kin kalmar sirri maimakon wannan abun ciki har sai sun shigar da ita.','No password is set yet, so visitors see nothing here.'=>'Ba a saita kalmar sirri ba tukuna, don haka baƙi ba sa ganin komai a nan.','New password'=>'Sabon kalmar sirri','Set the password'=>'Saita kalmar sirri','Password set. Save the page to apply it; visitors who had unlocked it will need the new one.'=>'An saita kalmar sirri. A ajiyဲ shafin don amfani da ita; baƙi da suka buɗe shi za su buƙaci sabuwa.','If Page Builder Sandwich is ever switched off, this content is shown to everyone.'=>'Idan an kashe Page Builder Sandwich, ana nuna wannan abun ciki ga kowa.','Message above the password form (optional)'=>'Sako a sama da fom ɗin kalmar sirri (na zaɓi)','A/B test'=>'Jarrabawar A/B','Test name'=>'Sunan gwaji','Visitors who see version B (%)'=>'Baƙi waɗanda suka ga sigar B (%)','Goal (optional)'=>'Makasudi (na zaɓi)','A conversion is a click on a link or button, or a form sent, inside the version. To count a click elsewhere on the page instead, enter its CSS selector, for example #buy-now.'=>'Sauyawa shine danna mahada ko maballi, ko kuma aika fom, a cikin sigar. Don ƙidaya danna wani wuri a shafin maimakon haka, shigar da mai zaɓin CSS ɗinsa, alal misali #buy-now.','See the results'=>'Dubi sakamakon','An A/B test needs exactly two versions.'=>'Gwajin A/B yana buƙatar sigogi biyu daidai.','Button'=>'Maɓalli','Visit site'=>'Ziyarci shafin','Style'=>'Salo','Affiliate button'=>'Maɓallin abokin tarayya','Give the button its text and the offer’s address in the sidebar.'=>'Ba maɓallin da rubutunsa da kuma adireshin tayin a cikin mashigar gefe.','Age check'=>'Binciken shekaru','Put this block on every page that needs it, or in your header template part to cover the whole site.'=>'Sanya wannan tubalin a kowane shafi da ke buƙatar shi, ko kuma a cikin sashin samfurin kai (header) don rufe daukacin shafin yanar gizon.','Minimum age'=>'Mafi ƙarancin shekaru','Ask for'=>'Nemi don','A yes or no answer'=>'Amsar eh ko a\'a','The date of birth'=>'Ranar haihuwa','Remember the answer for (days)'=>'Ka tuna amsar na tsawon (days) kwanaki','Texts'=>'Rubututtu','Leave a text empty to use the standard one. {age} is replaced by the minimum age.'=>'Bar rubutu babu komai don amfani da wanda aka saba. Ana maye gurbin {age} da mafi ƙarancin shekaru.','Question'=>'Tambaya','When the visitor is too young'=>'Lokacin da baƙon ya yi ƙuruciya sosai','Countries'=>'Kasashe','A different minimum age for visitors from a country, or 0 to close the site to it. The country comes from your host or CDN (for example Cloudflare); where it is unknown, the minimum age above applies. A page cache must keep one copy per country for these rules to apply to cached pages.'=>'Wani ƙaramin shekaru daban na baƙi daga wata ƙasa, ko 0 don rufe rukunin yanar gizon ga ita. Ƙasar tana fitowa ne daga mai masaukin baki ko CDN (misali Cloudflare); inda ba a sani ba, ƙaramin shekarun da ke sama ya shafa. Dole ne ajiya ta wucin gadi ta shafi ta adana kwafi ɗaya a kowace ƙasa don waɗannan dokoki su yi aiki kan shafukan da aka adana.','Add a country'=>'Ƙara ƙasa','Country code (two letters)'=>'Lambar ƙasa (haruffa biyu)','For example US, GB, DE.'=>'Misali US, GB, DE.','Minimum age (0: closed)'=>'Karancin shekaru (0: a rufe)','Age gate'=>'Ƙofa mai shekaru','The age question shows here.'=>'Tambayar shekarun tana bayyana anan.','Changing words'=>'Canza kalmomi','Word'=>'Kalma','Add a word'=>'Ƙara kalma','Animated headline'=>'Kanun labarai mai motsi','Text before'=>'Rubutun da ke gaba','Text after'=>'Rubutun bayan','Effect'=>'Tasiri','Fade'=>'Fara dusashewa','Slide up'=>'Zame sama','Typing'=>'Rubutawa','Time per word (milliseconds)'=>'Lokaci a kowace kalma (millisekan)','Add the words that change in the block settings.'=>'Ƙara kalmomin da ke canzawa a cikin saitunan katanga.','Typewriter'=>'Typewriter','Words fade in'=>'Kalmomi suna bayyana a hankali','Words rise in'=>'Kalmomi suna tashi a','Plays once, when the text scrolls into view. Visitors who ask their device for less motion see the text still.'=>'Ana kunna sau ɗaya, lokacin da rubutun ya bayyana yayin gungurawa. Baƙi waɗanda suka buƙaci na\'urarsu ta rage motsi za su ga rubutun a tsaye.','Speed'=>'Gudun gudu','Slow'=>'Mai sannu a hankali','Normal'=>'Na yau da kullum','Fast'=>'Mai sauri','Write the text to animate…'=>'Rubuta rubutun da za a yi wa rai...','Audio player'=>'Na\'urar kunna sauti','Show or album name'=>'Sunan shiri ko kundin waƙoƙi','Replace artwork'=>'Maye gurbin zanen fasaha','Choose artwork'=>'Zaɓi zane','Add an episode'=>'Ƙara wani yanki','Choose audio file'=>'Zaɓi fayil ɗin sauti','Replace audio file'=>'Maye gurbin fayil ɗin sauti','or its address'=>'ko adireshinsa','Add episodes in the sidebar.'=>'Ƙara sassa a mashigar gefe.','Author box'=>'Akwatin marubuci','Picture size (pixels)'=>'Girman hoto (pixels)','Link to the author’s posts'=>'Haɗi zuwa rubutun marubucin','Link to their website'=>'Haɗa zuwa gidan yanar gizon su','Name as'=>'Saka suna kamar','Heading 2'=>'Take 2','Heading 3'=>'Kan 3','Heading 4'=>'Mataki na 4','Paragraph'=>'Aya','The author of the post shows here.'=>'Marubucin wallafar yana nunawa a nan.','Read out by screen readers, and shown when “Show label” is on.'=>'Masu karanta allon kwamfuta suna karanta shi, kuma ana nuna shi lokacin da “Nuna lakabi” yake a kunne.','Show label'=>'Nuna lakabi','Corner'=>'Kona','End (right in English)'=>'Karshe','Start (left in English)'=>'Fara (hagu cikin Turanci)','Appear after scrolling (pixels)'=>'Bayyana bayan an yi gungurawa (pixels)','Before: alternative text'=>'Kafin: madadin rubutu','Before: label'=>'Kafin: label','After: alternative text'=>'Bayan: madadin rubutu','After: label'=>'Bayan: label','Slider'=>'Maɓallin zamewa','Starting position (%)'=>'Matsayi na farko (%)','Before and after'=>'Kafin da bayan','Choose the two images in the block settings. Use images of the same size.'=>'Zabi hotuna biyu a cikin saitunan bango. Yi amفani da hotuna masu girma iri daya.','Start with the home page'=>'Fara daga shafin farko','Home page label'=>'Alamar shafin gida','Separator'=>'Mai raba layi','Chevron ›'=>'Chevron ›','Slash /'=>'Ska /','Arrow →'=>'Kibiya →','Dot ·'=>'Doti ·','End with the current page'=>'Gama da shafin yanzu','Structured data for search engines'=>'Bayanai masu tsari don injunan bincike','Adds BreadcrumbList data to the page. Turn it off if an SEO plugin already adds breadcrumb data.'=>'Yana ƙara bayanan BreadcrumbList a shafin. Kashe shi idan wani abin toshewa na SEO ya riga ya ƙara bayanan breadcrumb.','The path to the current page shows here. The home page has none.'=>'Hanyar zuwa shafin da ake ciki a yanzu tana bayyana a nan. Shafin farko bashi da shi.','Remove these hours on %s'=>'Cire waɗannan awanni a ranar %s','Add hours (for a break)'=>'Ƙara awanni (domin hutawa)','Copy Monday to Tuesday–Friday'=>'Kwafi daga Litinin zuwa Litinin–Juma\'a','Hours that end after midnight (18:00 to 02:00) belong to the day they start. Times are in the site’s time zone (Settings › General).'=>'Sa\'o\'in da suka ƙare bayan tsakiyar dare (18:00 zuwa 02:00) na cikin ranar da suka fara ne. Lokutan suna cikin yankin lokaci na shafin ne (Saituna › Janar).','Display'=>'Nuna','Empty: read out by screen readers only.'=>'Bace: masu karatun allo ne kawai ke karanta shi.','Say whether it is open now'=>'Faɗi ko a buɗe yake yanzu','Highlight today'=>'Haskaka na yau','Note under the hours'=>'Ba