ar.'=>'Zaɓi tsabar kuɗi a cikin mashigar gefe.','Cursor effect'=>'Sakamakon linzami kwamfuta','A ring follows the pointer'=>'Wani zobe yana bin alamar nuni','A soft spotlight'=>'Wuri mai haske mai laushi','A trail of dots'=>'Wani layin ɗigo-ɗigo','Where'=>'Inda','Over this section'=>'Aikin wannan sashi','Over the whole page'=>'A duk shafin','The real pointer always stays. The effect is off on touch screens and for visitors who ask their device for less motion.'=>'Manunin gaskiya koyaushe yana tsayawa. Tasirin a kashe yake a allon taɓawa da kuma ga baƙi waɗanda suka roƙi na\'urarsu ta yi motsi kaɗan.','Switch'=>'Canzawa','Number'=>'Lambar','That has no rows under its first line. The first line is used for the column names.'=>'Wannan ba shi da sauran layuka a ƙarƙashin layinsa na farko. Ana amfani da layin farko don sunayen ginshiƙai.','Import a CSV file'=>'Shigo da fayil ɗin CSV','Or paste CSV'=>'Ko a manna CSV','Comma, semicolon or tab separated. The first line holds the column names. Importing replaces the table.'=>'Raba da waƙafi, aminiya ko tab. Layin farko yana da sunayen shafi. Shigo da kaya yana maye gurbin teburin.','Import pasted CSV'=>'Shigo da CSV da aka manna','Says what the table shows. Screen readers announce it even when it is empty on screen.'=>'Yana cewa abin da teburin ke nuna. Masu karatun allo suna sanar da shi koda a lokacin da yake fanko a kan allo.','Visitors can sort by a column'=>'Masu ziyara za su iya tsarawa ta wani shafi','Show a search field'=>'Nuna fagen bincike','First column names each row'=>'Shafi\'in farko yana sanya suna ga kowane jeri','Sort “%s” as'=>'Raba “%s” azaman','Remove column'=>'Cire shafi','Import CSV'=>'Shigo da CSV','On a narrow screen'=>'A kan ƙaramin allo','Each row becomes a card'=>'Kowane jere yana zama katin','The table scrolls sideways'=>'Tebur ɗin yana gungurawa ta gefe','Striped rows'=>'Layuka masu ratsi-ratsi','Import a spreadsheet as CSV, paste one, or start with an empty table.'=>'Shigo da takardar lissafi a 