an shafin.','On phones'=>'A kan wayoyi','On phones and tablets'=>'A kan wayoyi da kwamfutar tafi-da-gidanka','Always'=>'Kullum','Never'=>'Ba a taɓa ba','Open submenus'=>'Buɗe ƙananan menu','When the arrow is clicked'=>'Lokacin da aka danna kibiyar','On hover, or when the arrow is clicked'=>'A lokacin da aka sanya linzami a kai, ko lokacin da aka danna kibiyar','Mega menus'=>'Manyan menu','A mega menu shows any blocks under a top-level item, instead of its submenu. Add a panel below the menu and choose its item.'=>'Babban menu yana nuna kowane tubali a ƙarƙashin abin da ke mataki na sama, a maimakon submenu nasa. Ƙara wani fanni a ƙarƙashin menu sannan zaɓi abin da ke ciki.','“%s” has a mega menu.'=>'“%s” yana da babban menu.','Add a mega menu panel'=>'Ƙara wani babban jeri na menu','Saved.'=>'An adana.','Mailchimp API key'=>'Maɓallin API na Mailchimp','A key ending in %s is saved for the whole site.'=>'An adana maɓalli mai ƙarewa a cikin %s don dukan shafin.','No key is saved yet: the form will not appear on the page until one is.'=>'Ba a adana wani maɓalli ba tukuna: fom ɗin ba zai bayyana a shafin ba har sai an adana ɗaya.','New key'=>'Sabon maɓalli','Save key'=>'Ajiye maɓalli','Remove key'=>'Cire madogara','Only an administrator can change it.'=>'Mai gudanarwa ne kawai zai iya canza shi.','Send signups to'=>'Aika rajista zuwa ga','List ID'=>'ID na Lissafi','MailPoet: the list number. Mailchimp: the audience ID. AWeber: the list name.'=>'MailPoet: lambar lissafin. Mailchimp: ID ɗin masu sauraro. AWeber: sunan lissafin.','Wording'=>'Kalmomi','Heading'=>'Taken kai','Consent box'=>'Akwatin amincewa','Visitors must tick it to subscribe. Say what they will receive.'=>'Dole baƙi su sanya alama don su yi rajista. Faɗi abin da za su karɓa.','Message after signing up'=>'Sako bayan rajista','Stacked'=>'Da ɗora waɗansu','Address and button on one line'=>'Adireshisho da maɓalli a kan layi ɗaya','Newsletter signup'=>'Ajiyar rajista don wasikar labarai','Choose the service and 