ngs.'=>'Ƙara wani shiri a cikin saitunan katanga.','Add to cart'=>'Ƙara a cikin kwando','SKU and categories'=>'SKU da rukunoni','Tabs'=>'Shafyuka','Related products'=>'Abubuwan da suka shafi wannan','Upsells'=>'Abubuwan da za a iya siya ƙari','Sale badge'=>'Alamar sayarwa','Stock'=>'Ajiye kaya','The product being viewed (or the loop’s)'=>'Samfurin da ake kallo (ko na madauki)','Which product'=>'Wane samfurin','Automatic (H1 on the product page)'=>'Ta atomatik (H1 a shafin samfur)','Product element'=>'Sashen samfur','Choose a product, or use this block in a product template or a product loop.'=>'Zaɓi wani samfur, ko kuma yi amfani da wannan tubalin a cikin samfurin samfur ko madaukin samfur.','Activate WooCommerce to show products.'=>'Kunna WooCommerce don nuna kayayyaki.','Out of'=>'Daga cikin','A percentage'=>'Kashi dari','The value out of the total'=>'Darajar daga cikin jimlar','Ring'=>'Sauti','Thickness'=>'Kauri','Thin'=>'Maraƙi','Thick'=>'Mai kauri','Label (optional)'=>'Lakabi (na zaɓi)','Promo bar'=>'Mashayar talla','Top, stays in view'=>'Sama, yana nan a gani','Bottom of the screen'=>'Kasan allo','Where it is placed'=>'Inda aka sanya shi','Colours'=>'Launi','Accent'=>'Harshe','Write the announcement in the block settings.'=>'Rubuta sanarwar a cikin saitunan bango.','One per line'=>'Ɗaya a kowane layi','Headings'=>'Rubutattun batutuwa','Add the pros and cons in the sidebar, one per line.'=>'Ƙara fa\'idodi da rashin fa\'idodi a cikin sandar gefe, ɗaya a kowane layi.','Search box'=>'Akwatin bincike','Category, tag or taxonomy'=>'Kashi, alama ko rarrabuwa','Sort order'=>'Tsarin jeri','Price range'=>'Wurin farashi','On sale'=>'Ana sayarwa','In stock'=>'Akwai aajiya','Taxonomy'=>'Rabe-rabe','Field key'=>'Maɓallin fage','Shown as'=>'An nuna a matsayin','Checkboxes'=>'Akwatunan Zaɓe','Radio buttons'=>'Maɓallin rediyo','Remove filter'=>'Cire tacewa','Add a filter'=>'Ƙara tacewa','Page order'=>'Tsarin shafi','Most comments'=>'Sharhi mafi yawa','Random'=>'Ba a tsara ba',