n farko.' . "\0" . 'Zana katin: abubuwa %d suna daidaita a shafi na farko.','Optional, for example “Reading time:”.'=>'Na zaɓi, alal misali “Lokacin karatu:”.','Format'=>'Tsara fasali','5 minutes read'=>'Mintuna 5 na karatu','5 min read'=>'Mintoci 5 na karatu','Reading speed (words a minute)'=>'Saurin karatu (kalmomi a minti daya)','How long the post takes to read shows here.'=>'Yadda tsawon lokacin da za a dauka don karanta wallafar yana nuna a nan.','Score'=>'Maki','Overall score'=>'Jimlar maki','Verdict'=>'Hukunci','Criteria'=>'Ka\'idoji','Add a criterion'=>'Ƙara ma\'auni','Criterion'=>'Ma\'auni','Set the score in the sidebar.'=>'Saita maki a cikin mashigin gefe.','Reviews'=>'Bita','Google and Trustpilot'=>'Google da Trustpilot','Lowest rating shown'=>'An nuna ƙimar da ta fi ƙasa','Only 5-star reviews.'=>'Sharhin tauraro 5 kawai.','Reviews below this are not shown.'=>'Ba a nuna bituttuka da ke ƙasa da wannan.','Newest first'=>'Wadanda suka fi sabunta a farko','Best first'=>'Mafi kyau farko','Show the date'=>'Nuna kwanan wata','Show the overall rating under them'=>'Nuna jimillar ƙimar da ke ƙarƙashinsu','Google and Trustpilot details (Site design › Reviews)'=>'Bayanan Google da Trustpilot (Tsarin shafi › Bita)','A grid of cards'=>'Wani grid na katuna','A slider'=>'Wani nunfashi','A badge: the overall rating'=>'Wani alama: jimillar ƙimar','Notice'=>'Sanarwa','Help link'=>'Hanyar haɗi ta taimako','Show the age badge'=>'Nuna alamar shekaru','Link the national help service'=>'Haɗa sabis na taimako na ƙasa','For visitors from the UK, the US, Australia, Germany, France and Sweden, link that country’s help service. Check them against your licence, and add other countries below.'=>'Ga baƙi daga Birtaniya, US, Ostiriliya, Jamus, Faransa da Sweden, haɗa sabis na taimako na wannan ƙasar. Duba su da lasisin ku, kuma ku ƙara wasu ƙasashe a ƙasa.','Responsible gambling notice'=>'Sanarwar yin caca daidai','The notice shows here.'=>'Sanarwar tana nunawa a nan.','For example “Q3 2026” or “Spring”.'=>'Misali “Q3 2026” ko “Spring”.','A board: planned, in progress, done'=>'Wani allo: an tsara, yana ci gaba, an gama','One list, each item with its status'=>'Jeriri daya, kowanne abu da matsayinsa','Column heading level'=>'Matsayi na shafi','Add the first item in the sidebar.'=>'Ƙara abu na farko a cikin mashigar gefe.','Hidden labels are still read out by screen readers.'=>'Ana ci gaba da karanta ɓoyayyun lakabi ta hanyar masu karanta allo.','Icon instead of button text'=>'Alamar maimakon rubutun maɓalli','Search in'=>'Bincika a cikin','The whole website'=>'Dukan gidan yanar gizon','Device share menu'=>'Menu raba na\'ura','Share to'=>'Raba zuwa','Share bar'=>'Ma\'ajiyar rabawa','For example "Share". Left empty, no label is shown.'=>'Misali "Raba". Idan aka bar shi babu komai, ba a nuna lakabi ba.','Floating at the side (wide screens)'=>'Mai iyo a gefe (nunfadi masu fadi)','The buttons appear once the page has an address (save it as a draft).'=>'Maɓallan za su bayyana da zaran shafin yana da adireshin (a ajiyhe shi a matsayin zane).','Networks'=>'Cibiyoyin Sadarwa','Device share button'=>'Maɓallin raba na\'ura','Phones and some browsers offer their own share sheet; the button appears only where one exists.'=>'Wayoyin hannu da wasu burauzoci suna ba da takardar rabawa ta su; maɓallin yana bayyana ne kawai inda akwai shi.','Look'=>'Duba','Show network names'=>'Nuna sunayen cibiyar sadarwa','Shape'=>'Siffanta','Rounded'=>'Zagakke','Circle'=>'Da\'ira','Square'=>'Murabba\'i','Edit images (%d)'=>'Gyara hotuna (%d)','Choose images'=>'Zaɓi hotuna','Content type'=>'Nau\'in abun ciki','Only these categories'=>'Waɗannan nau\'ikan kaɗai','None chosen: every category.'=>'Babu wanda aka zaɓa: kowane nau\'i.','Oldest first'=>'Wanda ya fi tsufa a gaba','Title, A to Z'=>'Taken, D zu Z','Recently updated'=>'An sabunta kwanan nan','Custom order'=>'Keɓaɓɓen umarni','Summary'=>'Takaitawa','Price (products)'=>'Farashi (kayayyaki)','Card'=>'Katin cire kudi','Previous and next buttons'=>'Maɓallokan baya da gaba','Start again after the last'=>'Sake farawa bayan na ƙarshe','Play automatically'=>'Yi wasa ta atomatik','Never for visitors who prefer less motion; pauses on hover and focus, and has a Stop button.'=>'Ba a taɓa amfani da shi ba ga baƙin da suka fi son motsi kaɗan; yana tsayawa lokacin da aka sanya linzamin kwamfuta a kai ko aka mai da hankali kan shi, kuma yana da maɓallin Tsayawa.','Seconds per slide'=>'Daƙiƙa a kowane faifai','Move up'=>'Matsar sama','Move down'=>'Matsar da kasa','Remove column %s'=>'Cire shafi %s','The first line holds the column names. Importing replaces what is here.'=>'Layin farko yana dauke da sunayen shika-shikan ginshiƙai. Shigo da bayanai zai maye gurbin abin da ke nan.','Remove image'=>'Cire hoton','%1$s %2$d'=>'%1$s %2$d','Pick the level that fits the outline of the page.'=>'Zaɓi matakin da ya dace da tsarin shafin.','Replace photo'=>'Maye gurbin hoto','Move %s up'=>'Matsar %s sama','Move %s down'=>'Matsar da %s kasa','Duplicate %s'=>'Kwafi %s','Remove %s'=>'Cire %s','Rating (0 to 5)'=>'Matsayi (0 zuwa 5)','Highlights, one per line'=>'Abubuwan da suka fi fice, daya a kowane layi','Optional, for example “Top pick”.'=>'Zabi ne, misali "Mafi so".','Terms (shown with the offer)'=>'Sharuɗɗa (da aka nuna tare da tayin)','The key terms your licence requires next to the offer, for example the wagering requirement.'=>'Muhimman sharuddan da lasisin ku ke buƙata kusa da tayin, alal misali sharadin caca.','Replace logo'=>'Maye gurbin tambari','Choose logo'=>'Zabi tambari','Remove logo'=>'Cire tambari','Give the short link a name, and the offer a full address starting with https://.'=>'Ba da gajeren hanyar haɗi suna, da kuma tayin cikakken adireshin da ya fara da https://.','The short link could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana gajeren mahadar ba.','Offer address'=>'Adireshin tallace-tallace','Your affiliate link. Links to offers are always marked as sponsored for search engines.'=>'Hadin gwiwar ku na abokai (affiliate link). Ana nuna hanyoyin haɗi zuwa ga tayi a matsayin wadanda aka dauki nauyin su a injunan bincike koyaushe.','Go through a short link'=>'Bi ta ɗan gajeren mahaɗi','Visitors see a short address on your site, and every click is counted in Short links.'=>'Masu ziyara suna ganin ɗan gajeren adireshin a shafin ku, kuma ana ƙidaya kowane dannawa a cikin Gajerun hanyoyin haɗi.','Visitors will see %s'=>'Masu ziyara za su ga %s','Or make a new one, named'=>'Ko a ƙirƙiri sabo, mai suna','spin-palace'=>'spin-palace','Create short link from the address'=>'Ƙirƙiri gajeren hanyar haɗi daga adireshin','The page’s own content (block or classic cart and checkout)'=>'Abubuwan da ke cikin shafin da kansa (buloka ko tsohon keken siyayya da wurin biyan kuɗi)','Cart (classic)'=>'Kelu (na gargajiya)','Checkout (classic)'=>'Biya (na gargajiya)','Order received details'=>'Bayanan karɓar oda','Shop page'=>'Shafin shago','Height before the button'=>'Tsawon kafin maɓallin','Button text when open'=>'Maɓallin rubutu lokacin budewa','Sticky'=>'Mai mannewa','Stays at the top of the screen while visitors scroll.'=>'Yana nan a saman allo yayin da baƙi ke gungurawa.','Transparent'=>'Mai gani ta ciki','Lies over the first section of the page, and takes the site’s background colour once the page scrolls. Give the first section enough space at the top.'=>'Yana kwance a saman sashe na farko na shafin, kuma yana ɗaukar launi na asali na shafin da zarar shafin ya yi gungurawa. Ka ba sashe na farko isasshen sarari a sama.','Slides come from'=>'Hotunan nunawa sun fito daga','Blocks I add'=>'Bulolin da na ƙara','Posts'=>'Rubutattun Sako','Products (WooCommerce)'=>'Kayayyaki (WooCommerce)','Slide'=>'Zazzage','Ken Burns (slow zoom, images)'=>'Ken Burns (mafi ƙarancin girma sannu a hankali, hotuna)','Slides in view: desktop'=>'Slide a gani: kwamfuta ta tebur','Slides in view: tablet'=>'Faifan faifai da ake gani: kwamfutar hannu','Slides in view: phone'=>'Nunnutsu a kan allo: wayar salula','What the slides are, for example "Customer stories".'=>'Abubuwan da ke cikin faifan hoto suke, alal misali "Labaran abokan ciniki".','Image slider'=>'Hoton mai zamewa','Images from the media library, one after another.'=>'Hotuna daga ɗakin karatu na kafofin watsa labarai, ɗaya bayan ɗaya.','Post slider'=>'Bayanin gundarin hotuna','Product slider'=>'Fifikaffen samfurin','WooCommerce products as a carousel.'=>'Kayayyakin WooCommerce azaman carousel.','Ken Burns slideshow'=>'Nunushin Ken Burns','Full-width images with a slow zoom, fading from one to the next.'=>'Hotunan faɗin fuska tare da jinkirin zuƙowa, masu shuɗewa daga ɗaya zuwa na gaba.','Recent sales notices — example, shown only in the editor'=>'Sanarwar tallace-tallace na baya-bayan nan — misali, ana nuna shi a cikin edita kawai','First name from Town bought Product'=>'Sunan farko daga Town ya sayi Product','2 hours ago'=>'A sa\'o\'i 2 da suka wuce','Orders'=>'Umarni','Orders from'=>'Orders daga','WooCommerce and Easy Digital Downloads'=>'WooCommerce da Easy Digital Downloads','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Easy Digital Downloads'=>'Easy Digital Downloads','Most recent orders to show'=>'Umarnin da suka fi kusa da na baya da za a nuna','Oldest order (days)'=>'Tsohuwar oda (kwanaki)','Name the product'=>'Sanya wa samfurin suna','Say how long ago'=>'Ka ce tun ya yaushe','Timing and place'=>'Lokaci da wuri','Each notice shows for (seconds)'=>'Kowane sanarwa tana nuna na (seconds)','Pause between notices (seconds)'=>'Dakata tsakanin sanarwa (sakanni)','Bottom, reading start'=>'Kasa, karatu ya fara','Bottom, reading end'=>'Kasa, ƙarshen karatu','Where the notices come from'=>'Inda sanarwar ta fito','Only real, paid orders are shown, and only when the buyer ticked the box at checkout that lets this site show their first name and town. Once this page is saved, the checkout offers that box. Until an order with it arrives, visitors see nothing.'=>'An nuna ainihin umarni kawai da aka biya, kuma a lokacin da mai siye ya danna akwatin dake wurin biyan kudi wanda ke barin wannan shafin ya nuna sunansa na farko da garinsa. Da zarar an adana wannan shafin, bayar da umarni zai ba da wannan akwatin. Har sai wani umarni da shi ya zo, baƙi ba sa ganin komai.','Find the coordinates from the address'=>'Nemo daga ko\'odinati daga adireshi','Found. Check the pin on the map on the page.'=>'An gano shi. Duba maballin a kan taswira a shafin.','No match. Try the street, town and postcode, or type the coordinates.'=>'Babu abin da ya dace. Gwada titin, garin da lambar tura sako, ko ka rubuta koordinet din.','OpenStreetMap did not answer. Try again in a minute, or type the coordinates.'=>'OpenStreetMap ba ta amsa ba. Da fatan za a sake gwada bayan minti ɗaya, ko kuma ku rubuta tsaitai (coordinates).','Sends the address to OpenStreetMap (Nominatim) and fills in the latitude and longitude.'=>'Yana aika da adireshin zuwa OpenStreetMap (Nominatim) kuma ya cika latitude da longitude.','Locations'=>'Wurare','Add a location'=>'Ƙara wuri','Search and “Nearest to me”'=>'Bincike da kuma “Mafi kusa da ni”','Offer a map'=>'Bayar da taswira','Visitors press “Show the map” first: nothing loads from OpenStreetMap until they do.'=>'Masu ziyara suna danna "Nuna taswirar" da farko: babu abin da ke lodi daga OpenStreetMap har sai sun yi hakan.','Map zoom (0 = fit every location)'=>'Girman taswira (0 = duba duk wuraren)','Add the first location in the sidebar.'=>'Ƙara wuri na farko a cikin mashigar gefe.','Pane'=>'Sashe','Name on the switch'=>'Sunana a kan sauyawa','Person'=>'Mutum','Short bio'=>'Takaitaccen tarihin rayuwa','Photo'=>'Hotuna','Photo: alternative text'=>'Hotuna: rubutun madadin','Leave empty when the photo only repeats the name.'=>'Bar a banza lokacin da hoton ya sake maimaita suna kawai.','Profile links'=>'Hadin gwiwar bayanan martaba','Add a link'=>'Ƙara mahaɗi','Network'=>'Sadarwa','LinkedIn'=>'LinkedIn','X'=>'X','Facebook'=>'Facebook','Instagram'=>'Instagram','GitHub'=>'GitHub','YouTube'=>'YouTube','Mastodon'=>'Mastodon','Bluesky'=>'Bluesky','Add a person in the block settings.'=>'Ƙara mutum a cikin saitunan katanga.','Event'=>'Abin da ya faru','Add an event in the block settings.'=>'Ƙara wani taron a cikin saitunan bulok.','Badges'=>'Takardun shaida','Add a badge'=>'Ƙara alama','Trust badges'=>'Alamomin amana','Row'=>'Jergi','Add a badge in the block settings.'=>'Ƙara wani tambari a cikin saitunan bango.','Videos'=>'Bidiyo','Add a video'=>'Ƙara bidiyo','Video address (YouTube, Vimeo or a file)'=>'Adreshin bidiyo (YouTube, Vimeo ko fayil)','Poster image (optional)'=>'Hoton fosta (idan anso)','Replace poster'=>'Maye gurbin fastoci','Add videos in the sidebar.'=>'Sanya bidiyo a cikin sandar gefe.','Name of the list'=>'Sunan jerin','Web address or text'=>'Adireshin yanar gizo ko rubutu','QR code'=>'Lambar QR','Description for screen readers'=>'Bayani don masu karanta allo','Leave empty to use "QR code for" and the text.'=>'Bar a bansa don amfani da "QR code for" da rubutun.','Type a web address, a phone link (tel:) or any text.'=>'Rubuta adireshi na yanar gizo, hanyar sadarwa ta waya (tel:) ko duk wani rubutu.','This is too long for a QR code. Shorten it.'=>'Wannan ya yi tsawo sosai don lambar QR. Taka shi.','Add a caption'=>'Ƙara bayani','Reading progress bar'=>'Mashaya ta ci gaban karatu','Edge of the window'=>'Gaban taga','Top'=>'Na sama','Bottom'=>'Ƙasa','Shown along the bottom of the window as visitors scroll.'=>'Ana nuna shi a saman ƙasan taga yayin da baƙi ke gungurawa.','Shown along the top of the window as visitors scroll.'=>'Ana nuna su a saman taga yayin da baƙi ke gungurawa.','Related by'=>'Daga zuwa ga','Categories or tags'=>'Nau\'uka ko alamomi','When nothing is related, show the newest instead'=>'Lokacin da babu abin da ke da alaƙa, nuna sababbi maimakon haka','Leave empty for "Related posts".'=>'Bar shi a banza don "Labarai masu alaƙa".','Show the featured image'=>'Nuna hoton da aka fi nuna','Show a summary'=>'Nuna taƙaitaccen bayani','No posts share this post’s categories or tags yet. When some do, they show here.'=>'Babu wasu wallafe-wallafen da suka raba rukuni ko alamomin wannan wallafar tukuna. Idan wasu sun yi hakan, za su nuna a nan.','Modal'=>'Hotuna mai tashi','Off-canvas panel'=>'Allon gefe mai fitowa','Slides in from'=>'Ya zo daga gefe daga','Start is the side where reading begins: the left in English, the right in Arabic.'=>'Farko shine gefen da karatun ke farawa: hagu a Turanci, dama a Larabci.','Close when the page behind is clicked'=>'Rufe lokacin da aka danna shafin da ke baya','Title of the window'=>'Sunan taga','Check mark'=>'Alamar bincike','Cross'=>'Tsallaka','Dot'=>'Digi','Arrow'=>'Kibiya','Star'=>'Tauraro','Icon colour'=>'Launin gunkin','Same as the text'=>'Kamar da rubutun','Theme primary'=>'Jigon jigo','Theme secondary'=>'Jigon na biyu','Theme contrast'=>'Bambancin jigo','Keep headings in order down the page: a heading one level below the section it sits in.'=>'Ajiye taken magana a cikin tsari a kan shafin: taken da ke mataki daya a kasa da sashin da yake ciki.','Choose icon'=>'Zaɓi gunkin','Use the default icon'=>'Yi amfani da gunkin tsoho','Choose an icon'=>'Zaɓi gunkin','Show a heading for each type'=>'Nuna taken kowane nau\'i','Nothing published yet in the types you chose.'=>'Babu abin da aka buga a cikin nau\'ikan da ka zaɓa.','Links'=>'Hanyoyin haɗi','Link %d'=>'Mahada %d','A profile address, mailto:you@example.com or tel:+441234567890.'=>'Adireshin bayanan martaba, mailto:you@example.com ko tel:+441234567890.','Name read to screen readers'=>'Sunan da aka karanta ga masu amfani da na\'urar karanta allo','Other icon'=>'Wani hoton alama','Add link'=>'Ƙara mahada','Icon only'=>'Hoton kadai','Rounded square'=>'Filayen kusurwa zagaye','Open profiles in a new tab'=>'Buɗe bayanan martaba a cikin sabon shafin yanar gizo','Star rating'=>'Matsayin taurari','Number of stars'=>'Adadin taurari','Show the number'=>'Nuna lambar','Down the page'=>'Ƙasa da shafi','Side by side (stacks on phones)'=>'Gefe da gefe (suna lodi a kan wayoyi)','Number colour'=>'Launi na lamba','Order of the steps'=>'Tsarin matakan','Step %d'=>'Mataki na %d','Step…'=>'Mataki…','What to do…'=>'Abin da za a yi…','Add step'=>'Ƙara mataki','Tab'=>'Shafi','Add headings to the page and they will be listed here.'=>'Ƙara manyan batutuwa a shafin kuma za a lissafa su anan.','Table of contents'=>'Kundin abubuwa','From heading level'=>'Daga matakin take','To heading level'=>'Zuwa matakin shugabanci','Numbered'=>'Mai lamba','Can be collapsed'=>'Ana iya taƙaitawa','Start collapsed'=>'Fara a lumshe','Highlight the section being read'=>'Sanya haske a kan sashin da ake karantawa','Optional. Says what the tabs are about, for example "Plans".'=>'Na zaɓi. Yana bayyana abin da shafukan suka ƙunshi, alal misali "Tsare-tsare".','Open on page load'=>'Bude lokacin da shafi ya ɗora','Tabs down the side'=>'Shafuka a gefe','Add a tab'=>'Ƙara shafinuku','Testimonial'=>'Shaida','Choose photo'=>'Zaɓi hoto','Remove photo'=>'Cire hoto','Photo description'=>'Bayanin hoto','Leave empty when the photo only shows the person named next to it.'=>'Bar shi a bude idan hoton ya nuna mutumin da aka ambata a kusa da shi kawai.','Star rating (0 = none)'=>'Matsayin taurari (0 = babu)','Name under the quote'=>'Sunan da ke ƙarƙashin zance','Photo beside the quote'=>'Hoto a kusa da ambato','What the customer said…'=>'Abin da abokin ciniki ya ce…','Role or company'=>'Matsayi ko kamfani','Tooltip'=>'Bayanin taimako','Tooltip text'=>'Rubutun bayani','Keep it short: one or two sentences. Screen readers read it with the word it explains.'=>'Ka ajiye shi a taƙaice: sentensi ɗaya ko biyu. Masu karatun allo suna karanta shi tare da kalmar da yake bayani akanta.','Show it'=>'Nuna shi','Above'=>'Sama','Below'=>'A ƙasa','Word or phrase'=>'Kalma ko jumlõka','Profile'=>'Bayanin mai amfani','Whose profile'=>'Wane ne bayanin martaba','The post’s author'=>'Marubucin labarin','Show the profile picture'=>'Nuna hoton bayanin martaba','Show the biography'=>'Nuna tarihin rayuwa','Show links to posts and website'=>'Nuna hanyoyin haɗi zuwa wallafe-wallafe da gidan yanar gizo','Author profile'=>'Bayanin marubuci','Choose whose profile to show.'=>'Zabi wane bayanin martaba za a nuna.','WhatsApp number, with country code'=>'Lambar WhatsApp, tare da lambar ƙasa','For example +44 7700 900123.'=>'Misali +44 7700 900123.','Message to start with (optional)'=>'Sako don farawa (na zaɓi)','Show the text next to the icon'=>'Nuna rubutun kusa da gunkin','Bottom end (right in English)'=>'Ƙarshen ƙasa (dama a Turanci)','Bottom start (left in English)'=>'Kasan hagu (hagu a Turanci)','Add your WhatsApp number in the sidebar. Until then the button is not shown on the page.'=>'Ƙara lamba ta WhatsApp a gefen shafi. Har zuwa lokacin ba a nuna maɓallin a shafin ba.','On the page, this button floats in a bottom corner of the screen.'=>'A kan shafin, wannan maballin yana shawagi a kusurwar ƙasa ta allo.','Saved to your cloud library.'=>'An adana a cikin ɗakin karatu na girgije.','Save to cloud library'=>'Ajiye a cikin ɗakin karatu na girgije','Save to'=>'Ajiye zuwa','Images are resized, stored once and brought back into the media library of any site that inserts this design.'=>'Ana sake girman hotuna, a adana su sau ɗaya sannan a dawo da su cikin ɗakin karatu na kafofin watsa labarai na kowane shafin da ya saka wannan zane.','%s style'=>'Salogin %s','Save style to cloud library'=>'Ajiye salon zuwa ɗakin karatu na gajimare','Select a block first, then apply the style.'=>'Zaɓi tubali da farko, sannan ka yi amfani da salo.','Library'=>'Laburare','Save this page to the library'=>'Ajiye wannan shafi a cikin ɗakin karatu','Insert'=>'Saka','Shortcode tag'=>'Lambar gajeren lokaci','Use letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Yi amfani da haruffa, lamba, da alamomin gajeren layi da na karkashin layi kawai.','Attribute name'=>'Sunan sifa','Add attribute'=>'Ƙara siffa','Shortcode'=>'Gajeriyar lamba','Other attributes'=>'Sauran siffofi','Choose a shortcode tag in the block settings.'=>'Zaɓi alamar gajeren lamba (shortcode) a cikin saitunan bazuwar.','Image size'=>'Girman hoto','Thumbnail'=>'Hoton ƙarami','Full size'=>'Cikakken girma','Link to'=>'Haɗa zuwa','Attachment page'=>'Shafin abin da aka makala','Media file'=>'Fayil na kafofin watsa labarai','Audio'=>'Sauti','Video'=>'Bidiyo','File address'=>'Adireshin fayil','Poster image'=>'Hoton bango','Media IDs, separated by commas'=>'An ID din kafofin watsa labarai, waɗanda aka raba su da alamun comma','Show the track list'=>'Nuna jerin waƙoƙi','Embed'=>'Shiga da shi','Address to embed'=>'Adireshin da za a saka','Maximum width'=>'Mafi girman fadi','Image and caption HTML'=>'Hoton HTML da taken sa','Tip: the Form block shows this form styled to match your site.'=>'Shawara: Sashin Form yana nuna wannan fom ɗin an yi masa ado ya yi daidai da shafin ku.','Show the form title'=>'Nuna sunan fom din','Show the form description'=>'Nuna bayanin fom din','Submit without reloading the page'=>'Mika ba tare da sake loda shafin ba','The "%s" control from the old editor is not available in the block editor. Enter the value as text.'=>'Ba a samun ikon "%s" daga tsohon edita a cikin editan tubali ba. Shigar da ƙimar a matsayin rubutu.','Choose file'=>'Zaɓi fayil','— Default —'=>'— Na asali —','Advanced styling'=>'Tsara salo na gaba','Inline CSS'=>'Inline CSS','CSS declarations, for example: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333'=>'Sanarwar CSS, alal misali: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333','Effects (legacy classes)'=>'Tasiri (tsofaffin aji)','Space-separated effect names carried over from older versions, for example: hover-shadow'=>'Sunayen tasiri masu rarrabuwa da sarari da aka kawo daga tsofaffin sigogi, alal misali: hover-shadow','Full width, content kept in the middle'=>'Cikakken faɗi, an ajiye abubuwa a tsakiya','Link relationship'=>'Alakar mahada','Left'=>'Hagu','Right'=>'Dama','Add text…'=>'Ƙara rubutu…','Placement'=>'Matsayi','On its own line'=>'A kan nasa layin','In the line, beside other content'=>'A cikin layin, kusa da sauran abun ciki','Automatic (own line at the top level of the page)'=>'Atomatik (kan layi na kansa a babban matakin shafin)','Accessible label'=>'Alamar samuwa','Leave empty for a decorative icon.'=>'Bar a banza domin gunkin ado.','Choose an icon in the block settings.'=>'Zabi wani gunkin a cikin saitunan shingen.','New setting name'=>'Sabon sunan saitin','For example: title or text'=>'Misali: taken ko rubutu','Add setting'=>'Ƙara saitin','Widget'=>'Widget','Choose a widget'=>'Zaɓi widget','Widget area'=>'Yankin widget','Choose a widget area'=>'Zabi yankin widget','This image has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Choose it from the Media Library, or set its width and height.'=>'Wannan hoton bazu da faɗi da tsayi ba, saboda haka shafin zai yi tsalle lokacin da ya loda. Zaɓi shi daga Laburare na Media, ko saita faɗinsa da tsayinsa.','This video is not from the Media Library, so its size is unknown and the page will jump when it loads. Upload it to the Media Library instead.'=>'Wannan bidiyon ba ya fitowa daga ɗakin karatu na Media, saboda haka girmansa ba a sani ba kuma shafin zai yi tsalle lokacin da ya โหลด. Maimakon haka, loda shi zuwa ɗakin karatu na Media.','An image, video or frame in this HTML has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Add width and height attributes to it.'=>'Wani hoto ko bidiyo ko firam a cikin wannan HTML ba shi da faɗi da tsayi, don haka shafin zai yi tsalle lokacin da ya loda. Ƙara siffofin faɗi da tsayi a gare shi.','This embed resizes itself after it loads, which moves the content below it. Give it room or place it lower on the page.'=>'Wannan shigarwar tana sake girman kanta bayan ta loda, wanda ke motsa abubuwan da ke ƙasanta. Ba shi wuri ko sanya shi a ƙasa a shafin.','Layout shift'=>'Sauye-sauyen tsari','This widget does not describe its settings, so they are edited as name and value pairs.'=>'Wannan widget ɗin baya bayyana saitunansa ba, don haka ana gyara su a matsayin nau\'ikan suna da ƙima.','Problem'=>'Matsala','Check'=>'Bincika','Show block'=>'Nuna shafi','Use a readable theme colour'=>'Yi amfani da launin jigo mai sauƙin karatu','Make it H%d'=>'Sanya shi ya zama H%d','Alt text'=>'Rubutun madadin','Save alt text'=>'Ajiye rubutun alt','This image is decorative'=>'Wannan hoton na ado ne','Checking…'=>'Ana dubawa...','No accessibility problems found on this page.'=>'Ba a sami matsalar samun dama a kan wannan shafi ba.','%1$s, %2$s.'=>'%1$s, %2$s.','%d problem'=>'matsala %d' . "\0" . 'Matsala %d','%d thing to check'=>'abun da za a duba %d' . "\0" . 'Abubuwa %d da za a duba','Check again'=>'Sake dubawa','An automatic check finds many problems but not all of them. Also try the page with the keyboard alone and with a screen reader.'=>'Wani bincike mai zuwa da kansa yana samun matsala da yawa amma ba duka ba. Har ila yau, gwada shafin tare da madannin kwamfuta kawai da kuma mai karatun allo.','Text contrast is %1$s:1; it needs at least %2$s:1 to be readable.'=>'Bambancin launi na rubutu shine %1$s:1; yana buƙatar aƙalla %2$s:1 don ya zama mai karantawa.','click here,here,read more,more,link,this link,learn more,go'=>'danna nan,anan,kara karantawa,ƙari,mahada,wannan mahadar,ƙara koyo,tafi','A link has no text, so a screen reader announces only “link”. Add text or a label.'=>'Haɗin ba shi da rubutu, don haka mai karanta allo zai faɗi kawai "haɗin". Ƙara rubutu ko alama.','The link text “%s” does not say where it goes. Describe the destination instead.'=>'Rubutun da ke kan hanyar sadarwa “%s” bai nuna inda zai kai ba. Maimakon haka, bayyana inda zai je.','An element has a positive tabindex, which changes the keyboard order away from the reading order. Use 0 or remove it.'=>'Wani abu yana da tabindex mai kyau, wanda ke canza tsarin madannai daga tsarin karatu. Yi amfani da 0 ko cire shi.','Something clickable cannot be reached with the keyboard. Use a real button or link.'=>'Ba a iya isa ga abin da ake danna wa ta amfani da madannin kwamfuta. Yi amfani da ainihin maballin ko mahaɗi.','An embedded frame has no title, so a screen reader cannot say what it is.'=>'Ba a ba wa wani ingantaccen tsarin da aka saka take ba, don haka mai karanta allo ba zai iya fadin abin da yake ba.','A form field has no label, so its purpose is not announced.'=>'Wani fili a cikin fom ba shi da lakabi, don haka ba a bayyana manufarsa ba.','This heading is empty. Screen reader users navigate by headings; remove it or add text.'=>'Wannan kan gaba ba komai a ciki. Masu amfani da mai karanta allo suna zirga-zirga ta hanyar kan gaba; cire shi ko ƙara rubutu.','The page title is already the H1; use H2 for the top level of the content.'=>'Sunan shafin riga shine H1; yi amfani da H2 don matakin sama na abubuwan da ke ciki.','This H%1$d skips a level; the one before it is H%2$d. Make it an H%3$d.'=>'Wannan H%1$d yana tsallake mataki ɗaya; wanda ke gabaninsa shine H%2$d. Sanya shi ya zama H%3$d.','This image has no alt text. Describe it, or mark it as decorative if it adds nothing.'=>'Wannan hoton bazuwa da rubutun alt ba. Bayyana shi, ko kuma ka sanya shi a matsayin mai ƙawata idan bai ƙara komai ba.','Close panel'=>'Rufe kwamitin','Desktop'=>'Desktop','Default'=>'Tsohuwa','Every track'=>'Kowane waƙa','Track sizes, for example: 1fr 2fr 200px'=>'Girman waƙa, misali: 1fr 2fr 200px','Custom track sizes'=>'Girman waƙa na al\'ada','Equal tracks'=>'Sauye-sauye daidai','One quoted row per line, for example: "head head" "side main". Name the area on each child block.'=>'An ambato aka nuna a kowane layi, misali: "head head" "side main". Sanya suna a kan kowane yanki na yara.','Automatic'=>'Mai kansa','Square (1:1)'=>'Dandalin (1:1)','Standard (4:3)'=>'Daidai (4:3)','Classic (3:2)'=>'Classic (3:2)','Wide (16:9)'=>'Faɗi (16:9)','Cinema (21:9)'=>'Cinema (21:9)','Tall (9:16)'=>'Tsayi (9:16)','Custom'=>'Na Musamman','Width / height'=>'Faɗin ƙasa / tsayi','Background image'=>'Hoton bango','Inherited image — replace'=>'Hoto da aka gada — maye gurbi','Cover'=>'Murfin hoto','Contain'=>'Ƙunsa','Original size'=>'Asalin girma','Repeat'=>'Maimaita','No repeat'=>'Babu maimaitawa','Tile'=>'Fayil','Tile across'=>'Sanya fannoni a fadin kasa','Tile down'=>'Rufe ƙasa','Fixed while scrolling'=>'An tsayar da shi yayin gungurawa','Solid'=>'Mai ƙarfi','Dashed'=>'Mai ɗigo-ɗigo','Dotted'=>'Mai digiri-digiri','Double'=>'Sau biyu','Each side separately'=>'Kowane gefe daban-daban','Side'=>'Gefe','Add a shadow'=>'Ƙara inuwa','Horizontal'=>'A kwance','Vertical'=>'Tsaye','Blur'=>'Boye','Spread'=>'Yada','Inside'=>'Ciki','Remove this shadow'=>'Cire wannan inuwa','Opacity'=>'Gajiya','Transform'=>'Canza','Shadow'=>'Inuwa','Ease'=>'Sauƙi','Linear'=>'Layi','Ease in'=>'Sauƙaƙa ciki','Ease out'=>'Sauƙaƙa','Ease in and out'=>'Shiga ciki da fita','Duration (milliseconds)'=>'Tsawon lokaci (milliseconds)','What animates'=>'Abin da ke sanya motsi','Easing'=>'Sauƙaƙewa','Delay (milliseconds)'=>'Jinkiri (milliseconds)','Remove the preset'=>'Cire tsarin da aka riga aka saita','More options'=>'Ƙarin zaɓuɓɓuka','Number and unit'=>'Lamba da raka\'a','Custom CSS value (calc, clamp…)'=>'Ƙimar CSS na musamman (calc, clamp…)','Set each side separately'=>'Saita kowane gefe daban','Set all sides together'=>'Saita dukkan gefuna tare','All sides'=>'Duk ɓangarori','Top start'=>'Sama a gefen hagu','Top end'=>'Mafi girma','Bottom start'=>'Kasan farko','Bottom end'=>'Ƙarshen ƙasa','Between rows'=>'Tsakanin layuka','Between columns'=>'Tsakanin shafi da shafi','Choose a preset'=>'Zabi wani wanda aka riga aka tsara','Presets'=>'Tsara kafin lokaci','Preset: %s'=>'Saitin da aka riga aka tsara: %s','Spacing'=>'Sarari','Typography'=>'Rubutun fuskoki','Colours & background'=>'Launuka da bango','Border'=>'Baki','Effects'=>'Tasiri','Motion'=>'Motsi','Advanced'=>'Ci gaba','up to %d px'=>'har zuwa %d px','from %d px'=>'daga %d px','all widths'=>'duk faɗin','Screen size'=>'Girman allo','Hover'=>'Saka linzami a kai','Reset every val