'Column'=>'Shafi\'i','Column reversed'=>'An juya shafi','Grow'=>'Faɗaɗa','Shrink'=>'Ragewa','Wrap'=>'Nade','No wrap'=>'Ba rufe layi','Wrap reversed'=>'A rufe juye','Font'=>'Rubutun rubutu','Italic'=>'Italic','Weight'=>'Nauyi','Thin (100)'=>'Siriri (100)','Extra light (200)'=>'Karami sosai (200)','Light (300)'=>'Haske (300)','Regular (400)'=>'Na yau da kullum (400)','Medium (500)'=>'Matsakaici (500)','Semi bold (600)'=>'Rabin kauri (600)','Bold (700)'=>'Mai kauri (700)','Extra bold (800)'=>'Mafi kauri sosai (800)','Black (900)'=>'Baƙi (900)','Gap'=>'Gibba','Area name'=>'Sunan yankin','Named areas'=>'Wurare masu suna','Offsets'=>'Matsugunni','Justify content'=>'Daidaita abubuwan da ke ciki','Space between'=>'Sarari tsakanin','Space around'=>'Wurin da ke kewaye','Space evenly'=>'Rarraba daidai gwargwado','Letter spacing'=>'Nisa tsakanin haruffa','Line height'=>'Tsawon layi','Margin'=>'Agadi','Max height'=>'Mafi girman tsayi','Max width'=>'Matsakaicin faɗi','Min height'=>'Mafi ƙarancin tsayi','Min width'=>'Karamin faɗi','Overflow'=>'Cika da yawa','Visible'=>'Mai bayyane','Clip'=>'Hada','Scroll when needed'=>'Gungura idan ake buƙata','Always scroll'=>'Koyaushe gungurawa','Padding'=>'Ratasa','Place items'=>'Sanya abubuwa','Relative'=>'Mai alaƙa','Absolute'=>'Cikakke','Fixed'=>'An gyara','Corner radius'=>'Saurin kusurwa','Row span'=>'Matsayin layi','Justify'=>'Daidaita','Decoration'=>'Zane','Overline'=>'Layi a sama','Strikethrough'=>'Sanya linji a tsakiya','Text shadow'=>'Inuwar rubutu','Letter case'=>'Harufan da aka yi amfani da su','Uppercase'=>'Babba baƙaƙe','Lowercase'=>'Ƙananan baƙaƙe','Capitalise'=>'Sanya babban bango','Transition'=>'Sauyawa','Stack order (z-index)'=>'Matsayi da tsari (z-index)','Add screen sizes of your own, such as a large desktop, a landscape tablet or a small phone.'=>'Ƙara girmopin allon naka, kamar babban kwamfutar tebur, kwayar allo mai kwance ko ƙaramin waya.','Applies'=>'Ana amfani da shi','up to a width'=>'har zuwa faɗi','from a width'=>'daga faɗi','Width (px)'=>'Faɗi (px)','Remove this breakpoint'=>'Cire wannan hutu','Large desktop'=>'Babban tebur','Add a breakpoint'=>'Ƙara wurin tsayawa','Radial'=>'Radiyal','Conic'=>'Conic','Angle (degrees)'=>'Kona (digiri)','Ellipse'=>'Madaidaicin Da\'ira','Colour stop %d'=>'Launin tsayawa %d','Position (%)'=>'Matsayi (%)','Remove stop'=>'Cire tasha','Add colour stop'=>'Ƙara tasha launi','Clear gradient'=>'Share ɓarna','Blur behind (px)'=>'Ɗaukar hoto mai dusashewa (px)','Saturation behind (%)'=>'Cikewa a baya (%)','Tint (use a see-through colour)'=>'Waiwayi (yi amfani da launi mai haske)','Blob'=>'Blob','Hexagon'=>'Hexagon','Triangle'=>'Triangle','Diamond'=>'Diamond','Heart'=>'Zuciya','Arch'=>'Arch','Brush stroke'=>'Bugun goga','Mask shape'=>'Sifar maski','Custom image'=>'Hoton da aka keɓance','Replace mask image'=>'Maye gurbin hoton abin rufe fuska','Choose mask image'=>'Zaɓi hoton abin rufe fuska','Fit'=>'Daidaita','Repeat across'=>'Maimaita ko\'ina','Repeat down'=>'Maimaita kasa','Space out'=>'Fitar da sarari','Stretch to fit'=>'Mika don ya dace','Multiply'=>'Ninka','Screen'=>'Allon aiki','Overlay'=>'Shimfiɗa','Darken'=>'Sanya duhu','Lighten'=>'Saukaka','Colour dodge'=>'Firam ɗoji','Colour burn'=>'Kona mai konewa','Hard light'=>'Tsananin haske','Soft light'=>'Haske mai laushi','Difference'=>'Bambanci','Exclusion'=>'Babuwa','Hue'=>'Launi','Saturation'=>'Moraɗa','Luminosity'=>'Haske','Blend mode'=>'Hanyar gaurayawa','Blur (px)'=>'Burciwa (px)','Brightness (%)'=>'Haske (%)','Contrast (%)'=>'Saban (%)','Greyscale (%)'=>'Launin toka (%)','Hue rotation (degrees)'=>'Juuyawar launuka (digiri)','Saturation (%)'=>'Cikewa (%)','Sepia (%)'=>'Sepia (%)','Drop shadow'=>'Inuwa ta baya','Across (px)'=>'Akwai (px)','Down (px)'=>'Kasa (px)','Softness (px)'=>'Laushi (px)','Shadow colour'=>'Launin Inuwa','Remove drop shadow'=>'Cire inuwar faduwa','Applies on every screen size.'=>'Ana amfani da shi a kowane girman allo.','Applies to the screen size chosen in the design panel.'=>'Yana shafa girman allon da aka zaɓa a cikin bangaren zane.','Background gradient'=>'Launin bango mai ɗumi','Add gradient'=>'Ƙara gradient','Glass'=>'Gilashi','Mask'=>'Masko','Filters'=>'Matattara','Wave'=>'Wave','Waves'=>'Waves','Curve'=>'Kankara','Curve (asymmetric)'=>'Curve (asymmetric)','Arc'=>'Baka','Tilt'=>'Karkata','Tilt (layered)'=>'Karkata (ma da yawa)','Triangle (asymmetric)'=>'Uku-uku (wanda ba ya daidaita)','Split'=>'Raba','Zigzag'=>'Zigzag','Mountains'=>'Dutse','Clouds'=>'Gajimare','Drops'=>'Saukarwa','Pyramids'=>'Pyramids','Book'=>'Yi Ajiya','Stairs'=>'Matakala','Fan'=>'Magoya baya','Height (px)'=>'Tsayi (px)','Mirror'=>'Madubi','Invert'=>'Juya','In front of the content'=>'Gaban abubuwan dake ciki','Video file (MP4 / WebM)'=>'Fayil din bidiyo (MP4 / WebM)','Choose MP4 or WebM video'=>'Zaɓi bidiyon MP4 ko WebM','MP4 address'=>'Adireshin MP4','WebM address'=>'Adireshin WebM','YouTube video ID (11 characters)'=>'ID na bidiyon YouTube (haruffa 11)','Vimeo video number'=>'Lambar bidiyon Vimeo','Visitors only contact the video service when they scroll to this section, and never when their device asks for reduced motion. Until then they see the poster image.'=>'Baƙi na tuntuɓar sabis na bidiyo ne kawai lokacin da suka gungura zuwa wannan sashin, kuma ba a taɓa yin hakan ba lokacin da na\'urarsu ta nemi raguwar motsi. Har zuwa lokacin suna ganin hoton faston.','Replace poster image'=>'Maye gurbin hoton mai tallatawa','Choose poster image'=>'Zaɓi hoton bango','Background slideshow'=>'Hoton bango na kallo mai jujjuyawa','Change images'=>'Canza hotuna','Choose at least two images.'=>'Zaɓi aƙalla hotuna biyu.','Seconds per image'=>'Sekon kowace hoto','Slow zoom (Ken Burns)'=>'Jinkiri a hankali (Ken Burns)','Remove slideshow'=>'Cire hotunan nuni','Visitors who ask their device for reduced motion see the first image only.'=>'Masu ziyara da suka roƙi na\'urarsu da ta rage motsi suna ganin hoto na farko kawai.','Section effects'=>'Tasirin sashe','Top divider'=>'Babban mai raba abun ciki','Bottom divider'=>'Rabona ta kasa','Choose the logo'=>'Zabi tambarin','Not set'=>'Ba a saita ba','Check the brand colours: each needs a unique name and a valid colour.'=>'Bincika launukan alamar: kowanne yana buƙatar suna na musamman da kuma ingantaccen launi.','Brand name'=>'Sunan alamar kasuwanci','A logo is chosen.'=>'An zaɓi tambari.','Choose the logo from the Site design page.'=>'Zaɓi tambarin daga shafin Tsarin Yanar Gizo.','Brand colours'=>'Launin alama','Brand %d'=>'Alamar %d','Add brand colour'=>'Ƙara launin alama','Heading font'=>'Font din jigo','Body font'=>'Rubutun jiki','Tone of voice'=>'Salon murya','How your brand writes, e.g. “Friendly and plain, short sentences, no jargon.” The AI follows it whenever it writes for this site.'=>'Yadda alamarku ke rubutu, misali "Abokantaka da sauƙi, gajerun jimloli, ba tare da ƙwarewa mai rikitarwa ba." AI na bin shi a duk lokacin da yake rubuta wa wannan shafin.','Brand kit saved.'=>'An adana kayan aikin alama.','The brand is applied: its colours, fonts and logo are now the site’s.'=>'An yi amfani da alamar kasuwanci: launukanta, rubutunta da tambarinta yanzu sun zama na shafin.','Apply to site'=>'Afa da shafi','All classes'=>'Duk azuzuwan','Class name on the page'=>'Sunan ajji a shafin','Printed as %s.'=>'An buga a matsayin %s.','Start with a letter; lowercase letters, digits and hyphens only.'=>'Fara da harafi; kananan haruffa, lambobi da manyan layuka kawai.','The style controls are not loaded. Reload the page; if this stays, reinstall the plugin.'=>'Ba a loda sarrafa salon ba. Sake loda shafin; idan hakan ta ci gaba, sake shigar da plugin ɗin.','Class saved. Every element using it has the new style.'=>'An ajiye ajin. Kowane bangare da ke amfani da shi yana da sabon salon.','Save class'=>'Ajiye aji','Class created.'=>'An halicci ajin.','New class'=>'Sabon aji','e.g. Card'=>'misali Katin','Create'=>'Ƙirƙira','Search classes'=>'Bincike ajujuwa','No class matches.'=>'Babu ajin da ya dace.','No classes yet. Create one, style it, then add it to any element from its settings.'=>'Babu azuzuwa tukuna. Ka ƙirƙiri ɗaya, ka tsara shi, sannan ka ƙara shi ga kowane abu daga saitunansa.','Edit %s'=>'Gyara %s','Class duplicated.'=>'An kwafi ajin.','Delete %s'=>'Goge %s','Class deleted.'=>'An cire ajujuwa.','Delete the class "%s"? Elements that use it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'Soke ajin "%s"? Abubuwan da ke amfani da shi za su riƙe abubuwansu su rasa salonsu.','Only users who may add unfiltered HTML can change custom CSS.'=>'Masu amfani kawai da za su iya ƙara HTML da ba a taƙaita ba ne za su iya Canza CSS na musamman.','Some of this CSS will not be used: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" and unbalanced braces are removed for safety.'=>'Wasu daga cikin wannan CSS ɗin ba za a yi amfani da su ba: An cire @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, da "<" da kuma maƙallan da ba su da daidaito don dalilan tsaro.','Upload a font'=>'Loda wani font','Uploading fonts needs WordPress 6.5 or later.'=>'Loda fonte yana buƙatar WordPress 6.5 ko kuma wanda ya fi haka.','Font name'=>'Sunan harafi','e.g. Brand Sans'=>'misali Brand Sans','%s is uploaded and ready to use.'=>'An loda %s kuma yana shirye don amfani.','Choose a font file (%s)'=>'Zaɓi fayil ɗin rubutu (%s)','Font library'=>'Laburaren haruffa','%d files'=>'fayiloli %d','Font switched off for the site.'=>'An kashe rubutun ga rukunin yanar gizon.','Font switched on for the site.'=>'An kunna rubutu don shafin.','Switch off'=>'Kashe','Switch on'=>'Kunna','Adobe Fonts'=>'Adobe Fonts','Paste the kit id of your Adobe Fonts web project. Its fonts are then loaded from Adobe on your pages.'=>'Saka lambar kit din aikin Adobe Fonts na yanar gizo. Sannan a loda font ɗinsa daga Adobe a shafukanka.','Your web projects'=>'Ayyukan gidan yanar gizonku','Adobe Fonts connected.'=>'An haɗa Adobe Fonts.','Adobe Fonts disconnected.'=>'An cire Adobe Fonts.','Kit id'=>'ID ɗin kayan aiki','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'Kasar duhu na "%s" ba ta da inganci launin gaske.','When a visitor has not chosen'=>'Lokacin da ba a zaɓi baƙo','Follow the visitor’s device'=>'Bi na\'urar mai ziyara','Dark colours'=>'Launin duhu','Give each colour its dark version. Colours left empty stay the same in both schemes. Dark mode is on as soon as one colour has a dark value.'=>'Ba kowane launi sigarsa ta duhu ba. Launukan da aka bari babu komai za su kasance iri ɗaya a jeri biyu. Yanayin duhu yana aiki da zaran launi ɗaya ya sami ƙimar duhu.','Dark version of %s'=>'Sigar duhu ta %s','Dark mode saved.'=>'An adana yanayin duhu.','Page CSS'=>'Shafin CSS','Global classes'=>'Azuzu na duniya gaba ɗaya','Classes'=>'Azuzu','Create classes in Site design, then add them here.'=>'Ƙirƙiri azuzuwa a cikin Tsarin shafin, sannan ka ƙara su anan.','Custom CSS'=>'CSS na Musamman','Write rules for this element. "selector" means this element, e.g. selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — plain declarations apply to the element itself.'=>'Rubuta dokoki don wannan abin. "selector" yana nufin wannan abin, misali selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — bayyanannun sanarwa suna aiki ne akan abin da kansa.','Font files must be %s.'=>'Dole fayilolin rubutu su kasance %s.','That font file is empty or larger than 10 MB.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin rubutun babu komai a ciki ko kuma ya fi MB 10.','Style once, reuse everywhere, change in one place.'=>'Sanya salon sau ɗaya, sake amfani da shi ko\'ina, ka canza a wuri guda.','Variables'=>'Canje-canje','Named values any element can use.'=>'Ƙimar da aka sanya wa suna wadda kowane abu zai iya amfani da ita.','Spacing, radius and shadows'=>'Ratse, da\'ira da inuwa','The scales every spacing, corner and shadow picker offers.'=>'Ma\'aunin da kowane zabin sarari, kusurwa da inuwa ke bayarwa.','A dark version of your colours, for visitors who want it.'=>'Wani sigar launukanka mai duhu, ga baƙi masu son shi.','Logo, colours, fonts and tone of voice, used by the AI and templates.'=>'Alamar, launi, haruffa da sautin murci, waɗanda AI da samfura ke amfani da su.','Upload your own fonts or connect Adobe Fonts.'=>'Sanya naka rubutun ko kuma ka haɗa da Adobe Fonts.','CSS for this page only.'=>'CSS don ga wannan shafin kawai.','CSS for this page'=>'CSS don wannan shafi','Loaded only on this page, after the site’s styles. Saved with the page.'=>'An loda shi a kan wannan shafi kawai, bayan salon rukunin yanar gizon. An adana shi tare da shafin.','Short name'=>'Takaitaccen suna','The short name "%s" is used twice.'=>'An gajeren sunan "%s" an yi amfani da shi sau biyu.','"%s": short names use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s": gajerun sunaye suna amfani da kananan haruffa, lambobi da kuma Alamomin raba kalmomi.','The value of "%s" is not one this setting accepts.'=>'Darajar "%s" ba ta kasance ɗaya daga cikin waɗanda wannan saitin ke karɓa ba.','Radius'=>'Radius','Add a step'=>'Ƙara mataki daya','Scales saved.'=>'An adana sikelin.','Scales are back to the defaults.'=>'An koma da sikelin zuwa tsoffin tsarin.','Reset to the default scales'=>'Sake saiti zuwa ma\'auni na asali','No variables yet. A variable holds one value — a width, a colour mix, a font size — that many elements share.'=>'Babu ma\'auni tukuna. Ma\'auni yana riƙe da ƙima guda ɗaya — faɗi, cakuda launi, girmansa — wanda abubuwa da yawa ke rabawa.','Add variable'=>'Ƙara maɓalli','Variables saved.'=>'An adana sauye-sauye.','Entrance animation'=>'Hoton shigarwa','Fade in'=>'Fade in','Fade in, rising'=>'Kashe a hankali, yana tashi','Fade in, dropping'=>'Fade a cikin raguwa','Fade in from the start side'=>'Fade in daga gefen farko','Fade in from the end side'=>'Fade in daga ɓangaren ƙarshe','Zoom out'=>'Sauke girma','Flip up'=>'Juya sama','Animation length (ms)'=>'Tsawon motsi (ms)','Animation delay (ms)'=>'Lokacin jinkirin motsi (ms)','While scrolling'=>'Yayin gungurawa','Fade in as it scrolls into view'=>'Fara fitowa yayin da yake gungurawa ya bayyana a kan allo','Rise as it scrolls into view'=>'Tashi yayin da yake gungurawa cikin gani','Grow as it scrolls into view'=>'Girra yayin da yake bayyana a allon','Straighten as it scrolls into view'=>'Maimaita yayin da yake bayyana a allon','On hover'=>'A lokacin da aka sanya linzami a kai','Lift'=>'Ɗaga','Glow'=>'Glow','Stay in view (px from the top)'=>'Kasance a gani (px daga sama)','Parallax speed (-10 to 10)'=>'Gudun Parallax (-10 zuwa 10)','Follow the pointer (strength)'=>'Bi ma\'ajiyar (ƙarfi)','Place ID'=>'Wurin ID','Find it with Google’s Place ID finder: search for your business and copy the ID.'=>'Nemo shi ta amfani da mai binciken Place ID na Google: bincika kasuwancin ku sannan ku kwafi ID ɗin.','An API key from your Google Cloud project with the Places API (New) enabled. Restrict it to that API.'=>'Maɓallin API daga aikin ku na Google Cloud tare da Places API (New) da aka kunna. Takaita shi zuwa wannan API din.','Business unit ID'=>'ID na sashin kasuwanci','The 24-character ID of your business on Trustpilot, from your Trustpilot Business account (Integrations › API).'=>'ID ɗin haruffa 24 na kasuwancin ku akan Trustpilot, daga asusun ajiyar ku na Trustpilot Business (Integrations › API).','The API key of your Trustpilot Business account.'=>'Maɓallin API na asusunka na Trustpilot Business.','Not set up.'=>'Ba a saita ba.','The saved key can no longer be read (the site’s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ba za a iya karanta maɓallin da aka adana ba (an sauya maɓallin tsaro na shafin). Shigar da shi sake.','Needs both an ID and an API key.'=>'Yana buƙatar ID da kuma maɓallin API.','Set up. Google reviews are loaded live each time a page with a Reviews block is viewed: one Place Details request on your own key per view, never stored (Google’s terms do not allow keeping them).'=>'Saita. Ana loda sharhi na Google kai tsaye a duk lokacin da aka kalli shafi mai dauke da tubalin Sharhi: buƙatar Bayanin Wuri ɗaya a kan maɓallan ku a kowace kallo, ba a taɓa adana su ba (sharuɗɗan Google ba sa ba da damar riƙe su ba).','The first refresh failed: %s'=>'Wurin sabuntawa na farko ya gaza: %s','Waiting for the first refresh (within a minute or two).'=>'Ana jiran sabuntawa ta farko (cikin minti daya ko biyu).','Refreshed %1$s: %2$d reviews kept, rated %3$s from %4$d.'=>'An sabunta %1$s: An adana bita %2$d, an ba shi matsayi %3$s daga cikin %4$d.','The last try, %1$s, failed and the reviews above were kept: %2$s'=>'Kokari na karshe, %1$s, ya gaza kuma an kiyaye bitar da ke sama: %2$s','Saved. Trustpilot reviews are fetched in the background within a minute or two; Google reviews load live on the page.'=>'An adana. Ana karɓo sharhin Trustpilot a bango cikin minti ɗaya ko biyu; sharhin Google na lodi kai tsaye a shafin.','Trustpilot reviews are fetched once a day in the background and kept on your site, so a busy page costs nothing extra on your Trustpilot account; if a refresh fails, the last reviews stay. Google does not allow its reviews to be stored, so they are loaded live when a visitor views the page: each view is one request on your own Google key, billed by Google.'=>'Ana samo bituttukan Trustpilot sau ɗaya a rana a bango a kuma ajiye su a kan shafinka, don haka shafi mai aiki tuƙuru ba ya biyan ko sisi a asusunka na Trustpilot; idan sabuntawa ta gaza, bituttukan da suka gabata suna nan. Google ba ya ƙyale a adana bituttukansa, don haka ana ɗora su kai tsaye lokacin da baƙo ya kalli shafin: kowane gani buƙata ce ɗaya a kan maɓallin Google ɗinka, wanda Google ke caji.','Where to find it'=>'Inda za a samo shi','Saved (…%s). Type a new one to replace it.'=>'An adana (…%s). Rubuta sabo don maye gurbin sa.','Remove the %s details and its reviews'=>'Cire cikakkun bayanai na %s da bitar su','Refreshed.'=>'An sabunta.','Refresh now'=>'Sake sabunta yanzu','Next daily refresh: %s.'=>'Sabuntawar yau da kullum ta gaba: %s.','Your Google and Trustpilot details, for the Reviews block.'=>'Bayanan ku na Google da Trustpilot, don bangaren sharhi.','No colours yet.'=>'Babu launuka tukuna.','Colour %d'=>'Launi %d','Add colour'=>'Ƙara launi','Two colours have the same name. Rename one.'=>'Launi biyu suna da sunan iri ɗaya. Sake wa ɗaya suna.','"%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'"%s" ba launi ne mai inganci ba.','Theme colours'=>'Launukan jigo','Your theme’s palette. A change here is saved as your site’s version of the colour, the same way the Site Editor saves it, and applies everywhere the colour is used.'=>'Falettar jigon ku. Canji a nan ana adana shi azaman sigar rini ta shafin ku, ta daidai yadda Editan Shafin ke adana shi, kuma yana aiki a ko\'ina inda aka yi amfani da rinin.','Theme colours are back to the theme’s own values.'=>'Launi na jigo sun koma ga kansa na jigo.','Reset theme colours'=>'Sake saitin launukan jigo','Your colours'=>'Launukanka','Colours saved.'=>'An adana launuka.','Pick a colour for %s'=>'Zaɓi launi don %s','Clear'=>'Sharege','The change could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana sauyi ba.','Theme default'=>'An tsoffin jigo','Theme fonts'=>'Fontunan jigo','Your fonts'=>'Rubutunka na asali','Font stack'=>'Jerin haruffa','Uploaded font: its files come from the font library.'=>'Font da aka loda: fayilolinsa sun fito ne daga ɗakin karatu na font.','System sans-serif'=>'Tsarin sans-serif','Add font stack'=>'Ƙara tarin font','Fonts saved.'=>'An adana rubutun.','Shared with your theme and the Site Editor.'=>'An raba shi da jigon ku da Editan Shafin.','Fonts'=>'Fontuna','Heading and body fonts for the whole site.'=>'Rubutun shugaba da na jiki ga dukan shafin yanar gizon.','Back to Site design'=>'Komawa zuwa Tsarin shafin','Classes, tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts come with Pro'=>'Aji, alamomi, yanayin duhu, kayan aikin alama da rubutun hannu na musamman sun zo tare da Pro','Open the Site Editor’s styles'=>'Buɗe salon Editan Shafin','A heading with a tighter line height, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Wani kan gaba mai takaitaccen tsayin layi, wanda aka tsara da shafin Salo.','A paragraph of text, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Wani sakin layi na rubutu, wanda aka tsara tare da shafin Salo.','An image with rounded corners, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Wani hoto mai karkatattun kusurwoyi, wanda aka tsara tare da shafin Salo.','A video from the Media Library, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Wani bidiyo daga Laburaren Kafofin Watsa Labarai, wanda aka tsara da shafin Salo.','Spacer'=>'Wuri','Empty space between blocks; set a different height per screen size in the Style tab.'=>'Bakin sarari tsakanin tubalan; saita tsayin da ya bambanta a kowane girman allo a shafin Salo.','Divider'=>'Masu rarrabewa','A horizontal line between sections, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Wani layi a kwance tsakanin sassa, wanda aka tsara da shafin Style.','Content from another site (a video, a post, a map) by pasting its address.'=>'Abubuwa daga wani shafi (bidiyo, sakon, taswira) ta hanyar liƙa adireshinsa.','Several images in a grid, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Hotuna da yawa a cikin wani gajeren layi, an tsara su da shafin Style.','Plain'=>'Na yau da kullum','No languages to switch between. The switcher appears when a translation plugin lists two or more languages.'=>'Babu harsunan da za a iya canzawa tsakaninsu. Maɓallin canza harshe yana bayyana ne lokacin da wani kari na fassara ya lissafa harsuna biyu ko fiye.','Switcher'=>'Mai canzawa','Show the current language'=>'Nuna harshen da ake ciki yanzu','Install Tranzly and list two or more languages, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Shigar da Tranzly kuma ka sanya jerin harsuna biyu ko fiye, kuma za a nuna mai canza harshen anan.','Pills'=>'Kwayoyi','Dropdown'=>'Menu mai sauka','Language codes'=>'Lambar Harsuna','Show each language as'=>'Nuna kowane harshe a matsayin','Language name'=>'Sunan harshe','Language code'=>'Lamba harshe','Name and code'=>'Suna da lamba','Flags'=>'Alamar saƙo','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'A kashe yake a asali: tuta kasa ce, ba harshe ba.','Include the current language'=>'Haɗa da harshen yanzu','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Boye da harsunan da ba a fassara wannan shafin zuwa gare su ba','Stack vertically'=>'Ajiye a tsaye','Current language text'=>'Harshen da ake ciki a yanzu','Current language background'=>'Bayanin yaren da ake ciki a yanzu','Size and spacing'=>'Girma da tazara','Space between languages'=>'Sarari tsakanin harsuna','Text size'=>'Girman rubutu','Connected (key %s).'=>'An haɗa (key %s).','API URL'=>'Adireshi na API','Replace the API key'=>'Maye gurbin maɓallin API','Where to find your %s API key'=>'Inda za a sami maɓallin API na %s','Check and save'=>'Bincika kuma a adana','Connect a mailing-list service once; then any form can add the people who fill it in to one of your lists (the form block\'s settings → After sending). Keys are checked with the service, stored encrypted on this site and never shown again.'=>'Haɗa sabis na jerin masu karɓar sakon imel sau ɗaya; sannan kowane fom zai iya ƙara mutanen da suka cika shi zuwa ɗaya daga cikin jerin sunayenku (saitunan tubalin fom → Bayan an aika). Ana bincika maɓallan tare da sabis ɗin, a adana su a rufe a kan wannan shafin kuma ba a sake nuna su ba.','Send form submissions and button clicks to your analytics with no code. Leave an ID empty to skip that service. Buttons get a "Conversion event" field in their Advanced panel. With the cookie banner on, nothing loads until the visitor agrees.'=>'Aika da bayanan da aka cika a fom da kuma danna maballin zuwa ga kayan aikin nazarinka ba tare da lamba ba. Bar ID mara kyau don tsallake wancan sabis ɗin. Maɓallan suna samun filin "Conversion event" a cikin sashin Ci gaba. Tare da tutar kuki a kunne, babu abin da ke lodawa har sai mai ziyara ya yarda.','Google Analytics 4 measurement ID'=>'ID na awo na Google Analytics 4','Google Tag Manager container ID'=>'ID na akwati na Google Tag Manager','Meta Pixel ID (the number shown in Meta Events Manager)'=>'Meta Pixel ID (lambar da aka nuna a cikin Meta Events Manager)','Load these tags on my site'=>'Sanya waɗannan alamomin a shafina','Switch off if your theme or another plugin already adds them; events are still sent.'=>'Kashe idan jigonka ko wani kari ya riga ya ƙara su; ana ci gaba da tura abubuwan da suka faru.','Event name for form submissions'=>'Sunan taron don mika fom','The banner is a popup you design with blocks. Its buttons link to #consent-accept, #consent-reject and #consent-save (with tick boxes named analytics and marketing for "save"); a link to #consent-open anywhere shows it again. Until a visitor accepts, tracking tags do not load, Google Consent Mode stays "denied", and the scripts you list stay switched off.'=>'Banner din pop-up ne wanda kake tsarawa da tubalan gini. Maɓallan sa suna da alaƙa da #consent-accept, da #consent-reject, da #consent-save (tare da akwatunan sa hannu masu suna analytics da marketing don "save"); hanyar haɗi zuwa #consent-open ko ina ta sake nuna shi. Har sai wani baƙo ya karɓa, alamomin bibiya ba sa lodi, Google Consent Mode yana kasancewa "denied", kuma rubutun da kuka lissafa suna kasancewa a kashe.','Create a ready-made banner'=>'Ƙirƙiri tuta mai sauƙi','Show a cookie banner'=>'Nuna tutar kuki','Banner'=>'Banner','Choose a popup…'=>'Zabi taga...','%s (draft)'=>'%s (daftari)','Edit the banner'=>'Gyara tuta','Remember the choice for (days)'=>'Ka tuna da zabi na tsawon (days)','Outside the European Union, the EEA and the UK: load tracking until the visitor says no'=>'A wajen Tarayyar Turai, EEA da UK: loda bin diddigiki har sai mai ziyara ya ce a\'a','Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor\'s country (for example Cloudflare\'s CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.'=>'Kashe: dole ne kowane baƙo ya yarda da farko (mafi tsananin doka, kuma tsohuwa). Kunna: kawai lokacin da mai masaukin ku ko CDN ya ba da rahoton ƙasar baƙon (misali kanun labarai na Cloudflare na CF-IPCountry) kuma tana wajen EU, EEA, UK da Switzerland. Har yanzu ana nuna tutar, kuma ana ɗaukar ƙasar da ba a sani ba a matsayin tana cikin EU.','Other scripts to hold until consent (handle:analytics or handle:marketing, comma separated)'=>'Wasu rubututtuka da za a riƙe har sai an samu izini (handle:analytics ko handle:marketing, an raba su da waƙafi)','Popups, slide-ins and bars'=>'Popups, slide-ins da bars','A/B test results'=>'Sakamakon gwajin A/B','Guides: forms, popups, motion, tracking, A/B tests and the cookie banner'=>'Jagorori: fom, faifan pop-up, motsi, bibiya, gwaje-gwajen A/B da kuma tutar kuki','Mailing-list connections'=>'Haɗin jerin imel','Popup settings'=>'Saitunan pop-up','Popup (in the middle, page dimmed)'=>'Pop-up (a tsakiya, shafin ya yi duhu)','Slide-in (in a corner)'=>'Fitarwa ta gefe (a wani karshe)','Bar (top or bottom)'=>'Kayan aiki (sama ko ƙasa)','Bottom, end side'=>'Kasan gefe','Bottom, start side'=>'Kasan sama, gefen farko','When the page loads'=>'Lokacin da shafin ya loda','After a delay'=>'Bayan jinkiri','After scrolling part of the page'=>'Bayan an yi gwanshon wani bangare na shafin','When the visitor is about to leave'=>'Lokacin da mai ziyara ke shirin tafiwa','When something is clicked'=>'Lokacin da aka danna wani abu','Percent of the page'=>'Kaso na shafin','CSS selector of the element'=>'Sunan zaɓe na CSS na abin da ke ciki','How often'=>'Sau nawa','Every page view'=>'Duk kallon shafi','Once per visit'=>'Sau ɗaya a kowane ziyara','Once every few days'=>'Sau ɗaya a kwanaki kaɗan','Until the visitor converts'=>'Har sai mai ziyara ya mayar da hankali','Every page'=>'Kowane shafi','The front page'=>'Shafi na gaba','Chosen pages (IDs)'=>'Shafukan da aka zaɓa (IDs)','Chosen content types'=>'Abubuwan da aka zaɓa','Page IDs, comma separated'=>'ID na shafuka, wanda aka raba da waƙafi','Content types, comma separated (post, page, product)'=>'Nau\'ikan abubuwa, an raba su da waƙafi (post, page, product)','Devices'=>'Na\'urori','Desktop only'=>'Kiraftar kwamfuta kawai','Mobile only'=>'Wayar hannu kadai','Close when the dimmed page is clicked'=>'Rufe lokacin da aka danna shafin da ya yi duhu','Link a button to #popup-close to close the popup, or to #popup-convert to count a conversion.'=>'Haɗa maɓalli zuwa #popup-close don rufe fita-ta-zo-na-fita, ko zuwa #popup-convert don ƙidaya juyawa.','Conversion event'=>'Lamarin juyawa','Sent to your analytics when this is clicked (for example sign_up). Set up the services under Page Builder Sandwich → Marketing.'=>'An tura zuwa ga fashin bayananku lokacin da aka danna wannan (misali sign_up). Sanya ayyukan a ƙarƙashin Page Builder Sandwich → Marketing.','AI agents are allowed. Reload this page to see the tools.'=>'An halasta wakilan AI. Sake lodi wannan shafin don ganin kayan aikin.','AI agents are turned off. Their connection address no longer answers.'=>'An kashe wakilan AI. Adreshin su na haɗi ba ya amsa kuma.','%s is also editing this page. Saving may overwrite their changes.'=>'%s yana gyara wannan shafin kuma. Ajiye zai iya rubuta a kan gyare-gyarensa.','Block library'=>'Laburaren buloka','Layers'=>'Taruka','Page canvas'=>'Filin shafi','Revisions'=>'Gyare-gyare','Block settings'=>'Saitunan katange','Add block: %s'=>'Ƙara tubali: %s','Open in Studio: %s'=>'Buɗe a Studio: %s','Undo'=>'Sake dawo da shi','Redo'=>'Sake yi','Show or hide layers'=>'Nuna ko ɓoye yadudduka','Show or hide the block library'=>'Nuna ko ɓoye ɗakin karatu na bulolin','Show revisions'=>'Nuna gyare-gyare','Open the normal editor'=>'Buɗe edita na al\'ada','Keyboard shortcuts'=>'Gajerun hanyoyin madannai','Preview: desktop'=>'Dubawa: kwamfutar tafi-da-gidanka','Preview: tablet'=>'Dubawa: kwamfutar hannu','Preview: mobile'=>'Gani a wayar hannu:','Copy style of the selected block'=>'Kwafi salin zababben tubalin','Paste style onto the selected block'=>'Liya sanyin salon a kan zababben tubalin','Copy the selected section'=>'Kwafi sashin da aka zaɓa','Paste a copied section'=>'Liƙa sashen da aka kwafi','Turn off safe mode'=>'Kashe yanayin aminci','Turn on safe mode (other plugins off, for you, in Studio only)'=>'Kunna yanayin aminci (sauran ɗorawa a kashe, a gare ka, a Studio kaɗai)','Scheduled'=>'An tsara','Pending review'=>'Ana jiran dubawa','Private'=>'Maigirma','Draft'=>'Da-aka-tsara','All changes saved'=>'An adana duk sauye-sauye','Saving…'=>'Ana adanawa...','Autosaving…'=>'Ana adanawa ta atomatik…','Unsaved changes'=>'Canjin da ba a ajiyewa ba','autosaved'=>'an adana ta atomatik','Desktop preview'=>'Samfurin kwamfuta ta tebur','Tablet preview'=>'Dubawar kwamfutar tafi-da-gidanka','Mobile preview'=>'Duban wayar hannu','%1$s preview (%2$d px)'=>'Misalin %1$s (%2$d px)','Studio toolbar'=>'Sandar kayan aiki ta Studio','Back to the normal editor'=>'Koma zuwa edita na al\'ada','Page title'=>'Sunan shafi','Preview width'=>'Fadin samfoti','Command palette'=>'Kundin umarni','View page (opens in a new tab)'=>'Duba shafi (yana buɗe a cikin sabon shafi)','Save draft'=>'Ajiye daftari','Publish'=>'Bugawa','Restore unsaved changes?'=>'Sake dawo da canjin da ba a ajiyee ba?','This page has changes that were never saved. They were kept in this browser:'=>'Wannan shafin yana da canje-canjen da ba a taba adana su ba. An kiyaye su a cikin wannan burauz din:','This page has a newer autosave than the saved version:'=>'Wannan shafin yana da sabon kwafin da aka adana ta atomatik fiye da sigar da aka adana:','Restore unsaved changes'=>'Mayar da canje-canjen da ba a ajiyewa ba','Discard'=>'Kora da shi','Revisions could not be loaded.'=>'Ba a iya loda gyare-gyaren ba.','Revision restored. Save to keep it, or undo to go back.'=>'An dawo da fasalin da aka gyara. Ajiye don riƙe shi, ko a soke don komawa baya.','Close revisions'=>'Rufe bita','No revisions yet. Each save makes one.'=>'Ba a yi gyare-gyare ba tukuna. Kowace adanawa tana ƙirƙirar ɗaya.','Revision from %s'=>'Revision daga %s','Restore this revision'=>'Maido da wannan bita','Safe mode could not be changed.'=>'Ba aweza canza yanayin aminci ba.','Safe mode is on.'=>'Yanayin tsaro yana kunne.','%d other plugin is switched off, for you and in Sandwich Studio only. The live site and other users are not affected.'=>'An kashe wani plug-in %d daban, domin ku kadai kuma a cikin Sandwich Studio kadai. Wannan ba zai shafi raddadin rukunin yanar gizo na gaske da sauran masu amfani ba.' . "\0" . 'Wasu plugins %d an kashe su, domin ku da kuma a Sandwich Studio kadai. Ba a shafar shafin da ke aiki da sauran masu amfani ba.','Safe mode: switch other plugins off in Studio, for you only'=>'Yanayin lafiya: kashe sauranfulojoji a cikin Studio, don ku kadai','Save as pattern'=>'Ajiye azaman tsari','Synced'=>'An daidaita','Editing the pattern later changes it everywhere it is used.'=>'Gyara tsarin daga baya zai canza shi a ko\'ina a cikin amfani.','Each copy can be edited on its own.'=>'Ana iya gyara kowane kwafi da kansa.','Save your changes.'=>'Ajiye canje-canjenku.','Undo your last change.'=>'Sake dawo da sauye-kayenku na ƙarshe.','Redo your last undo.'=>'Maimaita abin da ka soke na karshe.','Show or hide the layers panel.'=>'Nuna ko ɓoye kwamitin yadudduka.','Display these keyboard shortcuts.'=>'Nuna waɗannan gajerun hanyoyin madannai.','Select a block first.'=>'Zaɓi buloka tukuna.','Style copied. Paste it onto any block, on this site or another.'=>'An kwafi salon. Manna shi a kan kowane buloku, a kan wannan shafin ko wani.','The browser refused to copy.'=>'Mai binciken ya ki kwafi.','Section copied. Paste it into any page, on this site or another.'=>'An kwafi sashen. Manna shi a kowane shafi, a wannan shafin ko wani.','The clipboard does not hold a style copied from Sandwich Studio.'=>'Ba a adana salon da aka kwafi daga Sandwich Studio a cikin allo ba.','Style pasted onto %d block.'=>'Salon da aka manna a kan tubali %d.' . "\0" . 'An shafa salo a kan tubalan %d.','That style does not fit the selected block.'=>'Wannan salon bai dace da katangar da aka zaɓa ba.','The