p)'=>'Wannan sahun (cikin madauwirin fili)','Fill “%s” from'=>'Cika “%s” daga','Nothing (typed in)'=>'Babu (an rubuta ba)','Use it as a link or image address'=>'Yi amfani da shi azaman mahaɗi ko adireshin hoto','Dynamic content'=>'Abubuwan da ke canzawa a kowane lokaci','Fill this block from the post, its author, the site or a custom field. Inside a query loop, each card shows its own item.'=>'Cika wannan ginshiƙi daga rubutun, marubucin sa, shafin ko filin da aka keɓance. A cikin madaukin bincike, kowane kati yana nuna nasa abun.','Template'=>'Samfuri','This template is a'=>'Wannan samfurin shine','Start from a ready-made design'=>'Fara daga tsarin da aka riga aka tsara','Show it on'=>'Nuna shi a kan','No conditions: everywhere this type of template applies.'=>'Babu sharadi: ko\'ina wannan nau\'in samfurin yana aiki.','But not on'=>'Amma ba a kan','Add exception'=>'Ƙara keɓewa','Priority'=>'Fifiko','When two templates match the same page, the higher priority wins.'=>'Lokacin da samfura biyu suka dace da shafi ɗaya, wanda yake da fifiko mafi girma shi ne ke nasara.','Show this block when'=>'Nuna wannan bango lokacin da','All conditions are met'=>'An cika dukkan sharuɗɗan','Any condition is met'=>'Duk wani sharadi ya cika','This block always shows. Add a condition to show it only to some visitors, on some pages or at some times.'=>'Wannan ɓangaren yana nunawa ko da ya eke. Ƙara wani sharaɗi domin nuna shi kawai ga wasu baƙi, a kan wasu shafuka ko a wasu lokuta.','Maintenance and pre-launch mode'=>'Kulawa da yanayin kafin kaddamarwa','What visitors see'=>'Abin da baƙi ke gani','The site, as normal'=>'Yanar gizo, kamar yadda yake a yanzu','Maintenance: a notice, and search engines are told to come back later'=>'Gyara: sanarwa, kuma an gaya wa injunan bincike su dawo daga baya','Pre-launch: a notice, and search engines are told not to index the site'=>'Kafin ƙaddamarwa: sanarwa, kuma an gaya wa injunan bincike kada su sanya shafin a cikin lissafin su','Page to show instead'=>'Shafin da za a nuna a maimakon haka','Design any page with the builder and choose it here. Without one, visitors see a short notice with the site’s name.'=>'Tsara kowane shafi tare da mai ginawa kuma ka zaba shi anan. Ba tare da shi ba, baƙi za su ga ɗan sanarwa tare da sunan shafin yanar gizon.','Who still sees the real site (administrators always do):'=>'Wane ne har yanzu yake ganin ainihin shafin (masu gudanarwa koyaushe suna ganinsa):','Open the site in a private window to see what visitors see.'=>'Buɗe rukunin yanar gizon a cikin taga mai zaman kansa don ganin abin da baƙi ke gani.','Network settings saved.'=>'An adana saitunan hanyar sadarwa.','These settings apply to the %d site in this network.'=>'Wadannan saitunan suna a aiki ga shafin %d a cikin wannan hanyar sadarwa.' . "\0" . 'Wadannan saitunan suna a shafuka %d da ke cikin wannan hanyar sadarwa.','Shared templates'=>'Samfuran da aka raba','Patterns saved on the main site that are ticked here appear on every site, under “Network templates”. Each site inserts its own copy.'=>'Tsarin da aka adana a babban sahit ɗin da aka yi wa alama a nan suna bayyana a kowane sahit, ƙarƙashin “Network templates”. Kowane sahit yana sanya nasa kofi.','The main site has no saved patterns yet.'=>'Babban rukunin yanar gizon ba shi da tsarin da aka adana tukuna.','White label for every site'=>'Farar alama ga kowane shafi','Used by every site that has not saved its own white-label settings.'=>'Kowace shafin da bai adana nasa saitunan alamar fari ba yana amfani da shi.','Turn white label on'=>'Kunna alamar farar fata','Builder name'=>'Sunan mai ginawa','Visual editor name'=>'Sunan editan gani','Author website'=>'Shafin marubuci','Menu icon'=>'Alamar menu','Role defaults for every site'=>'Matsakaicin matsayi na kowace shafi','Save network settings'=>'Ajiye saitunan hanyar sadarwa','Searching… %d item checked so far.'=>'Ana bincike... An duba abu %d kawo yanzu.' . "\0" . 'Ana bincike… Abubuwa %d aka duba kawo yanzu.','No matches in %d items. Nothing to replace.'=>'Ba a sami sakamako a cikin abubuwa %d ba. Babu abin da za a maye gurbinsa.','%1$d matches on %2$d pages (%3$d items searched). Nothing has changed yet.'=>'Wasanni %1$d a shafuka %2$d (an bincika abubuwa %3$d). Babu wani abu da ya canza tukuna.','Replacing… %1$d of %2$d pages done.'=>'Ana maye gurbi… An kammala shafuka %1$d cikin %2$d.','Done: %d page changed. You can undo this.'=>'An gama: An canza shafi %d. Kuna iya juya wannan baya.' . "\0" . 'An gama: shafuka %d sun canza. Kuna iya soke wannan.','Undoing…'=>'Ana soke wa...','Undone: %1$d pages restored. %2$d pages were edited after the replacement and were left as they are.'=>'Ba a yi ba: An dawo da shafuka %1$d. An gyara shafuka %2$d bayan maye gurbin kuma an bar su kamar yadda suke.','Undone: %d page restored.'=>'An cire: An dawo da shafi %d.' . "\0" . 'Ba a yi ba: An dawo da shafuka %d.','Replace'=>'Maye gurbi','Find'=>'Nemo','A hex colour such as #1a73e8. Short forms (#fff) match too.'=>'Wani launi na hex kamar #1a73e8. Gajerun sigogi (#fff) ma sun dace.','Replace with'=>'Canza da','Match upper and lower case'=>'Daidaita babban bakin rubutu da ƙarami','Find matches'=>'Nemo daidaito','Matches'=>'Wadanda Suka Dace','Replace on %d page'=>'Maye gurbi a shafi na %d' . "\0" . 'Maye gurbi a shafuka %d','Undo this replacement'=>'Mayar da wannan sauye-sauyen','Review comments'=>'Sake bita','Add a comment'=>'Ƙara sharhi','Comment %1$d by %2$s: %3$s'=>'Sharhi %1$d daga %2$s: %3$s','%d comments on this page.'=>'Sharhi %d a wannan shafin.','Your comment'=>'Sharhinku','Send comment'=>'Aiko da tsokaci','Thank you, your comment was sent.'=>'Na gode, an aika da ra\'ayin ku.','Click the part of the page your comment is about.'=>'Danna ɓangaren shafin da sharhin ku ke kansa.','Client review'=>'Binciken abokin ciniki','That part of the page could not be found: it may have been changed or removed since the comment was made.'=>'Ba a iya samun waccan sashi na shafin ba: yana yiwuwa an canza